mage: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				1</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				2</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				1</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				4</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: baseline;\">\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				Russia</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				--</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				2</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				1</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				3</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: baseline;\">\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				Sud Africa</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				--</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				1</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				--</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				1</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: baseline;\">\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				Hungery</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				-</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				--</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				3</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				3</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: baseline;\">\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				GBR</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				--</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				--</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				1</td>\r\n			<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 5px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\r\n				1</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br />\r\nInizio della competizione, venerd&igrave; 2 agosto con la specialit&agrave; di Vertical Kilometer D+1000m e sviluppo 3,5km. La partenza a cronometro vedr&agrave; di nuovo al via i milgiori giovani al mondo, confrontarsi sulla prima delle due prove in programma.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDomenica mattina &egrave; il turno della specialit&agrave; Skyrace, con D+2226m e sviluppo di 21.6 km. La vetta massima, di Pizzo Cefalone (2533m slm), vedr&agrave; i giovani Skyrunners percorrere i sentieri montani del <a href=\"http://www.gransassolagapark.it/\">Parco Nazionale del Gran Sasso e Monti della Laga</a>&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDopo il termine delle competizioni, foto e premiazioni di rito.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/gare/Mondiali_U23_2018/IMG_5912.jpg\" style=\"width: 620px; height: 413px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\nAppuntamento alle prossime News, riguardanti iscritti e curiosit&agrave; legate al mondo giovanile dello Skyrunning moderno.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nla FISky', 'Campionati Mondiali U23', 'http://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/gare/Mondiali_U23_2018/Sito_2_620_380.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2019-02-20 16:45:11', '2019-08-02 12:09:17', NULL, 1),
(86, 'AttivitÃ  paralimpica', 'Cari Skyrunners,<br />\r\n&egrave; con piacere che si comuncia la circolare normativa relativa alle attivit&agrave; ufficiali del settore paralimpico dello Skyrunning<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/5D3_7883.jpg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 427px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"http://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Normative\">Qui</a> la circolare<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/Moreno_e_Leandro.jpg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 425px;\" /><br />\r\nNella foto il primo binomio, anno 2016', 'L\'attivitÃ  paralimpica fa il suo esordio ufficiale nello Skyrunning', 'http://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/SassoRossoxSito.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2019-06-06 09:34:54', '2019-06-06 09:55:37', NULL, 1);
