gb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\"><strong>Categoria M55/F55</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Donne: <strong>MATTABONI ENRICA</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\"><strong>Categoria M60/F60</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Uomini: <strong>QUADRIO MAURO</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\"><strong>Categoria M65+/F65+</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Uomini: <strong>LONGHI ROBERTO</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Il 12 Settembre a Misurina (BL) la &quot;<a href=\"https://www.trecimeexperience.com/sky-marathon\">Misurina SkyMarathon</a>&quot; ha assegnato i titoli di Campione Italiano SKYMARATHON , Assoluti e di Categoria, questi i vincitori e le vincitrici:</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\"><strong>Under 23</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Uomini: <strong>POZZER ANDREA</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\"><strong>Senior</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Uomini: <strong>NANI EDDJ</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Donne: <strong>DE CIAN LAURA</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\"><strong>M55</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Uomini: C<strong>ALABRESE ANTONIO</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\"><strong>M/F 50</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Uomini: <strong>BERNARDI ANDREA</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Donne: <strong>SIGNORI SABRINA</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\"><strong>M/F 45</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Uomini: <strong>ROSSI FABIO</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Donne: <strong>SPIESS REGINA</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\"><strong>M40</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Uomini: <strong>TONELLO CARLO</strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\">Credit foto: Davide Ferrari - Rosetta Skyrace</div>\r\n</div>\r\n', '2il 5 Settembre alla  \"Rosetta Skyrace\" e il 12 Settembre alla \"Misurina SkyMarathon\"', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/Rosetta_Skyrace_-_Davide_Ferrari(1).jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2021-09-20 11:08:48', '2021-09-20 22:18:53', NULL, 1),
(141, '18 e 26 Settembre assegnati i Titoli Italiani  FISky di  SkySpeed  e Vertical Kilometer', 'Assegnati&nbsp; gli&nbsp; ultimi&nbsp; Titoli Italiani di&nbsp; specialit&agrave;&nbsp; del&nbsp; 2021.&nbsp; Lo&nbsp; scorso&nbsp; 18 Settembre&nbsp; al&nbsp; <a href=\"https://cutpuglia.it/cut-vertical-campionato-italiano-sky-speed-race/\"><strong>CUT VERTICAL</strong>&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;a Castellaneta (TA)&nbsp; ad&nbsp; aggiudicarsi&nbsp; i&nbsp; Titoli Italiani&nbsp; di&nbsp;<strong> <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Discipline\">SkySpeed</a></strong>&nbsp; sono stati:<br />\r\n- Barone Giorgia&nbsp; -&nbsp; F&nbsp; Youth B<br />\r\n- Mongelli Lidia&nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; F40<br />\r\n- Milano Maria Maddalena&nbsp; - F45<br />\r\n- Bitetti Antonella&nbsp; &nbsp;- F50<br />\r\n- Luchena Rosa&nbsp; -&nbsp; F55<br />\r\n- Bigazzi Riccardo -&nbsp; SEN<br />\r\n- Gattulli Grazio&nbsp; -&nbsp; M40<br />\r\n- Quaranta Max&nbsp; - M45<br />\r\n- Schirinzi Luciano&nbsp; - M50<br />\r\n- Fico Domenico&nbsp; - M55<br />\r\n- Di Giovanni Paolo&nbsp; -&nbsp; M60<br />\r\nIl 26 Settembre sotto la&nbsp; &nbsp;pioggia&nbsp; in&nbsp; Valgoglio (BG)&nbsp; al&nbsp; <strong>This is&nbsp; the&nbsp; vertical (</strong>miglior crono di&nbsp; giornata per&nbsp; William Boffelli&nbsp; e&nbsp; Conti&nbsp; Fabiola )&nbsp; i&nbsp; titoli&nbsp; di Italiani&nbsp; di&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Discipline\"> Vertical Kilometer</a></strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;sono&nbsp; andati&nbsp; a&nbsp; :&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Corti Olga&nbsp; - Youth A F<br />\r\n- Bonzi Vivien&nbsp; - Youth B F<br />\r\n- Alessio Ludovica&nbsp; - U 23 F<br />\r\n- Conti Fabiola&nbsp; - Senior F<br />\r\n- Ghirardini Corinna (US MALONNO) - F40<br />\r\n- Chiappa Silvia&nbsp; - F45<br />\r\n- Marconato Giuseppina&nbsp; - F50<br />\r\n- Utzeri Martino&nbsp; -Youth A M<br />\r\n- Rigo Alex&nbsp; - YouthB M<br />\r\n- Rostan Andrea&nbsp; - U23 M<br />\r\n- Boffelli William&nbsp; - Senior M<br />\r\n- Pasini Fabio&nbsp; - M40<br />\r\n- Zamboni Giovanni&nbsp; - M45<br />\r\n- Merelli Stefano&nbsp; - M50<br />\r\n- Milesi Davide&nbsp; - M55<br />\r\n- Trussardi Giovanni Maria - M60<br />\r\n- Midali Fausto&nbsp; - M65<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'A Castellaneta  (TA) e a  Valgoglio (BG)', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/william_boffelli.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2021-10-15 12:29:07', '2021-10-15 12:32:24', NULL, 1),
(142, 'Mezzocorona (TN) - \"Centro Federale\"  FISky - ', 'Con la serata dedicata allo Skyrunning, ed il raduno della Nazionale che ha partecipato al &ldquo;Mezzovertical&rdquo; &egrave; stata ufficialmente inaugurata la collaborazione fra la Fisky- Federazione Italiana Skyrunning ed il Comune di Mezzocorona nuovo &ldquo;Centro Federale &ldquo; per il prossimo triennio. La&nbsp; &quot;palestra naturale&quot;&nbsp; del&nbsp; sentiero&nbsp; del&nbsp; Monte&nbsp; di&nbsp; Mezzocorona e&nbsp; dei&nbsp; sentieri&nbsp; e&nbsp; delle&nbsp; cime&nbsp; di&nbsp; Malga&nbsp; Kraun&nbsp; unitamente&nbsp; alle&nbsp; strutture&nbsp; ricettive&nbsp; messe&nbsp; a&nbsp; dispozione&nbsp; del&nbsp; Comune ospiteranno&nbsp; i raduni&nbsp; primaverili ed&nbsp; autunnali&nbsp; della&nbsp; Nazionale&nbsp; Italiana&nbsp; Skyrunning&nbsp;<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/Centro_Federale_Mezzocorona1_10.jpg\" style=\"width: 650px; height: 398px;\" />', '8 e 9  Ottobre  2021 ', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/Centro_Federale_Mezzocorona1_6.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2021-10-25 11:34:05', '2021-10-25 11:41:12', NULL, 1),
(143, 'Coppa Italia Fisky Skyrunning  2021', 'Prova finale di Coppa Italia di Skyrunning Fisky, la Bellagio Skyrace disputata&nbsp; domenica 24 Ottobre&nbsp; ha decretato i&nbsp; vincitori del challenge tricolore, Cecilia Pedroni (ASD Autocogliati ) e Luca Arrigoni (ASD Autocogliati )&nbsp; si aggiudicano la prima edizione della <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/COPPA-ITALIA-FISky-Skyrunning\">Coppa Italia FISKy Skyrunning</a>. In campo femminile 2^ Daniela Rota e 3^ Camilla Magliano. In campo maschile 2&deg; posto per Luca Carrara e 3&deg; Luca Del Pero. Classifiche&nbsp; complete&nbsp; su&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-Coppa-Italia-FISky-Skyrunning\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-Coppa-Italia-FISky-Skyrunning</a>', 'Cecilia  Pedroni e  Luca  Arrigoni  si  aggiudicano  il  challenge  tricolore', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_COPPA_ITALIA_-_Cecilia_e_Luca.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2021-10-25 14:42:37', '2021-10-25 14:46:47', NULL, 1);
