(176, 'Rassegna stampa  FISky  2022 (Parte 2)', 'Un grande&nbsp; impegno&nbsp; della Federazione&nbsp; anche&nbsp; a livello&nbsp; mediatico,&nbsp; iniziato&nbsp; lo&nbsp; scorso&nbsp; anno&nbsp; e&nbsp; che&nbsp; sta&nbsp; proseguendo,&nbsp; con&nbsp; un&nbsp; importante&nbsp; progetto&nbsp; che&nbsp; nel corso del 2022 ha&nbsp; visto&nbsp; l&#39;uscita&nbsp; di&nbsp; oltre 250&nbsp; articoli&nbsp; sulle&nbsp; pi&ugrave;&nbsp; importanti&nbsp; testate&nbsp; di&nbsp; settore,&nbsp; per&nbsp; valorizzare&nbsp; la&nbsp; &nbsp;&quot; disciplina&nbsp; alpinistica&nbsp; dello&nbsp; Skyrunnning&quot; ,&nbsp; &nbsp;le&nbsp; gare inserite&nbsp; nel&nbsp; Calendario&nbsp;FIsky&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-2022\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-2022,</a>&nbsp; e&nbsp; gli&nbsp; atleti e&nbsp; le&nbsp; atlete&nbsp; della&nbsp; Squadra&nbsp; Nazionale.<br />\r\nBuona&nbsp; lettura:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b>FISky &ndash; Rassegna Stampa 2022</b><br />\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li style=\"margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.trailrunning.it/2022/07/08/tartufo-running-15-edizioni-al-gusto-di-tartufo/\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.trailrunning.it/2022/07/08/tartufo-running-15-edizioni-al-gusto-di-tartufo/</a></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.runningpassion.it/news/pizzo-stella-skyrunning-vittorie-di-del-pero-e-rota-arrigoni-e-rota-al-comando-della-coppa-italia-skyrunning/\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.runningpassion.it/news/pizzo-stella-skyrunning-vittorie-di-del-pero-e-rota-arrigoni-e-rota-al-comando-della-coppa-italia-skyrunning/</a></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"margin-left:8px