-2023/</span></a></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"118\">\r\n	<li style=\"border:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.up-climbing.com/trail-neve/news-trail-neve/k2-valtellina-extreme-vertical-2023/\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">https://www.up-climbing.com/trail-neve/news-trail-neve/k2-valtellina-extreme-vertical-2023/</span></a></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"119\">\r\n	<li style=\"border:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.tuttorunning.net/primo-piano/la-k2-valtellina-extreme-vertical-race-ha-offerto-ancora-un-grande-spettacolo-con-tante-emozioni-1552\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">https://www.tuttorunning.net/primo-piano/la-k2-valtellina-extreme-vertical-race-ha-offerto-ancora-un-grande-spettacolo-con-tante-emozioni-1552</span></a></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"120\">\r\n	<li style=\"border:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.biocorrendo.it/2023/06/marcello-ugazio-e-camilla-magliano-sono.html\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">https://www.biocorrendo.it/2023/06/marcello-ugazio-e-camilla-magliano-sono.html</span></a></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"121\">\r\n	<li style=\"border:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.discoveryalps.it/classifica-monte-rosa-walser-waeg-2023/\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">https://www.discoveryalps.it/classifica-monte-rosa-walser-waeg-2023/</span></a></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"122\">\r\n	<li style=\"border:none\"><span style=\"fo