sp;', 'Daniel Thedy e Benedetta Broggi si laureano nuovi Campioni Italiani SkySnow Vertical al Weissrunner Gressoney', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_VERTICAL.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-02-06 21:13:16', '2025-02-06 21:50:54', NULL, 1),
(232, 'Luca Del Pero e Elisa Desco si laureano Campioni Italiani SkySnow Classic', 'La Teglio Sunset Winter Run di sabato &egrave; stato lo scenografico teatro scelto da FISky - Federazione Italiana Skyrunning per l&rsquo;assegnazione dei secondi Titoli Italiani di questa stagione per lo SkySnow. La gara disputata all&rsquo;interno del comprensorio sciistico di Prato Valentino - Teglio (SO), in una suggestiva partenza al tramonto, ha visto una partecipazione record di circa 350 atleti sul percorso di 10km 520m D+<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Ph_Emmie_Collinge-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 400px;\" />\r\n<div style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:small; white-space-collapse:preserve\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">credit Emmie Collinge</span></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; white-space-collapse:preserve\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">Confermata l&#39;eccellenza organizzativa di ASD Valtellina Wine Trail in questa 5^ edizione che oltre a essere stata valevole come prova unica per il Campionato &egrave; terza tappa del circuito NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup 2025 il cui prossimo appuntamento sar&agrave; il 1 marzo alla SkySnow Schia Monte Caio nell&rsquo;Appennino Parmense.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Ph_Emmie_Collinge-2.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 400px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:small; white-space-collapse:preserve\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">credit Emmie Collinge</span></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; white-space-collapse:preserve\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">Luca Del Pero (Sky Lario Runners) si aggiudica gara e titolo in un testa a testa con Lorenzo Rota Martir (GS Orobie - Team Scarpa) con soli 11 secondi a dividere i due. Terza piazza per Alessandro Crippa (GSA Cometa). Vittoria tricolore al femminile per Elisa Desco (Valtellina Wine Trail), secondo e terzo posto per Corinna Ghirardi (Skyrunning Adventure) e Alice Minetti (Boves Run - Aliaipiedi).<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Ph_Emmie_Collinge-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 400px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"outline:none; position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:small; white-space-collapse:preserve\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">credit Emmie Collinge</span></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"outline:none; position:static !important\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"outline:none; position:static !important\">\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; white-space-collapse:preserve\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">La giornata &egrave; stata anche occasione per il CT Roberto Mattioli di saggiare lo stato di forma degli atleti attenzionati da FISky per la convocazione in vista dei prossimi Campionati Europei e Mondiali Giovani in programma in Italia. Fra&nbsp; i&nbsp; giovani&nbsp; si&nbsp; sono&nbsp; messi in evidenza Alessia Pozzi, Leonardo Casentini e Pietro Cattaneo tutti della&nbsp; ASD Valtellina Wine Trail e Massimiliano Durbano della BOVES&nbsp; RUN Aliaipiedi ASD.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; white-space-collapse:preserve\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">CLASSIFICA</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"