12pt; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; white-space-collapse:preserve\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">1 - DESCO ELISA (ASD VALTELLINA WINE TRAIL) 55:59</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; white-space-collapse:preserve\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">2 - GHIRARDI CORINNA (SKYRUNNING ADVENTURE) 56:53</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:medium; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; white-space-collapse:preserve\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">3 - MINETTI ALICE (BOVES RUN - ALIAIPIEDI) 59:18</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n', 'A Prato Valentino FISky assegna i Titoli Italiani 2025 di specialitÃ ', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_VERTICAL(1).jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-02-17 22:27:38', '2025-02-17 22:29:29', NULL, 1),
(233, 'Anche per il 2025 sarÃ  Crazy a vestire la nazionale italiana Skyrunning', '<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Prosegue la collaborazione tra il brand Valtellinese Crazy e la nazionale di Skyrunning italiana che oltre a vestire la Nazionale &egrave; anche sponsor dei circuiti organizzati da FISky.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Dal 2022, la Nazionale Italiana di Skyrunning veste Crazy, affidandosi alla qualit&agrave; e all&#39;innovazione del brand per affrontare le sfide pi&ugrave; estreme. La squadra, composta da 21 atleti Senior e 26 atleti Under 23, indossa capi tecnici progettati per garantire massima libert&agrave; di movimento e comfort, permettendo agli atleti di concentrarsi esclusivamente sulla <span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">performance.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Ogni capo &ndash; dai pantaloncini alle magliette e canotte &ndash; &egrave; sviluppato con un fit specifico per uomo e donna, utilizzando tessuti leggerissimi, morbidi e altamente traspiranti, privi di cuciture e arricchiti da dettagli tecnici studiati per offrire il massimo del comfort.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&ldquo;Mi sono interessata allo sky running fin dalla met&agrave; degli anni &lsquo;90, quando questo sport &egrave; nato e si &egrave; fatto conoscere anche grazie ai primi &ldquo;eroi&rdquo; che percorrevano le montagne a fil di cielo. I primi atleti erano prevalentemente sci alpinisti che d&rsquo;estate si sono avvicinati a questa specialit&agrave; della corsa in montagna cos&igrave; affine allo skialp; oltre alla performance agonistica &egrave; necessario conoscere l&rsquo;alta montagna e le sue insidie. Il leit motiv per questi atleti era ed &egrave; &ldquo;velocit&agrave; &egrave; sicurezza&rdquo;. Mi sono applicata e con alcuni di loro ho trovato delle soluzioni tecniche, valide ancora oggi, di fatto applicate in seguito da tutti gli altri brand. Come per lo sci alpinismo Crazy &egrave; stata pioniera fin dal principio a fianco dei primi atleti. Tutto il know how raccolto in questi anni &egrave; raccolto nei capi che forniamo orgogliosamente alla Squadra Nazionale italiana di specialit&agrave;&rdquo;. Valeria Colturi</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Grazie a questa collaborazione, la Nazionale pu&ograve; contare su un equipaggiamento all&rsquo;avanguardia, ideale per affrontare le vette pi&ugrave; impegnative con leggerezza e sicurezza.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&ldquo;Il Presidente Fabio Meraldi ed io siamo particolarmente soddisfatti di proseguire il rapporto di collaborazione con CRAZY, la prima azienda a produrre abbigliamento tecnico e specifico per lo sport Skyrunning, a testimonianza degli ottimi risultati ottenuti da questa collaborazione iniziata nel 2022. Da allora la Nazionale Italiana nei 5 Campionati Mondiali disputati, fra estivi ed invernali, ha ottenuto due secondi posti e tre vittorie&rdquo; queste le parole del Vicepresidente e CT Roberto Mattioli.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'Prosegue la collaborazione tra il brand Valtellinese Crazy e la nazionale di Skyrunning italiana  ', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_MEZZOCORONA.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-03-05 10:23:21', '2025-03-05 10:23:21', NULL, 1),
(234, 'Terminato  il  Corso di 3Â° livello  per   Allenatori  ', 'Con&nbsp; le&nbsp; prove&nbsp; pratiche&nbsp; e&nbsp; la&nbsp; verifica&nbsp; finale ,&nbsp; nel&nbsp; fine&nbsp; settimana&nbsp; dal&nbsp; 7 al 9 Marzo 2025,&nbsp; si&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; concluso&nbsp; il&nbsp; 19&deg; Corso&nbsp; del&nbsp; S.I.T. - Settore Istruzione&nbsp; Tecnica&nbsp; &nbsp;riservato&nbsp; ad&nbsp; Istruttori ed&nbsp; Allenatori&nbsp; Skyrunning.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnche in questo&nbsp; corso,&nbsp; particolarmente&nbsp; apprezzato&nbsp; dagli&nbsp; undici&nbsp; partecipanti erano&nbsp; presenti tre&nbsp; laureati&nbsp; in&nbsp; scienze&nbsp; motorie,&nbsp; che&nbsp; hanno&nbsp; avuto&nbsp; modo&nbsp; di&nbsp; approfondire&nbsp; le&nbsp; loro&nbsp; conoscenze&nbsp; specifiche&nbsp; nello&nbsp; sport&nbsp; &quot;skyrunning&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI&nbsp; partecipanti&nbsp; che&nbsp; hanno&nbsp; brillantemente&nbsp; superato&nbsp; le&nbsp; verifiche&nbsp; finali&nbsp; erano provenienti&nbsp; da&nbsp; Valle d&#39;Aosta, Piemonte, Lombardia, Lazio,&nbsp; Emilia-Romagna&nbsp; e&nbsp; Sardegna&nbsp;', '19Â° Corso  del  S.I.T.  per  Istruttori e Allenatori Skyrunning', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/CORSO_ALLENATORI_2025.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-03-14 13:18:05', '2025-03-14 15:45:58', NULL, 1),
(235, 'SkySnow Euro Championships: l\'Italia sbanca Tarvisio', 'Dopo aver vinto i due precedenti Campionati Mondiali SkySnow, in Spagna nel 2022 e in Italia nel 2024 , <strong>l&rsquo;ITALIA dello Skyrunning &egrave; Campione d&rsquo;Europa SkySnow </strong>, la disciplina invernale. Nei due giorni di gare a Tarvisio, l&rsquo;Italia vince 12 delle 19 medaglie in palio: tutte le 7 medaglie d&rsquo;oro in palio e 5 d&rsquo;argento.<br />\r\nAl secondo posto la Spagna con 1 argento e 4 bronzi e al terzo posto il Portogallo con 1 argento e 1 bronzo .<br />\r\nNella classifica a punti per Nazioni l&#39;ITALIA con 730 punti precede la Spagna con 548 punti ed il Portogallo con 388.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLe 7 medaglie d&#39;oro e le 5 medaglie d&#39;argento :<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- <img alt=\"ðŸ¥‡\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t94/1/16/1f947.png\" width=\"16\" /><img alt=\"ðŸ¥‡\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t94/1/16/1f947.png\" width=\"16\" /><img alt=\"ðŸ¥‡\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t94/1/16/1f947.png\" width=\"16\" />- Benedetta Broggi ( Vertical / Classic / Combinata)<br />\r\n- <img alt=\"ðŸ¥‡\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t94/1/16/1f947.png\" width=\"16\" /><img alt=\"ðŸ¥‡\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t94/1/16/1f947.png\" width=\"16\" />- Lorenzo Rota Martir ( Classic / Combinata )<br />\r\n- <img alt=\"ðŸ¥‡\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t94/1/16/1f947.png\" width=\"16\" />- Daniel Thedy (Vertical )<br />\r\n- <img alt=\"ðŸ¥‡\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t94/1/16/1f947.png\" width=\"16\" />- Italia (Classifica per Nazioni)<br />\r\n- <img alt=\"ðŸ¥ˆ\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t15/1/16/1f948.png\" width=\"16\" /><img alt=\"ðŸ¥ˆ\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t15/1/16/1f948.png\" width=\"16\" />- Corinna Ghirardi ( Vertical / Combinata )<br />\r\n- <img alt=\"ðŸ¥ˆ\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t15/1/16/1f948.png\" width=\"16\" /><img alt=\"ðŸ¥ˆ\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t15/1/16/1f948.png\" width=\"16\" />- Luca Del Pero (Classic / Combinata)<br />\r\n- <img alt=\"ðŸ¥ˆ\" height=\"16\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t15/1/16/1f948.png\" width=\"16\" /> - Tadei Pivk (Classic )<br />\r\nAltri piazzamenti :<br />\r\n4&deg; - Lorenzo Rota Martir (Vertical)<br />\r\n6&deg; - Corinna Ghirardi (Classic)<br />\r\n7&deg; - Luca Del Pero (Vertical)<br />\r\n9&deg; - Peter Bettoli (Classic)', 'Vince 12 delle  19  medaglie in  palio', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FIKSY_Campione_dEuropa_2025.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-03-16 22:24:39', '2025-03-16 22:24:39', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `description`, `image`, `author`, `header_image`, `keep_header`, `not_header`, `created`, `modified`, `subtitle`, `status`) VALUES
(236, 'Termina a Tarvisio il circuito NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup 2025  ', 'Tarvisio Winter Trail &egrave; stata anche degna chiusura del circuito <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/NORTEC-SkySnow-Running-Cup-2025\">NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup 2025,</a> entrambe le competizioni Vertical e Classic erano infatti valevoli come prove del circuito dopo Snow Run Resinelli, Gressoney Weissrunner, Teglio Sunset Winter Run e SkySnow Schia Monte Caio. Al termine delle 6 prove sono incoronati vincitori Lorenzo Rota Martir e Benedetta Broggi premiati da Roberto Mattioli (Vicepresidente FISky) e Maurizio Ragonese - fondatore del brand italiano NORTEC leader nella progettazione di micro ramponi e main sponsor dell&rsquo;evento.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_coppa_Italia_skysnow_2025.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 406px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Roboto, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:pre-wrap; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile circuito <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/NORTEC-SkySnow-Running-Cup-2025\">NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup 2025&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Roboto, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:pre-wrap; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1 - Lorenzo Rota Martir&nbsp; (G.S. Orobie ASD/Scarpa)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Roboto, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:pre-wrap; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2 - Luca Del Pero (Sky Lario Runners ASD/Scarpa)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Roboto, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:pre-wrap; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3 - Stefano Vota&nbsp; (Piossasco Trail Runners ASD)<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_coppa_Italia_skysnow_2025_femm.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 420px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Podio femminile circuito <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/NORTEC-SkySnow-Running-Cup-2025\">NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup 2025</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">1 - Benedetta Broggi&nbsp; (VCO Sport Project ASD)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">2 - Elisa Desco&nbsp; (Valtellina Wine Trail ASD / Scarpa)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">3 - Corinna Ghirardi (Skyrunning Adventure ASD)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Classifiche complete&nbsp; al&nbsp; link :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=770\">https://www.wedosport.net</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Photo credit : FISky</p>\r\n', 'Vincono  Lorenzo Rota Martir e Benedetta Broggi ', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Coppa_Italia_NORTEC.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-03-22 09:45:07', '2025-03-22 09:45:07', NULL, 1),
(237, 'Prosegue il  progetto  di  ricerca  CERISM  -  FISKY', 'Prosegue&nbsp; il&nbsp; progetto&nbsp; di&nbsp; collaborazione&nbsp; e&nbsp; ricerca ,&nbsp; promosso&nbsp; da&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp; e&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.univr.it/it/biblioteche/centro-di-ricerca-sport-montagna-salute-ce-ri-s-m-/\">CeRiSM</a>&nbsp;- Centro di Ricerca Sport Montagna Salute&nbsp; teso&nbsp; a&nbsp; finalizzare la&nbsp; preparazione degli&nbsp; skyrunner in&nbsp; ambiente&nbsp; di&nbsp; alta&nbsp; montagna.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Cerism_(3).jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 188px;\" />&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_-_De_Giuli.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 188px;\" /><br />\r\nI test e&nbsp; le&nbsp; rilevazioni&nbsp; vengono&nbsp; eseguite&nbsp; prima&nbsp; in&nbsp; ambiente&nbsp; ipossico, dove sono ricreate&nbsp; le&nbsp; condizioni dell&#39;alta&nbsp; quota&nbsp; e&nbsp; nei&nbsp; giorni&nbsp; successivi&nbsp; in&nbsp; ambiente&nbsp; normossico. Lo&nbsp; specifico&nbsp; protocollo&nbsp; si&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; inoltre&nbsp; arricchito&nbsp; di&nbsp; ulteriori&nbsp; importanti&nbsp; dati&nbsp; &nbsp; che&nbsp; consentiranno&nbsp; agli&nbsp; atleti di&nbsp; finalizzare&nbsp; al&nbsp; meglio&nbsp; la&nbsp; loro&nbsp; preparazione.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Marchesoni.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 239px;\" />&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Cerism_(2).jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 172px;\" /><br />\r\nLa&nbsp; successiva&nbsp; fase&nbsp; dei&nbsp; test&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; programmata&nbsp; a&nbsp; met&agrave;&nbsp; giugno<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'Test specifici  per  finalizzare  l\'allenamento  degli  skyrunner', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_CERISM_A.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-04-02 11:06:40', '2025-04-02 11:36:08', NULL, 1),
(238, 'Raduno  della  Nazionale Giovanile Skyrunning  ', 'Nei&nbsp; giorni&nbsp; 28-29 e&nbsp; 30&nbsp; Marzo,&nbsp; si&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; tenuto&nbsp; a&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.comune.mezzocorona.tn.it/\">Mezzocorona</a>&nbsp; il&nbsp; Raduno&nbsp; dei&nbsp; giovani&nbsp; atleti e&nbsp; atlete&nbsp; della&nbsp; Nazionale&nbsp; Skyrunning&nbsp; in&nbsp; prospettiva&nbsp; dei&nbsp; prossimi&nbsp; <a href=\"https://youthswc.com/\">Mondiali&nbsp; Youth</a> che&nbsp; si&nbsp; disputeranno&nbsp; al&nbsp; Gran Sasso&nbsp; in&nbsp; Agosto.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Ponte_sospeso_Mezzocorona_FISKY.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 375px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\nAncora&nbsp; una&nbsp; volta, base&nbsp; logistica&nbsp; l <a href=\"https://www.albergoaispiazzi.it/it/\">&#39;Hotel &quot;Ai Spiazzi&quot;&nbsp;</a>&nbsp; dove&nbsp; gli&nbsp; atleti,&nbsp; seguiti&nbsp; dal&nbsp; CT Roberto Mattioli e&nbsp; dai&nbsp; preparatori&nbsp; atletici Saverio Ottolini e&nbsp; Davide&nbsp; Catti,&nbsp; si&nbsp; sono poi&nbsp; mossi per&nbsp; sottoporsi&nbsp; &nbsp;a&nbsp; test&nbsp; incrementali&nbsp; in&nbsp; palestra,&nbsp; in&nbsp; pista&nbsp; e&nbsp; sui&nbsp; sentieri&nbsp; del&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.montedimezzocorona.it/\">Monte di Mezzocorona&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Nazionale_FISKY_Youth.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 504px;\" /><br />\r\nAncora&nbsp; una&nbsp; volta&nbsp; pieno&nbsp; sostegno&nbsp; anche&nbsp; della <a href=\"https://www.montedimezzocorona.it/funivia/prezzi-e-orari/\">&quot;Funivia&nbsp; di&nbsp; Mezzocorona&quot;</a>&nbsp;che&nbsp; con&nbsp; la&nbsp; massima&nbsp; disponibilit&agrave;&nbsp; e&nbsp; professionalit&agrave;&nbsp; ha&nbsp; agevolato&nbsp; gli&nbsp; spostamenti&nbsp; dei&nbsp; tecnici e d egli&nbsp; atleti.&nbsp; Ultimo&nbsp; test&nbsp; in&nbsp; programma&nbsp; il&nbsp; vertical&nbsp; che&nbsp; dalla&nbsp; stazione&nbsp; di&nbsp; partenza della Funivia,&nbsp; conduce&nbsp; alla&nbsp; stazione&nbsp; d&#39;arrivo&nbsp; della&nbsp; medesima&nbsp; sul Monte&nbsp; di&nbsp; Mezzocorona&nbsp; sul sentiero&nbsp; SAT&nbsp; 500 gi&agrave; teatro&nbsp; del&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.montedimezzocorona.it/funivia/curiosita-dati/\"> record&nbsp; di&nbsp; dislivello positivo&nbsp; in&nbsp; 24 Ore</a>&nbsp; stabilito&nbsp; nel&nbsp; 2020 dall&#39;atleta della&nbsp; Nazionale Skyrunning&nbsp; Daniele Cappelletti<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY__MEZZOCORONA_gHIANO.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 306px;\" />', 'In  preparazione  dei  prossimi  Mondiali  di  Agosto al  Gran Sasso', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY__Youth_2025.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-04-02 14:05:38', '2025-04-02 14:15:32', NULL, 1),
(239, 'Nuova Convenzione  tra  FISO  e  FISKY', '12 Aprile 2025 - SOTTOSCRITTA LA NUOVA CONVENZIONE TRA<strong> FISO</strong> E <strong>FISKY</strong><br />\r\nFine settimana di lavori per il Consiglio Federale<strong><a href=\"https://www.fiso.it/\"> FISO</a></strong>: novit&agrave; nella struttura e nomine tecniche<br />\r\nNel corso del fine settimana si &egrave; svolto a Trento il Consiglio Federale della<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://www.fiso.it/notizia/consiglio-federale-novita-nella-struttura-e-nomine-tecniche-20987\"><strong>FISO</strong> (Federazione Italiana Sport Orientamento)</a>, durante il quale sono stati affrontati numerosi punti all&rsquo;ordine del giorno.<br />\r\nIl Consiglio ha visto anche la presenza del <strong>Vicepresidente FISKY,</strong> Roberto Mattioli, e del <strong>Segretario Generale</strong>, Luca Terenzini, delegati dal <strong>Presidente</strong> Fabio Meraldi (assente per concomitanti impegni sportivi) alla sottoscrizione della nuova convenzione tra <strong>FISO </strong>e <strong>FISKY,</strong> in cui sono stati definiti gli ultimi aspetti operativi nell&#39;ambito del percorso federativo.', 'Sottoscritta a  Trento   il  12 Aprile 2025 ', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISO_FISKY_Trento.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-04-16 18:54:21', '2025-04-16 18:58:22', NULL, 1),
(245, 'L\' Italia  conquista i Campionati Europei Skyrunning 2025', '<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Non &egrave; bastata la pioggia torrenziale a fermare lo spettacolo dello Skyrunning. Dal 3 al 5 luglio Corteno Golgi-Aprica (BS) ha ospitato l&rsquo;edizione 2025 degli </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Skyrunning European Championships</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, regalando emozioni forti, grandi prestazioni e un successo straordinario per l&rsquo;Italia.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">L&rsquo;Italia, guidata dal CT Roberto Mattioli, ha letteralmente dominato la classifica per Nazioni, salendo sul gradino pi&ugrave; alto del podio davanti a Spagna e Svezia. Un bottino ricchissimo, quello degli Azzurri che hanno conquistato medaglie e titoli in tutte e tre le discipline in programma: </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">VERTICAL</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">SKY</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">SKYULTRA</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> per un totale di 8 medaglie di cui 4 ori, 2 argenti e 2 bronzi.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:500\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">I tracciati della leggenda</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Si &egrave; corso sulle creste storiche della SkyMarathon che compie 30 anni. La gara SKY si &egrave; sviluppata su 23 km con 1.864 metri di dislivello positivo, toccando i 2.433 metri del Passo Salina prima della discesa verso Santicolo.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"outline:none; position:static !important\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">La SKYULTRA, prova regina, ha seguito l&rsquo;intero percorso classico di 42 km con 5.470 metri di dislivello totale, un tracciato tecnico (grado 2+ ISF) con vetta sul Monte Sellero a quota 2.770 metri.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/fisky_Europeo_(2).JPG\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 427px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:500\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Minoggio leggenda, Arrigoni d&rsquo;argento</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Nella prova maschile SKYULTRA, l&rsquo;Italia ha messo a segno una doppietta da sogno: </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Cristian Minoggio</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, sotto una pioggia battente e in un&rsquo;atmosfera quasi epica, ha conquistato la medaglia d&rsquo;oro e il titolo di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Campione Europeo</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, tagliando il traguardo in 4h30&rsquo;26&rdquo;. Per lui &egrave; la terza vittoria su questo tracciato.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"outline:none; position:static !important\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Alle sue spalle, con 13 minuti di distacco, </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Luca Arrigoni</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> ha chiuso in seconda posizione, regalando all&rsquo;Italia anche l&rsquo;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">argento europeo</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">. Il bronzo &egrave; andato allo spagnolo </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Dimas Pereira</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (4h48&rsquo;38&rdquo;).</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Tra le donne, splendido terzo posto per </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Roberta Jacquin</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, medaglia di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">bronzo</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, e top ten per </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Margherita De Giuli</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, nona.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:500\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Italia protagonista anche nella SKY</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Nella disciplina SKY l&rsquo;Italia &egrave; rimasta competitiva fino all&rsquo;ultimo. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Gianluca Ghiano</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> ha sfiorato il podio chiudendo a pochi minuti da