t-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, alla quinta posizione di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Benedetta Broggi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> &mdash; gi&agrave; </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Campionessa Europea VERTICAL</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> con l&rsquo;oro conquistato gioved&igrave; &mdash; e all&rsquo;ottavo posto di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Francesca Rusconi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:500\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Vertical completamente Azzurro</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Le due prove SKYULTRA e SKY sono state precedute dal VERTICAL, disputato nel comprensorio di Aprica, che ha visto un netto predominio degli atleti italiani sia al maschile che al femminile con l&rsquo;oro vinto da </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Daniel Thedy</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Benedetta Broggi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> che si aggiudica cos&igrave; un prestigioso secondo piazzamento anche nella classifica combinata VK/SKY.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Sono state ben 29 le nazioni presenti a questa edizione, testimoniando la portata e il prestigio del campionato: Albania, Andorra, Austria, Belgio, Bulgaria, Croazia, Cipro, Repubblica Ceca, Finlandia, Francia, Germania, Ungheria, Irlanda, Israele, Italia, Montenegro, Paesi Bassi, Macedonia del Nord, Norvegia, Polonia, Portogallo, Romania, Serbia, Slovacchia, Spagna, Svezia, Svizzera, Ucraina e Regno Unito.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Le classifiche sono disponibili sul sito: </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.skyrunning.com/2025-skyrunning-european-championships-rankings/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"outline:none; text-decoration:none; color:#1474bd; position:static !important\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink:none\">https://www.skyrunning.com/2025-skyrunning-european-championships-rankings/</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Photo credit Davide Ferrari</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Azzurri protagonisti assoluti: ITALIA prima nella classifica per Nazioni', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_CAMPIONATO_EUROPEO.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-07-29 11:13:58', '2025-07-29 11:14:09', NULL, 1),
(241, ' Cecilia Basso e Lorenzo Beltrami si laureano Campioni Italiani Skyrace', 'Gioved&igrave; 1 maggio a Valmadrera si &egrave; disputato il Trofeo Dario &amp; Willy su una prova unica di 25 km per 2020 m di dislivello positivo. La gara, valida come Campionato Italiano Skyrace Assoluto e di Categoria FISky - Federazione Italiana Skyrunning ha visto la partecipazione di ben 440 atleti. Livello tecnico alto, ampia partecipazione, un contesto paesaggistico di grande bellezza e ottima organizzazione da parte di O.S.A. Valmadrera hanno reso l&rsquo;evento teatro ideale per lo svolgimento del Campionato di specialit&agrave;.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_CAMP.ITAL_MASCH_2025.jpg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 609px;\" /><br />\r\nLa gara maschile ha avuto un dominatore sin dal principio, Lorenzo Beltrami. L&#39;atleta lariano, da quest&#39;anno in forza alla Recastello Radici Group e atleta della Rappresentativa Nazionale, partiva come campione in carica e non ha smentito le sue doti, mettendo nuovamente le mani sul Trofeo Dario e Willy concludendo la corsa sulle montagne di casa in 2h23&#39;46&quot;, secondo Andrea Rota della societ&agrave; organizzatrice in 2h28&#39;18&quot;, ha chiuso il podio l&rsquo;altro Azzurro Danilo Brambilla (ASD Falchi Lecco) in 2h28&#39;58&quot;. A ridosso del podio &egrave; giunto Lorenzo Rota Martir, seguito da Daniel Antonioli. Completano la top ten Simone Valsecchi, Luca Lafranconi, Moreno Sala, Mattia Gianola e Giacomo Forconi.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_CAMP.ITAL.FEMM_2025.jpg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /><br />\r\nProtagonista della gara femminile &egrave; stata la torinese Cecilia Basso del Gs Orecchiella Garfagnana, che entra nell&#39;albo d&#39;oro della classicissima lecchese con il tempo di 2h54&#39;21&quot; e si laurea campionessa italiana. Seconda classificata la lecchese Francesca Rusconi (Lab4you - 3h04&#39;11&quot;), artefice di una rimonta notevole che, nella seconda parte di gara, le ha permesso di guadagnare diverse posizioni. Sul gradino pi&ugrave; basso del podio &egrave; salita la vicentina Irene Saggin (Ultrabericus Team) in 3h09&#39;26&quot;. A seguire Roberta Jacquin che conquista la terza piazza del Campionato Italiano Skyrace, Sophie Maschi, Elisa Pallini, Alice Testini, Debora Benedetti e Irene Girola.\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">CLASSIFICA ASSOLUTA MASCHILE</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">1 - LORENZO BELTRAMI (LA RECASTELLO RADICI GROUP - SCARPA)&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">2 - ANDREA ROTA (O.S.A. VALMADRERA - TEAM SALOMON)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">3 - DANILO BRAMBILLA (ASD FALCHI LECCO)</p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">CLASSIFICA ASSOLUTA FEMMINILE</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">1 - CECILIA BASSO (G.S. ORECCHIELLA GARFAGNANA)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">2 - FRANCESCA RUSCONI (LAB4YOU)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">3 - ROBERTA JACQUIN (ASD PEGARUN)<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Non ha voluto mancare all&rsquo;appuntamento Roberto Mattioli, vicepresidente FISky e commissario tecnico della Nazionale: &laquo;Il Trofeo Dario &amp; Willy si conferma una delle manifestazioni pi&ugrave; solide e significative del calendario nazionale. L&#39;organizzazione curata da OSA Valmadrera ha garantito un&#39;edizione all&#39;altezza del Campionato italiano, con un tracciato tecnico, una logistica efficiente e un&#39;ottima partecipazione. Il livello degli atleti era molto alto e la cornice di pubblico ha dato ulteriore valore a una giornata pienamente riuscita.&raquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Premiati anche i Campioni Italiani Skyrace di categoria Youth e Master:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">U23F Irma Chiavazza (PIOSSASCO TRAIL RUNNERS)&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">U23M Pietro Santini (G.S.A. COMETA)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Youth C Michele Stoppele (ASD TEAM KM SPORT)&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MF40 Roberta Pinchetti (O.S.A. VALMADRERA)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MF45 Elisa Pallini (ASD PEGARUN)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MF50 Debora Benedetti (TEAM PASTURO)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MF55 Antonella Crucifero (ASD FALCHI LECCO)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MF60 Patrizia Pensa (TEAM PASTURO)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MF65 Enrica Paredi (O.S.A. VALMADRERA)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MM40 Daniel Antonioli (TEAM PASTURO)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MM45 Claudio Tagliaferri (A.S.D. POLISPORTIVA PAGNONA)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MM50 Saverio Ottolini (ALTITUDE SKYRUNNING TEAM)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MM55 Marino Paolo Fiorentini (ATLETICA ALTO LARIO A.S.D.)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MM60 Italo Conti (A.S.D. POLISPORTIVA PAGNONA)</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">MM65 Salvatore Tarabini (SPORT RACE VALTELLINA)</p>\r\n', 'Assegnati a Valmadrera (LC) i titoli di Campione Italiano Skyrace 2025.', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_CAMP_ITALIANI_2025.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-05-06 19:12:24', '2025-05-06 19:12:24', NULL, 1),
(242, 'Concluso il Corso per  Istruttori Skyrunning  di  1Â° livello   2025', 'Si&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; concluso&nbsp; a&nbsp; Vezzano sul Crostolo (RE)&nbsp; sede&nbsp; del&nbsp; S.I.T. - Settore&nbsp; Istruzione&nbsp; Tecnica&nbsp; &nbsp; il&nbsp; 20&deg; Corso&nbsp; riservato&nbsp; alla&nbsp; formazione&nbsp; dei&nbsp; quadri&nbsp; tecnici&nbsp; della&nbsp; Federazione&nbsp; Italiana&nbsp; Skyrunning.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/2025_FISKY_Istruttori_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\nIl&nbsp; Corso&nbsp; per&nbsp; Istruttori&nbsp; di&nbsp; 1&deg;livello&nbsp; ha&nbsp; visto&nbsp; la&nbsp; partecipazione&nbsp; attiva&nbsp; di&nbsp; sportivi,&nbsp; &nbsp;atleti,&nbsp; preparatori&nbsp; atletici amanti delle&nbsp; montagna&nbsp; e&nbsp; dello&nbsp; Skyrunning&nbsp; provenienti da&nbsp; diverse&nbsp; regioni&nbsp; dell&#39;Italia&nbsp; del&nbsp; Nord&nbsp; e&nbsp; del&nbsp; Centro&nbsp; e&nbsp; nelle&nbsp; giornate&nbsp; di&nbsp; sabato 23&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp; domenica&nbsp; 24&nbsp; &nbsp;Maggio&nbsp; &nbsp;si&nbsp; sono&nbsp; dedicate&nbsp; alle&nbsp; prove&nbsp; pratiche&nbsp; e&nbsp; alla&nbsp; verifica&nbsp; finale&nbsp; brillantemente&nbsp; superata&nbsp; &nbsp;dai&nbsp; 18&nbsp; partecipanti.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/2025_FISKY_Istruttori_1_bis.jpg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" />', 'Nel  weekend  del 23 e 24  Maggio ', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Test_Istruttori.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-05-30 10:57:45', '2025-05-30 10:57:45', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `description`, `image`, `author`, `header_image`, `keep_header`, `not_header`, `created`, `modified`, `subtitle`, `status`) VALUES
(243, 'Assegnati alla \"Maratona Valle Intrasca\" i titoli  Italiani Skyrunning a coppie', '<span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Cristian Minoggio - Danilo Brambilla e Giulia Marchesoni - Roberta Jacquin si laureano Campioni Italiani a coppie 2025.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Immagine_WhatsApp_2025-06-03_ore_10.15.08_7becedc2-FISKY.jpg\" style=\"width: 648px; height: 486px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\nSi &egrave; disputata domenica 1 giugno la 49^ edizione della storica Maratona Valle Intrasca con partenza a Intra di Verbania (VB), quest&rsquo;anno designata da FISky - Federazione Italiana Skyrunning come Campionato Italiano a coppie. Il fine settimana lungo arricchito di eventi per partecipanti e pubblico organizzati dal CAI Verbano e dalla neonata Maratona Valle Intrasca ASD &egrave; stato anche occasione di ritiro per una rappresentativa di atleti della Nazionale Italiana.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Immagine_WhatsApp_2025-06-03_ore_10.11.56_d41f8493.jpg\" style=\"width: 650px; height: 438px;\" /><br />\r\nSono state 205 le coppie iscritte sulla distanza maggiore di 33 chilometri e 750 metri per 1625 metri di dislivello tra il Lago Maggiore e il rifugio Pian Cavallone, attestando la sentita partecipazione degli atleti per la classica delle gare a coppie. La competizione ha visto il dominio della squadra MINOGGIO &ndash; BRAMBILLA (Cristian Minoggio &ndash; Danilo Brambilla) che non ha avuto rivali: sempre in testa, la coppia piemontese/lombardo ha fatto fermare i cronometri sullo straordinario tempo di 2h45&rsquo;58&rdquo;, nuovo record del percorso: il precedente record era di 2h47&rsquo;15&rdquo;, stabilito da Giacomotti e Ronchi nel 2023 e conquistando il titolo di Campioni Italiani in ambito maschile. Era partita molto bene anche la coppia PEGARUN (Giuseppe Pedretti &ndash; Ahmed El Mazoury), costretta poi al ritiro a causa dei crampi che hanno colpito El Mazoury. La seconda posizione &egrave; cos&igrave; andata all&rsquo;esperta coppia ARRIGONI &ndash; CARRARA (Luca Arrigoni e Luca Carrara), tornati sul traguardo di Verbania dopo 3h05&rsquo;01&rdquo; dalla partenza. Terzo gradino del podio appannaggio del team PARTITA IVA, composto dagli atleti locali Matteo Ferrari e Davide Borghi, con il tempo di 3h22&rsquo;15&rdquo;.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Immagine_WhatsApp_2025-06-03_ore_10.14.22_5f340827-FISKY.jpg\" style=\"width: 648px; height: 486px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">In campo femminile spettacolare prestazione delle fortissime gemelle piemontesi Dematteis: Enrica e Luisa, iscritte come LE DEMA, hanno vinto con il tempo di 3h41&rsquo;14&rdquo;, dopo una gara tutta di testa. Ottima anche la performance delle AQUILE PEGARUN (</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Giulia Marchesoni, Roberta Jacquin</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">) che hanno conquistato un prestigioso secondo posto con il tempo di 3h44&rsquo;18&rdquo; ma soprattutto, essendo tesserate FISKY, anche il Titolo Tricolore FISKY della specialit&agrave; Skytrail a coppie.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Rilevante terza posizione per THE BLONDE GIRLS, le atlete locali Chiara Cerlini e Stefania Rossi, che hanno fatto fermare i cronometri sul tempo di 4h28&rsquo;22&rdquo;.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Immagine_WhatsApp_2025-06-03_ore_10.12.59_796b4ca6-FISKY.jpg\" style=\"width: 648px; height: 486px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">PODIO CAMPIONATO MASCHILE</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1 - MINOGGIO CRISTIAN / BRAMBILLA DANILO&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2 - ARRIGONI LUCA / CARRARA LUCA</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3 - PIZZI FRANCESCO / PIANA STEFANO</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">PODIO CAMPIONATO FEMMINILE</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1 - JACQUIN ROBERTA / MARCHESONI GIULIA</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2 - ROSSI STEFANIA / CERLINI CHIARA</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3 - ZAMPIERI LUANA / BRESSAN STELLA<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Roberta-Jacquin-e-Giulia-Marchesoni-Verbania-01.06.2025-1536x932.jpg\" style=\"width: 648px; height: 393px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Roberto Mattioli</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, vicepresidente FISky e CT della Nazionale, non ha fatto mancare la sua presenza per testare lo stato di forma degli atleti su un percorso tecnico e particolarmente veloce dove si sono distinte le prestazioni di Margherita De Giuli in gara nella classifica mista e Giuseppe Pedretti, atleta recentemente posto sotto l&rsquo;attenta osservazione del commissario tecnico. La gara &egrave; servita come ultimo test per la selezione della squadra che parteciper&agrave; ai prossimi Campionati Europei in calendario il 3-4-5 luglio 2025 a Corteno Golgi (BS) sui sentieri della SkyMarathon Sentiero 4 Luglio. Mattioli ha inoltre sottolineato un&rsquo;organizzazione impeccabile per l&rsquo;alto livello dell&rsquo;evento: una maratona che ha saputo richiamare atleti di grande qualit&agrave; e una straordinaria partecipazione in un contesto paesaggistico di assoluto rilievo.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; background-color:#ffffff\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Photo credit Ph. Patrizia Scalisi/Claudio Agosta/FISky</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Brambilla - Minoggio  e  Jaquin - Marchesoni  i  Campioni  Italiani a coppie', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Brambilla_Minoggio.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-06-06 17:36:09', '2025-06-06 17:36:09', NULL, 1),
(244, 'Due  nuovi  \"Giudici  di  Gara\"  hanno completato   lo  stage  di  formazione ', 'Si &egrave; concluso a Verbania, in occasione dei Campionati Italiani a coppie, lo stage di formazione per due nuovi Giudici di Gara Skyrunning. Dopo il corso online, Alessia Pellegrino, proveniente dalla provincia di Bologna, e il comasco Davide Consonni hanno affrontato la fase pratica affiancando i Giudici Terenzini e Giovannelli, prima nelle fasi di verifica del percorso il giorno antecedente la gara e successivamente nelle fasi di briefing, classifiche e premiazioni.', 'A  Verbania  in  occasione  dei  Campionati  Italiani  Skyrunning a   coppie', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_GIUDICI_2025.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-06-06 17:51:06', '2025-06-06 20:31:33', NULL, 1),
(246, 'Mattia Tanara e Silvia Guerini  i  Campioni Italiani Ultra SkyMarathon 2025', '<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Si &egrave; disputata sabato 19 luglio la MUST - Memorial Ultra Scalve Trail, gara designata da </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"outline:none; text-decoration:none; color:#1474bd; position:static !important\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink:none\"><em style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; background-color:#ffff66; font-style:inherit; color:#000000\">FISky</em> - Federazione Italiana Skyrunning</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> come </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Campionato Italiano Ultra SkyMarathon</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> per il 2025. Grande partecipazione, con oltre 400 atleti italiani e internazionali, a conferma della qualit&agrave; del comitato organizzatore composto da Fly-Up Sport in Val di Scalve con il coinvolgimento dei comuni di Colere, Schilpario, Azzone e Vilminore di Scalve e con il supporto della Pro Loco Colere. La MUST si &egrave; confermata evento di altissimo livello tecnico e paesaggistico il cui tracciato ha attraversato alcuni dei luoghi simbolo dell&rsquo;Alta Valle di Scalve, offrendo uno scenario ideale per l&rsquo;assegnazione dei titoli italiani.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">La gara maschile &egrave; stata dominata da </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Mattiaâ€¯Tanara</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (KM Sport) che ha completato in solitaria la prova in 5hâ€¯18&prime;â€¯46&Prime; conquistando cos&igrave; il titolo tricolore sulla distanza Ultra SkyMarathon. Tanara aveva un &ldquo;conto in sospeso&rdquo; con la MUST ed ha vissuto una giornata d&rsquo;altri tempi imponendo un ritmo insostenibile ai suoi avversari, seconda posizione per </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Luca Arrigoni</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Team Pegarun) che ferma il cronometro a 05h34&rsquo;36&rsquo;&rsquo;, chiude il podio </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Michele Albrici</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Angolo Mountain Running) in 06h06&rsquo;29&rsquo;&rsquo;.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">In campo femminile </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Silvia Guerini</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Team GAAREN #BEaHERO) conquista il titolo in 08h05&rsquo;44&rsquo;&rsquo; a conferma del suo stato di forma e della capacit&agrave; di eccellere su tracciati tecnici e selettivi, </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Melissa Paganelli</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> si aggiudica invece la vittoria della competizione in 07h09&rsquo;48&rsquo;&rsquo;, terza piazza per </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Milena Pasin</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (U.S. ALDO MORO A.S.D.) in 08h30&rsquo;34&rsquo;&rsquo;.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Photo credit Ph. DR Fotografia</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Si aggiudicano  la  MUST  nell\'Alta Valle  di  Scalve', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/MUST_.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-07-29 11:26:03', '2025-07-29 11:26:03', NULL, 1),
(247, 'Campionati Mondiali  Skyrunning  Youth ', '<p dir=\"ltr\">Si &egrave; conclusa domenica 3 agosto la nona edizione degli Youth Skyrunning World Championships, andata in scena dal 1&deg; al 3 agosto a Fonte Cerreto, Gran Sasso (AQ), con la partecipazione di 30 nazioni da tutto il mondo. Tre giornate intense tra fatica, emozioni e grande sport che hanno visto la Nazionale giovanile italiana protagonista assoluta, capace di conquistare 9 medaglie complessive tra VERTICAL, SKY e Combinata e il secondo posto nella classifica per Nazioni, dietro solo alla Spagna e davanti alla Norvegia.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">VENERD&Igrave; 1 AGOSTO &ndash; VERTICAL</h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">La rassegna iridata &egrave; iniziata con la Gran Sasso Vertical Kilometer&reg; su un tracciato tecnico e severo che ha subito messo alla prova le giovani promesse dello skyrunning mondiale.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Tre gli azzurri saliti sul podio nella prima giornata Martina Pozzi oro con straordinaria prestazione e titolo di Campionessa del Mondo U23, Filippo Piumarta argento nella categoria Youth B, gara generosa e piazzamento di grande prestigio e Davide Gadin bronzo nella Youth B a conferma dell&rsquo;ottima profondit&agrave; della squadra italiana. Top ten per Massimiliano Durbano, Peter Bettoli, Gaia Calcini, Christian Suini, Giulia Framarin e Cristian Pivot, tutti con prestazioni solide in un contesto internazionale di alto livello tecnico.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Ph_Davide_Ferrari_-_Martina_Pozzi_(2).jpg\" style=\"width: 650px; height: 433px;\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">DOMENICA 3 AGOSTO &ndash; SKY</h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">La seconda giornata di gare ha visto i giovani azzurri impegnati nella Gran Sasso SkyRace&reg;, una prova impegnativa che ha assegnato i titoli mondiali nella disciplina SKY. Anche qui, gli Azzurrini non hanno deluso con nuovamente Martina Pozzi a podio con un bronzo nella U23, tripletta di medaglie considerando anche il secondo posto nella Combinata e grandissima maturit&agrave; atletica; Christian Suini bronzo nella Youth B e protagonista di una gara sempre in spinta.</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sfiorano il podio con ottimi quarti posti: Gaia Calcini &ndash; Youth C; Filippo Piumarta &ndash; Youth B; Cristian Gabriele Pivot &ndash; Youth A. In top ten anche Massimiliano Durbano ed Enrico Rota nella U23, mentre Matteo Ragonese chiude al nono posto nella Youth A.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Ph_Davide_Ferrari_-_Massimiliano_Durbano.jpg\" style=\"width: 650px; height: 433px;\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Al termine del Campionato Mondiale Giovanile, l&rsquo;Italia conquista il secondo posto assoluto nella classifica per Nazioni con 1492 punti e un medagliere di rilievo con 1 Oro, 4 Argenti e 4 Bronzi, grazie a una squadra unita, motivata e sempre pi&ugrave; competitiva.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Un risultato oltre le aspettative, il commento del CT Roberto Mattioli, che certifica la crescita del nostro movimento giovanile sempre pi&ugrave; protagonista sulla scena internazionale e pronto a costruire il futuro dello skyrunning tricolore.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Le classifiche sono disponibili sul sito:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunning.com/2025-youth-skyrunning-world-championships-ranking/\">https://www.skyrunning.com/2025-youth-skyrunning-world-championships-ranking/</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Photo credit Davide Ferrari</p>\r\n', ' L\'Italia brilla con  9  medaglie ed  il  2Â° posto per  Nazioni', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Podio_Nazioni_Mondiali_Youth.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-08-05 18:48:36', '2025-08-05 18:50:59', NULL, 1),
(248, 'Campionato Italiano Sky  YOUTH  A  e  B', '<span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">La nona Frasassi SkyRace si conferma come l&rsquo;evento di riferimento dello Skyrunning nel centro Italia quest&rsquo;anno in un&rsquo;edizione valida come </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Campionato Italiano YOUTH A e B</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, prova ufficiale della </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">COPPA ITALIA Giovani supported by MICO</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Campionato regionale assoluto</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, che ha portato a San Vittore di Genga 350 atleti animati dall&rsquo;entusiasmo condiviso con il comitato organizzatore ASD Space Running e segno del crescente richiamo della manifestazione<br />\r\nLa distanza di 11 km per 650 m di dislivello positivo pensata per gli Youth ha incoronato </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Cristian Gabriele Pivot</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (ASD Atletica Sandro Calvesi) Campione Italiano nella categoria YOUTH A (15-16 anni), mentre nella YOUTH B (17-18 anni) il titolo &egrave; andato a </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Elisa Mariani</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Altitude Skyrunning) e </span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Federico Bartolucci</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (ASD Space Running). Per Pivot &egrave; arrivato anche il successo assoluto sul percorso di 11 km con 650 m D+, chiuso con un crono da record del percorso di 57&rsquo;02&rsquo;&rsquo;.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/DEV03402-min.jpg\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 467px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<big><small>Tanto entusiasmo, fatica e spettacolo hanno reso questa edizione indimenticabile, confermando ancora una volta la Frasassi Skyrace come vetrina d&rsquo;eccellenza per il movimento skyrunning giovanile e assoluto; le parole a caldo del Presidente e ideatore della Frasassi SkyRace Maurizio Marini: &ldquo;&Egrave; quasi impossibile raccontare le emozioni vissute oggi. Abbiamo messo cuore, energia e passione in ogni dettaglio, con l&rsquo;obiettivo di offrire ai nostri atleti e al pubblico un&rsquo;esperienza indimenticabile. Un anno intero di lavoro, di sacrifici e di impegno trova senso in giornate come questa: il calore degli spettatori lungo il percorso, l&rsquo;entusiasmo all&rsquo;arrivo e la forza degli atleti arrivati da ogni parte d&rsquo;Italia ci hanno ripagato di ogni sforzo.&quot;</small></big>\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><big><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">L&rsquo;impegno della Federazione guarda con decisione alla crescita del movimento giovanile, un comparto che sta gi&agrave; dando frutti importanti: lo Youth Skyrunning World Championships di quest&rsquo;anno ha infatti premiato la Nazionale Italiana con uno straordinario secondo posto nel ranking per nazioni. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">La Frasassi SkyRace Mini-Sky &egrave; stata anche la 5^ prova del circuito di Coppa Italia Giovani il cui calendario proseguir&agrave; con l&rsquo;appuntamento all&rsquo;Adamello Vertical del prossimo 14 settembre a Vione (BS).</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></big></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Photo credit Ufficio stampa Frasassi SkyRace</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'Pivot Campione Italiano YOUTH A, Bartolucci e Elisa  Mariani Tricolori nella YOUTH B', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_YOUTH.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-09-10 18:19:44', '2025-09-10 18:23:19', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `description`, `image`, `author`, `header_image`, `keep_header`, `not_header`, `created`, `modified`, `subtitle`, `status`) VALUES
(249, 'Raduno  della  Nazionale Giovanile Skyrunning  YOUTH A  e  B ', '<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Domenica 14 settembre le giovani promesse azzurre si sono messe in mostra in occasione delle Adamello Series di Vione (BS).</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Il weekend dedicato ai verticalisti, caratterizzato da un meteo variabile con nuvole e schiarite e da una pioggia nel pomeriggio di sabato e nella notte, si &egrave; aperto con condizioni del terreno comunque buone, tali da non influire sul regolare svolgimento delle gare nemmeno all&rsquo;arrivo posto a quota 2.300 metri. Sulle cime circostanti durante la notte &egrave; caduta una leggera spruzzata di neve che ha reso l&rsquo;atmosfera ancora pi&ugrave; suggestiva, con temperature piuttosto fresche. La distanza dell&rsquo;Adamello Vertical Junior ha rappresentato un&rsquo;importante occasione di raduno tecnico per la Nazionale Giovanile ed &egrave; stata valida come prova di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">COPPA ITALIA Giovani supported by MICO per le categorie Youth A e B</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Piumarta_FISKY.jpg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Ottime prestazioni per i giovani azzurri con risultati di rilievo soprattutto al maschile. Nella categoria Youth B &egrave; arrivato il successo di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Filippo Piumarta</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Sport Project VCO), autore anche del nuovo record del tracciato in </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">28:28.07</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">. Alle sue spalle hanno completato il podio </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Lorenzo Uccelli</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Matteo Pedranzini</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, mentre meritano menzione i piazzamenti in </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">sesta e settima posizione</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Pietro Cattaneo</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> ed </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Eugenio Brignone</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">. Al femminile si &egrave; imposta </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Marianna Baragiotta</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (G.S.A. Valsesia) con il tempo di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">41:30.56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, davanti a </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Ilaria Bulanti</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Giulia Visinoni</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">. Da sottolineare anche l&rsquo;ottima prova di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Elisa Mariani</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Altitude Skyrunning Team ASD), che ha chiuso al quarto posto a ridosso del podio.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/PIVOT_FISKY.jpg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Nella categoria </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Youth A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> &egrave; stato </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Cristian Gabriele Pivot</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Atletica Sandro Calvesi) a imporsi con il tempo di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">30:01.86</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">. Sul podio anche il valdostano </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Thierry Cretier</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (ASD Pont Saint Martin), secondo e nuova promessa da seguire con attenzione, mentre il terzo gradino &egrave; andato a </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Luca Beltramelli</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Atletica Monterosa), autore di una prova solida. Tra le donne la vittoria &egrave; andata ad </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Alessandra Sandrino</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Sci Club Pontedilegno e, in un curioso intreccio, una ventina di atleti dello sci alpinismo del Comitato Alpi Centrali era anch&rsquo;essa in ritiro collegiale). Alle sue spalle </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Giulia Framarin</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Pont Saint Martin) ha chiuso seconda, seguita da </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Sofia Bortolotti</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> al terzo posto. L&rsquo;azzurrina </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Lisa Curti</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> si &egrave; fermata ai piedi del podio, quarta con una prestazione di buon livello.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Brignone_FISKY.jpg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Nella distanza </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Adamello Vertical Kilometer</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> il protagonista &egrave; stato </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Davide Magnini</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, capace di sfiorare il primato da lui stesso firmato lo scorso anno, mentre al femminile la giovane </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Martina Pozzi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, U23 e gi&agrave; medaglia d&rsquo;oro ai Mondiali Giovanili, ha brillato stabilendo il nuovo record del percorso. Entrambi hanno cos&igrave; conquistato la 7&ordf; prova del </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">VK Open Championships</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> promosso dalla International Skyrunning Federation.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio Adamello Vertical Kilometer</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">M</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Davide Magnini - ITA - 37&quot;19&#39;96</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Zak Hanna - IRL - 38&quot;27&#39;58</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Pietro Pellegrini - ITA - 38&quot;36&#39;82</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">4. Luca Compagnoni - ITA - 39&quot;38&#39;92</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">5. Vitalii Chernov - AIN - 40&quot;13&#39;30</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">F</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Martina Pozzi - ITA - 45&quot;09 55</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Corinna Ghirardi - ITA - 49&quot;46&#39;69</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Dominika Zupancic Valant - SLO - 51&quot;09&#39;19</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">4. Yuki Ikegami - JPN - 51&quot;52&#39;05</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">5. Sabrina Polito - ITA - 56&quot;50&#39;64&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Mentre la classifica della COPPA ITALIA Giovani &egrave; in elaborazione, il calendario va delineando quelli che sono i protagonisti 2025 con le ultime tre prove. Prossimo appuntamento il 5 ottobre a Calestano (PR) per la Tartufo Running, seguiranno a stretto giro il Morissolo Vertical il 19 ottobre e il VTV Vertical Tube Villeneuve il 2 novembre che proclamer&agrave; i vincitori.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Photo credit Ufficio Stampa FISky</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'A  Vione (BS) in  occasione  della  6^ tappa COPPA  ITALIA Giovani Supported  by  MICO', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_YOUTH(1).jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-09-15 17:44:15', '2025-09-15 17:45:21', NULL, 1),
(250, 'Sergio Bonaldi e Chiara Vitale sono i  Campioni Italiani  SkyMarathon 2025', 'SERGIO BONALDI E CHIARA VITALE SI LAUREANO CAMPIONI ITALIANI SKYMARATHON<br />\r\nLa Tartufo Running disputata lo scorso 5 ottobre a Calestano (PR) ha incoronato i nuovi Campioni Italiani di specialit&agrave; SkyMarathon.<br />\r\nNella gara regina di 43 km per 2.250 m di dislivello positivo, la vittoria &egrave; andata a Sergio Bonaldi (Lab4you), che in 3h47&rsquo;09&rdquo; ha conquistato il titolo italiano superando di soli 32 secondi Danilo Brambilla (ASD Falchi Lecco). Completa il podio Alessandro Ganino (Evolution Sport Team), terzo con un tempo di 4h05&rsquo;05&rsquo;&rsquo;.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Campioanto_Italiano_FISKY_F_2025_TARTUFO_RUNNING.jpg\" style=\"width: 620px; height: 380px;\" /><br />\r\nIn campo femminile trionfa Chiara Vitale (Atl. Reggio), che con il tempo di 4h53&rsquo;17&rdquo; si impone per appena 2 secondi su Laura Basile (Falchi Lecco) portando a casa il tricolore, mentre Camilla Calosso (Piossasco Trail Runners) chiude al terzo posto, staccata di 3&rsquo;20&rdquo;, da sottolineare l&rsquo;altissimo livello competitivo che ha piazzato l&rsquo;arrivo delle prime quattro donne in soli 7 minuti.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'La TARTUFO  RUNNING Â®  ha  incoronato i  nuovi  Campioni', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Campioanto_Italiano_FISKY_2025_TARTUFO_RUNNING.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-11 21:00:50', '2025-10-11 21:00:50', NULL, 1);
