n></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> a Rasura-Valgerola (SO), il </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Trail del Grigne Sud</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> a Mandello del Lario (LC), per chiudere con la gran finale della </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Tartufo Running</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> a Calestano (PR). Ai fini della classifica sono stati conteggiati i migliori cinque risultati ottenuti da ciascun atleta nelle 10 gare in programma.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Confermati i pronostici con la vittoria di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Danilo Brambilla (ASD Falchi Lecco)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, che con 488 punti si &egrave; imposto come assoluto dominatore della stagione, e di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Laura Basile (ASD Falchi Lecco)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, prima tra le donne con 398 punti. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"outline:none; position:static !important\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Alle loro spalle, </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Luca Lafranconi (Falchi Lecco)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> conquista la seconda posizione con 394 punti, mentre </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Camilla Calosso (Piossasco Trail Runners)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> chiude al secondo posto femminile con 378 punti.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"outline:none; position:static !important\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">A completare i podi, </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Giuseppe Pedretti (ASD Pegarun)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, terzo con 392 punti, e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Aurora Bosia (Falchi Lecco)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, terza tra le donne con 366 punti.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_CRAZY_SKYRUNNING_ITALY_CUP_2025_F.jpg\" style=\"width: 650px; height: 377px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Il montepremi, messo in palio da FISky &ndash; Federazione Italiana Skyrunning, ammonta a 4.000 euro e ha premiato i primi tre classificati assoluti, uomini e donne.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Da evidenziare la </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">netta predominanza nelle posizioni di vertice di atleti tesserati per l&rsquo;ASD Falchi Lecco</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, a conferma dell&rsquo;eccellente lavoro svolto dal Presidente Filippo Ugolini capace in questi anni di rafforzare la coesione del gruppo e di investire nella crescita dei giovani talenti.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">L&rsquo;elaborazione della classifica finale &egrave; stata curata dal </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">servizio di cronometraggio </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">we</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">do</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">sport</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> ed &egrave; consultabile al seguente indirizzo:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"outline:none; position:static !important\" />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=772\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"outline:none; text-decoration:none; color:#1474bd; position:static !important\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink:none\">https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=772</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><b style=\"outline:none; position:static !important\">Ufficio Stampa FISky&nbsp;</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"outline:transparent none; text-decoration:none; color:#221e1f; position:static !important\" target=\"_blank\">www.skyrunningitalia.it</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"outline:none; text-decoration:inherit; color:#1474bd; position:static !important\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" data-se-embed=\"true\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/img/logo.png\" style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; max-width:100%; background-image:none; width:86px; height:auto\" title=\"\" /></a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\r\n', 'Vittoria per i falchi Danilo Brambilla e Laura Basile', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/CRAZY_SKYRUNNING_ITALY_CUP_2025_FISKY_M.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-11 22:10:43', '2025-10-11 22:10:43', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `description`, `image`, `author`, `header_image`, `keep_header`, `not_header`, `created`, `modified`, `subtitle`, `status`) VALUES
(252, ' Daniel Thedy e Benedetta Broggi si laureano Campioni Italiani Vertical 2025', '<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Si &egrave; disputato sabato 19 ottobre a Cannero Riviera (VB) il <strong>Morissolo Vertikal</strong>, gara valida per l&rsquo;assegnazione del Titolo Italiano Vertical 2025, che ha incoronato <strong>Daniel Thedy</strong> e <strong>Benedetta Brogg</strong>i nuovi campioni tricolore della specialit&agrave;, autori di due prove di grande solidit&agrave; e carattere.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">L&rsquo;organizzazione curata da A.S.D. Cannero Riviera ha offerto un evento impeccabile, con percorsi preparati nei minimi dettagli, segnaletica perfetta e tracciati &ldquo;soffiati&rdquo; dal foliage autunnale per garantire la massima sicurezza e spettacolarit&agrave;. Ben 323 atleti al via sui due percorsi proposti, con una presenza giovanile significativa che testimonia l&rsquo;ottimo stato di salute dello skyrunning verticale italiano. Il tracciato tricolore &mdash; 3,9 km per 1.070 m di dislivello positivo &mdash; ha confermato la sua fama di vero vertical skyrace, alternando una prima parte pi&ugrave; corribile a tratti tecnici con brevi passaggi attrezzati (I grado UIAA con catene) e un finale &ldquo;a muro&rdquo; che ha messo alla prova anche gli atleti pi&ugrave; preparati.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Ph_Giuseppe_Cerutti-Daniel_Thedy.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 900px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Nella gara maschile </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Daniel Thedy (Outdoor With Us)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> ha conquistato il titolo e il nuovo </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">record del tracciato</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> con un tempo di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">37&rsquo;58&rdquo;46</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, abbassando il precedente primato di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Marcello Ugazio (Sport Project VCO)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"