ze:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Elisa Mariani</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Cristian Gabriele Pivot</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Nel frattempo, lo sguardo &egrave; gi&agrave; rivolto al prossimo appuntamento: il </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">gran finale della CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, in programma il 9 novembre al Vertical Punta Martin di Acquasanta &ndash; Mele (GE).</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline:none; position:static !important; color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Photo credit Fabio R&eacute;an</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'A Villeneuve  (AO)  finale del Circuito  riservato  alle  categorie YOUTH  A  e  B', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/COPPA__ITALIA_YOUTH_FISKY.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-07 14:59:29', '2025-11-07 15:03:54', NULL, 1),
(256, ' Buona la prima, sono i giovani ad inaugurare il primo evento SkyRun in Orienteering', '<strong>La prima SkyRun in Orienteering si &egrave; svolta a Monfalcone il 22 novembre, con gli Azzurrini Fisky protagonisti del debutto ufficiale del nuovo format condiviso con la Fiso. La Nazionale Giovanile di skyrunning ha affrontato prove tecniche di orientamento e sezioni cronometrate in salita, ottenendo risultati significativi nelle categorie Youth A, Youth C e U23. Inserita nel TriOrienteering Challenge, la manifestazione ha rappresentato un passo concreto nella collaborazione tra Fisky e Fiso, unendo formazione, gara e un fine settimana di lavoro comune sui sentieri del Carso.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/588422999_1295093032656000_4639054383493702708_n.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 479px;\" /></strong><br />\r\nEntusiasmo e soddisfazione per l&rsquo;inedita SkyRun in Orienteering disputata sabato 22 novembre a Monfalcone (GO). Dopo la prova ludico-motoria proposta alla Tartufo Running, la TriOrienteering Challenge &egrave; stato il primo evento competitivo capace di unire in modo concreto Skyrunning e Orienteering e pensato per valorizzare ci&ograve; che accomuna questi due sport e discipline annesse &ndash; caratteristiche tecniche e valori.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/589056373_1295092055989431_2644261290254881811_n.jpg\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 496px;\" />\r\n<p>Gli atleti della Nazionale giovanile Fisky &ndash; Federazione Italiana Skyrunning e una rappresentativa di atleti del Comitato Veneto e Comitato Friuli Venezia Giulia Fiso &ndash; Federazione Italiana Sport Orientamento hanno avuto l&rsquo;occasione di mettersi alla prova in orientamento su tracciati arricchiti con tratti in salita su rampe cronometrate disegnati da Clizia Zambiasi, Presidente del Comitato Regionale Friuli Venezia Giulia e mente promotrice dell&rsquo;evento.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Il weekend si &egrave; aperto per i nostri ragazzi con un allenamento collettivo e una serata di formazione sui fondamenti di Orienteering da parte del CT della Nazionale Skyrunning Roberto Mattioli.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/588293918_1295092915989345_3757919604882202582_n(1).jpg\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 467px;\" /><br />\r\nGrande partecipazione dai giovani che hanno risposto con entusiasmo alla convocazione: Lisa Curti (Team Marguareis), Massimiliano Durbano (Boves Run Asd), Elisa Mariani (Altitude Skyrunning Team Asd), Matteo Mariani (Altitude Skyrunning Team Asd), Joseph Philippot (Apd Pont-Saint-Martin), Cristian Gabriele Pivot (Asd Atletica Sandro Calvesi), Enrico Rota Martir (Gs Orobie), Elias Sangalli (100% Anima Trail), Michele Stoppele (Asd Team KM SPORT) si sono distinti in uno sport in cui non avevano esperienza riuscendo a interpretare perfettamente il binomio Skyrunner-Orientista.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>PODIO YOUTH A</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>12 km per 450 m</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Cristian Gabriele Pivot &ndash; Gabriele Giudici (2:18:42)</li>\r\n	<li>Tobia Viel &ndash; Matteo Mariani (2:27:25)</li>\r\n	<li>Ian Tomasin &ndash; Lisa Curti (3:52:36)</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>PODIO YOUTH C</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>20 km per 650 m</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Marco Loner &ndash; Michele Stoppele (3:43:27)</li>\r\n	<li>Leonardo Sestan &ndash; Elias Sangalli (3:48:24)</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>PODIO U23</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>22 km per 780 m</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Joseph Philippot &ndash; Pietro Sergas (4:02:17)</li>\r\n	<li>Enrico Rota Martir &ndash; Riccardo Granzotto (4:14:53)</li>\r\n	<li>Massimiliano Durbano &ndash; Francesco Comarella (4:45:04)</li>\r\n	<li>Giulia Fignon &ndash; Elisa Mariani (4:49:59)</li>\r\n	<li>Matteo Mirolo &ndash; Thomas Michelin (4:57:41)</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Una speciale classifica a squadre sulle cronoscalate derivata dalla Somma dei tempi della coppia nelle 6 rampe.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>YOUTH A</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Matteo Mariani &ndash; Tobia Viel in 18:10</li>\r\n	<li>Gabriele Giudici &ndash; Cristian Gabriele Pivot in 19:25</li>\r\n	<li>Ian Tomasin &ndash; Lisa Curti in 26:58</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>YOUTH C</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Leonardo Sestan &ndash; Elias Sangalli in 49:12</li>\r\n	<li>Marco Loner &ndash; Michele Stoppele in 51:03</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>U23</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Enrico Rota Martir &ndash; Riccardo Granzotto in 48:57</li>\r\n	<li>Joseph Philippot &ndash; Pietro Sergas in 52:50</li>\r\n	<li>Massimiliano Durbano &ndash; Francesco Comarella in 1:04:18</li>\r\n	<li>Giulia Fignon &ndash; Elisa Mariani in 1:08:08</li>\r\n	<li>Matteo Mirolo &ndash; Thomas Michelin in 1:08:38</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>La manifestazione &egrave; stata anche occasione di ritiro per gli Azzurrini, in serata il gruppo giovanile insieme al Tecnico Istruttore Donatello Rota ha partecipato anche alla sprint in notturna corsa all&rsquo;interno del centro cittadino di Monfalcone, gara valevole come Campionato Regionale FVG, completando in autonomia l&rsquo;intera prova.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Domenica Skyrunner e Orientisti hanno avuto modo di rinsaldare i rapporti con un allenamento finale sui sentieri del Carso Goriziano.</p>\r\n\r\n<figure>\r\n<figure>&nbsp;</figure>\r\n</figure>\r\n', ' Entusiasmo e soddisfazione per lâ€™inedita SkyRun in Orienteering disputata  a Monfalcone', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/MONFALCONE_FISO_FISKY.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 19:33:01', '2025-11-29 19:37:17', NULL, 1),
(257, 'FISKY e CONAGAI  per  la  sicurezza sulle  gare  Skyrunning', '<p><strong>Venerd&igrave; 28 novembre si &egrave; tenuto con successo il 6&deg; Corso per Direttori di Percorso presso la prestigiosa Sede ANA - Associazione Nazionale Alpini di Bergamo.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Il corso, riservato esclusivamente a Guide Alpine e Aspiranti Guide Alpine, rappresenta un&#39;importante opportunit&agrave; formativa per l&#39;acquisizione delle competenze necessarie allo svolgimento delle competizioni Skyrunniing.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/IMG_5225.jpeg\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 470px;\" /><br />\r\nLa figura del Direttore di Percorso &egrave; infatti fondamentale per l&#39;organizzazione delle gare nell&#39;ambito dell&#39;attivit&agrave; FISky, dove i percorsi prevedono passaggi esposti e/o richiedono di essere &#39;bonificati&#39;.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>L&#39;iniziativa conferma l&#39;impegno costante nella formazione di professionisti qualificati per garantire sicurezza e qualit&agrave; nelle competizioni di skyrunning del nostro territorio.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/IMG_5223.jpeg\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 398px;\" /></p>\r\n', 'VenerdÃ¬ 28 novembre si Ã¨ tenuto con successo il 6Â° Corso per Direttori di Percorso', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_CORSO_GUIDE_ALPINE.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-01 22:51:16', '2025-12-01 22:51:16', NULL, 1),
(258, 'Convention delle SocietÃ  FISky 2025', '<h3 style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">L&rsquo;incontro &egrave; stato l&rsquo;occasione per fare il punto sulle attivit&agrave; federali, presentare in anteprima i calendari 2026 e celebrare gli atleti della Nazionale e le Societ&agrave; per i risultati ottenuti nel corso della stagione.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#666666\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Sabato 29 novembre, presso la sede ANA &ndash; Associazione Nazionale Alpini di Bergamo, si &egrave; svolta la convention di fine anno della FISky &ndash; Federazione Italiana Skyrunning. L&rsquo;incontro si &egrave; aperto con il saluto del </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Presidente Fabio Meraldi</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, sempre presente nei momenti chiave della vita federale, che ha evidenziato come il 2025 sia stato una stagione straordinaria confermando un trend di crescita sia nella qualit&agrave; sia nel numero delle iniziative e dei partecipanti all&rsquo;interno del movimento dello Skyrunning.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Ph_Davide_Ferrari_-_Meraldi_-_Mattioli_-__Franco_e_Valoti.JPG\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 333px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">I lavori sono stati aperti con un intervento del </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Dr. Paolo Franco &ndash; Assessore della Regione Lombardia</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> che ha sottolineato lo sforzo delle Associazioni Sportive non solo nell&rsquo;organizzazione gare, ma soprattutto nel mantenere vivo lo spirito autentico della montagna: &ldquo;Chi corre in montagna non &egrave; solo sportivo, &egrave; gente sana, determinata e rispettosa della natura e delle regole. La corsa in montagna &egrave; sacrificio, passione e amore per il proprio territorio. &Egrave; un modo di vivere che educa al limite, ma anche alla bellezza del silenzio e del paesaggio. Ogni salita affrontata &egrave; un traguardo conquistato dentro e fuori. Grazie a Fisky per promuovere questi valori con costanza, sostenendo uno sport che fa bene al corpo, ma soprattutto all&rsquo;anima. In montagna non si bara: si vince solo con cuore, gambe e testa. Avanti cos&igrave;, siete un esempio per tutti. W la montagna, W lo sport pulito.&rdquo;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Pensiero condiviso anche da </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Paolo Valoti</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, padrone di casa in rappresentanza dell&rsquo;Associazione Nazionale Alpini di Bergamo saldamente diretta dal Presidente Giorgio Sonzogni. Valoti ha ricordato come lo sport sia una vera scuola di vita e di impegno nella comunit&agrave;, sottolineando la responsabilit&agrave; di chi ricopre ruoli guida nel continuare a motivare i giovani a coltivare e custodire i valori della montagna. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Ph_Davide_Ferrari_-_Top_10_Societa.JPG\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 400px;\" />&nbsp; La parola &egrave; poi passata al Past President Dr. Giulio Sergio Roi, che ha illustrato le statistiche relative all&rsquo;attivit&agrave; 2025. Lo scorso anno il calendario federale ha contato 109 gare, tutte sostenute da garanzie assicurative e misure di sicurezza sui percorsi. Roi ha sottolineato come FISky presti grande attenzione a questi aspetti, citando ad esempio il corso per la formazione dei nuovi Direttori di Percorso appena concluso. Dalla lettura dei dati sono emersi alcuni spunti pratici per gli Organizzatori: lo sport Skyrunning continua a crescere, mentre permane un divario di genere tra gli atleti, suggerendo la possibilit&agrave; di incentivare la partecipazione femminile nelle competizioni giovanili e con percorsi con distanze pi&ugrave; corte. Roi ha inoltre presentato il Ranking annuale degli atleti, strutturato in categorie basate sui record di gara: se un record viene migliorato, il livello della categoria si innalza automaticamente, incentivando la crescita delle performance. Infine, il Past President ha condiviso un ultimo suggerimento: valutare l&rsquo;alternanza biennale delle gare che si svolgono nello stesso fine settimana, per favorire una migliore distribuzione degli eventi e una maggiore partecipazione.</h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Ph_Davide_Ferrari_-_Atleti_Nazionale_Senior.JPG\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 333px;\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Grande soddisfazione &egrave; stata espressa dal </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Vicepresidente e CT della Nazionale, Roberto Mattioli</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> che ha sottolineato come il lavoro degli ultimi anni, volto alla valorizzazione dello Skyrunning in Italia, abbia anche quest&rsquo;anno prodotto risultati eccellenti. Particolarmente significativo &egrave; stato l&rsquo;incremento costante delle Societ&agrave; affiliate FISky e il crescente numero di atleti che, scegliendo di partecipare alle competizioni del calendario federale tramite le Societ&agrave;, dimostrano un autentico senso di appartenenza al movimento. A conferma di questo percorso di crescita, il lavoro della Federazione &egrave; sostenuto anche dal contributo prezioso degli sponsor </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">CRAZY &ndash; Performance Mountainwear from the Italian Alps</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">MICO &ndash; Protection for Performance</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">NORTEC Micro Crampons</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, partners al fianco della FISky da diversi anni.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Il Vicepresidente ha anticipato i calendari agonistici 2026, gi&agrave; pubblicati sul </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"outline:none; text-decoration:none; color:#1474bd; position:static !important\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink:none\">sito ufficiale</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> FISky, con particolare attenzione al primo evento di stagione: la NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup. Il circuito invernale proporr&agrave; 5 gare e introdurr&agrave; una nuova formula di &ldquo;gara affiliata&rdquo; che, pur non facendo parte del calendario regolare, contribuir&agrave; al computo finale dei quattro migliori punteggi utili alla determinazione della classifica finale. Sono stati inoltre messi in evidenza gli appuntamenti di maggiore interesse federale per il 2026, tra cui i Campionati Mondiali in programma dal 18 al 20 settembre a La Gomera nelle Isole Canarie e i Campionati Mondiali Giovanili dall&rsquo;8 al 10 maggio in Croazia, oltre ai Campionati Italiani e ai prossimi raduni di selezione per le Nazionali Senior e Giovanili.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\">Uno spazio della convention &egrave; stato dedicato al circuito Tuscany SkyTrail Tour con l&rsquo;intervento di Giovanni Zorn, Delegato per la Regione Toscana. Zorn ha presentato i risultati della prima edizione che ha visto in calendario quattro manifestazioni per un totale di nove eventi e 1.500 partecipanti, e ha anticipato le novit&agrave; per la seconda: il Trail del Galestro e il Doganaccia Vertical andranno ad inserirsi nel calendario 2026 che partir&agrave; ad aprile con l&rsquo;Elba Trail per proseguire con l&rsquo;Ultra Trail del Mugello, lo SkyTrail Tre Cime del Covigliaio e si concluder&agrave; a settembre con la Lunigiana SkyRace. Il circuito toscano rappresenta una testimonianza concreta della vitalit&agrave; del movimento, unendo eventi che condividono lo stesso approccio etico verso la montagna e sottolineando il forte legame tra Federazione e Organizzatori.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">A seguire, la convention ha ospitato la </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">cerimonia di premiazione</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> con la consegna dei premi in denaro agli atleti della Nazionale che nel 2025 hanno portato l&rsquo;Italia sul gradino pi&ugrave; alto del podio ai Campionati Europei di Skyrunning e SkySnow: Benedetta Broggi, Cristian Minoggio, Daniel Thedy, Corinna Ghirardi, Luca Arrigoni, Marcello Ugazio, Roberta Jacquin, Margherita De Giuli, Lorenzo Rota Martir e Gianluca Ghiano. Sono state premiate inoltre le dieci Societ&agrave; che si sono distinte per l&rsquo;impegno nella diffusione della disciplina agonistica dello Skyrunning.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Il vertice della classifica &egrave; stato raggiunto dalla societ&agrave; ASD Falchi Lecco: al Presidente Filippo Ugolini e a tutti gli atleti del team &egrave; stato riconosciuto l&rsquo;impegno profuso negli ultimi anni nella costruzione di un gruppo unito, sempre partecipe con entusiasmo alle iniziative federali.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Un riconoscimento speciale &egrave; stato inoltre assegnato alla societ&agrave; bergamasca Team Gaaren #BEaHERO, che si conferma come realt&agrave; capace di attrarre il maggior numero di atleti tesserati.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Regolamento e classifica per Societ&agrave; 2025:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-e-Montepremi-per-Societa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"outline:none; text-decoration:none; color:#1474bd; position:static !important\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink:none\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-e-Montepremi-per-Societa</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">La giornata si &egrave; conclusa con la tradizionale foto di gruppo di atleti, dirigenti e ospiti riuniti in un clima di festa e condivisione seguita da un rancio offerto dagli Alpini, momento conviviale che ha permesso a tutti i partecipanti di scambiarsi impressioni e celebrare insieme i risultati della stagione.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"outline: none; line-height: 1.38; position: static !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Photo credit Davide Ferrari</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Lâ€™incontro Ã¨ stato lâ€™occasione per fare il punto sulle attivitÃ  federali', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_CONVENTION_2025.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-01 23:40:02', '2025-12-01 23:44:54', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `description`, `image`, `author`, `header_image`, `keep_header`, `not_header`, `created`, `modified`, `subtitle`, `status`) VALUES
(259, 'La Teglio Winter Run ha assegnato i primi titoli tricolore di stagione', '<p style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; white-space-collapse:preserve\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"text-indent:16.5pt\">Si &egrave; svolta domenica 15 febbraio la 6&ordf; edizione della Teglio Winter Run che, per il secondo anno consecutivo, ha assegnato i titoli di Campionato Italiano SkySnow Classic Assoluti, Youth e Master ed &egrave; stata terza prova della <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/NORTEC-SkySnow-Running-Cup-2026\">NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup 2026</a>, il circuito &ldquo;sui ramponcini&rdquo; organizzato da NORTEC Sport sotto l&rsquo;egida della <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/\">FISky &ndash; Federazione Italiana Skyrunning</a>.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Organizzazione di assoluto livello per il comitato del Valtellina Wine Trail che ha saputo onorare al meglio l&rsquo;assegnazione dei primi titoli italiani 2026 da parte della Federazione, richiamando 350 atleti a Prato Valentino.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">A fare da cornice, una splendida giornata di sole e un percorso ricoperto di neve fresca: 11 km di gara con 965 metri di dislivello positivo, condizioni ideali che hanno esaltato lo spettacolo della competizione in particolare nei tratti pi&ugrave; impegnativi in salita.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Prestazione maiuscola di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Lorenzo Rota Martir</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (G.S. Orobie), che firma una gara autoritaria e va a prendersi il titolo di Campione Italiano SkySnow Classic in 47&rsquo;02&rsquo;&rsquo;, mantenendo un margine di sicurezza su </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Daniel Antonioli</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Team Pasturo), secondo in 48&rsquo;40&rsquo;&rsquo;. Sul terzo gradino del podio sale il talentuoso U23 </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Elia Bongiovanni</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Team Marguareis), che chiude in 49&rsquo;36&rsquo;&rsquo;, confermando tutto il suo potenziale. A completare la top five Pietro Cattaneo (Valtellina Wine Trail) e Stefano Vota (Piossasco Trail Runners).<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/gare/Ph_Giacomo_Meneghello_-_Teglio_winter_run_GM-26-01531.jpg\" style=\"width: 650px; height: 433px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Altissimo anche il livello della competizione femminile, dove </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Anna Hofer</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Valtellina Wine Trail) si conferma in uno straordinario stato di forma, conquistando il tricolore in 54&rsquo;58&rsquo;&rsquo; al termine di una sfida serratissima. Solo dieci secondi il distacco su </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Benedetta Broggi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Sport Project VCO), mentre la sempre solidissima </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Corinna Ghirardi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Skyrunning Adventure) chiude terza in 58&rsquo;21&rsquo;&rsquo;. Quarta posizione per Andrea Schweigkofler (Valtellina Wine Trail), seguita da Alice Minetti (Boves Run Aliaipiedi) quinta al traguardo.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/gare/Ph_Giacomo_Meneghello_-_Teglio_winter_run_GM-26-01538.jpg\" style=\"width: 650px; height: 433px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio femminile</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Anna Hofer (Valtellina Wine Trail) &ndash; 54:58</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Benedetta Broggi (Sport Project VCO) &ndash; 55:11</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Corinna Ghirardi (Skyrunning Adventure) &ndash; 58:21</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Lorenzo Rota Martir (G.S. Orobie ASD) &ndash; 47:02</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Daniel Antonioli (Team Pasturo ASD) &ndash; 48:40</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Elia Bongiovanni (Team Marguareis) &ndash; 49:36</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Oltre ai titoli assoluti, la Teglio Winter Run ha premiato anche i Campioni Italiani SkySnow per le categorie giovanili e master:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><strong>YOUTH</strong>: vittoria di Alessia Pozzi e Pietro Cattaneo (Valtellina Wine Trail)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><strong>U23</strong>: vittoria di Anna Hofer (Valtellina Wine Trail) e Elia Bongiovanni (Team Marguareis)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><strong>Senior</strong>: vittoria di Benedetta Broggi (Sport Project VCO) e Lorenzo Rota Martir (G.S. Orobie)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><strong>Master</strong>: vittoria di Claudia Battaglia (MissulTeam Como) e Venanzio Compagnoni (Valtellina Wine Trail).</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">La <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/NORTEC-SkySnow-Running-Cup-2026\">NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup</a> guarda gi&agrave; al prossimo appuntamento: la nuova gara affiliata Sauze SkySnow Race, in programma il 21 febbraio, che porter&agrave; gli atleti su un percorso tecnico e spettacolare disegnato sulle piste da sci del Comprensorio Vialattea a Sauze d&rsquo;Oulx (TO). Una sfida tutta da vivere, tra neve, ritmo e adrenalina.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Lorenzo Rota Martir e Anna Hofer si laureano Campioni Italiani SkySnow Classic 2026', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/gare/fisky_nortec_Teglio.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-16 16:01:09', '2026-02-16 16:01:09', NULL, 1),
(260, 'Calendario  dei   Corsi  per  \"Istruttori  e  Allenatori  Skyrunning  2026 \"  ', '<strong>La Scuola Nazionale S.I.T. &quot;Dario Busi&quot; ha iniziato l&#39;attivit&agrave; nel 2015 organizzando sino a fine 2025&nbsp; venti&nbsp; corsi per Istruttori e Allenatori di&nbsp; 1&deg;,&nbsp; 2&deg; e&nbsp; 3&deg; Livello.&nbsp; Questi&nbsp; i&nbsp; corsi&nbsp; &nbsp;di&nbsp; 1&deg; ,&nbsp; 2&deg;&nbsp; e&nbsp; 3&deg;&nbsp; livello&nbsp; in&nbsp; programma&nbsp; per&nbsp; il&nbsp; 2026<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/gare/2026_Corso_istruttori_di_1_locadina_template_mod_(1)_page-0001.jpg\" style=\"width: 750px; height: 1061px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/gare/2026_Corso_istruttori_di_2__locadina_template_mod_(1)_page-0001.jpg\" style=\"width: 750px; height: 1061px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/2026_Corso_istruttori_di_3__locadina_template_mod_pages-to-jpg-0001.jpg\" style=\"width: 750px; height: 1061px;\" /></strong>', 'Sono aperte  le  iscrizione  al corso di  1Â° Livello', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/corso_istruttori.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-16 22:37:28', '2026-04-06 18:36:15', NULL, 1),
(261, 'Alex Rigo e Corinna Ghirardi Campioni Italiani SkySnow Vertical 2026', '<p style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Si &egrave; alzato sabato 13 marzo il sipario sulla due giorni del <a href=\"https://www.tarvisiotrailrunning.com/tarvisio-winter-trail-2026/\">Tarvisio Winter Trail </a>con il Vertical Monte Lussari, gara che ha assegnato il tricolore SkySnow Vertical. Protagonista assoluta &egrave; stata la fatica: il cielo sereno e le temperature superiori alle medie stagionali hanno reso la neve particolarmente soffice, rallentando il percorso e trasformando ogni metro di dislivello in una sfida di resistenza e tecnica per i 150 atleti partenti.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">La distanza </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">FULL - 3,6 km con 974 metri di dislivello positivo</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, &egrave; partita puntualmente alle 18:30 dalla base della pista Di Prampero, con spettacolari fuochi d&rsquo;artificio a dare il via. Il tracciato, illuminato per gran parte da lampioni, ha offerto visibilit&agrave; e atmosfera a un evento di grande suggestione. Il profilo altimetrico, con pendenze variabili e picchi del 46% nei tratti iniziale e finale, ha esaltato le qualit&agrave; dei pi&ugrave; forti sin dai primissimi metri.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">In campo maschile, si &egrave; formato subito un terzetto di testa compatto. Lo sloveno Kovacic ha dettato il ritmo nella prima parte, prima di essere superato dall&#39;austriaco Hoffmann &mdash; classe 1974 &mdash; che ha tagliato il traguardo in 35&#39;47&#39;&#39;, conquistando la vittoria assoluta. Il titolo italiano &egrave; andato ad </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Alex Rigo</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Maddalene Sky Marathon), gi&agrave; in <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Nazionale-Senior\">Nazionale Skyrunning </a>e al suo primo appuntamento di corsa dopo la stagione di sci alpinismo: per lui un ottimo 36&#39;40&#39;&#39; e il Tricolore SkySnow Vertical.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/Ph_Giacomo_Meneghello_-_Vertical_Lussari_GM-26-05683.jpg\" style=\"width: 650px; height: 433px;\" /><br />\r\nAl femminile, Benedetta Broggi (Sport Project VCO) ha imposto il proprio ritmo sin dalla partenza, con Corinna Ghirardi e Anna Hofer (Valtellina Wine Trail) nelle immediate retrovie. Nell&#39;avvicinarsi al muro finale, per&ograve;, &egrave; stata </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Corinna Ghirardi</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Skyrunning Adventure) a cambiare marcia in modo decisivo, strappando vittoria e titolo in 42&#39;04&#39;&#39;. Broggi ha chiuso seconda in 43&#39;19&#39;&#39;, mentre Hofer ha completato il podio in 43&#39;47&#39;&#39;, conservando le energie in vista del Monte Mangart Winter Trail di domani, percorso che promette di esaltarne maggiormente le caratteristiche.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/Ph_Giacomo_Meneghello_-_Vertical_Lussari_GM-26-05680.jpg\" style=\"width: 650px; height: 433px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio femminile</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Corinna Ghirardi (Skyrunning Adventure) &ndash; 42:04,69</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Benedetta Broggi (Sport Project VCO) &ndash; 43:19,95</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Anna Hofer (Valtellina Wine Trail) &ndash; 43:47,15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Alex Rigo (Maddalene Sky Marathon) &ndash; 36:40,08</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Daniel Antonioli (Team Pasturo) &ndash; 38:54,45</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Nicola Pais Bianco (Cadini Promotion) &ndash; 39:23,93</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Su richiesta della FISky &ndash; Federazione Italiana Skyrunning, il programma di questa edizione si &egrave; arricchito di una nuova prova pensata su misura per le categorie Youth A (15-16 anni) e Youth B (17-18 anni): parametri calibrati per valorizzare i giovani talenti e accompagnarli in un percorso di crescita agonistica, con uno sguardo gi&agrave; proiettato ai Campionati Mondiali Giovani in programma dall&#39;8 al 10 maggio a Makarska, in Croazia. Dall&#39;intesa tra la Federazione e Maurizio Ragonese &mdash; patron del brand NORTEC &mdash; nasce cos&igrave; la prima edizione della </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">SHORT: 1,2 km con 503 metri di dislivello positivo</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, una formula inedita che ha debuttato con successo nel weekend tarvisiese.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio femminile</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Chiara Dereani (Team Aldo Moro NORTEC) &ndash; 24:00,32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Carlotta Straulino (Team Aldo Moro NORTEC) &ndash; 26:35,82</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Greta Mainardis (Team Aldo Moro NORTEC) &ndash; 28:04,35</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Matteo Ragonese (U.S. Mario Tosi Tarvisio) &ndash; 19:24,92&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Luca Federicis (U.S. Mario Tosi Tarvisio) &ndash; 20:27,42</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Daniel Guizzardi (Valtellina Wine Trail) &ndash; 20:51,32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Oltre ai titoli assoluti, il Vertical Monte Lussari ha premiato anche le categorie giovanili e master:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;YOUTH A: vittoria di Chiara Dereani (Team Aldo Moro NORTEC) e Luca Federicis (U.S. Mario Tosi Tarvisio)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;YOUTH B: vittoria di Greta Mainardis (Team Aldo Moro NORTEC) e Matteo Ragonese (U.S. Mario Tosi Tarvisio)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;U23: vittoria di Anna Hofer (Valtellina Wine Trail) e Massimiliano Durbano (Boves Run)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;Master 40: vittoria di Corinna Ghirardi (Skyrunning Adventure) e Daniel Antonioli (Team Pasturo)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;Master 50: vittoria di Antonella Confortola (U.S. Mario Tosi Tarvisio) e Olivo Da Pra (Skyrunning Adventure)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:disc\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;Master 60: vittoria di Monica Sartogo (U.S. Aldo Moro) e Gianfranco Marini (Maddalene Sky Marathon)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Presente alla gara in veste di osservatore per i giovani, il CT della Nazionale Roberto Mattioli ha speso parole di grande apprezzamento per l&#39;organizzazione della U.S. Mario Tosi, qualit&agrave; confermata anche dai numeri e dalla presenza di atleti provenienti dalla Valle d&rsquo;Aosta e dalla Valtellina che non sono voluti mancare a Tarvisio. Non &egrave; mancata una lettura tecnica della gara: &laquo;Il Vertical &egrave; una disciplina molto impegnativa che fa gi&agrave; una prima selezione naturale: le pendenze non sono adatte a tutti e, su tracciati di questo tipo, la differenza la fanno soprattutto leggerezza e tecnica di corsa, non &egrave; un caso che la vincitrice Ghirardi sia una delle migliori nell&rsquo;uso dei bastoncini&raquo;.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Archiviata la prima delle due prove del weekend, il palcoscenico si sposta alle pendici del Monte Mangart per il Monte Mangart Winter Trail, la prova Classic della due giorni tarvisiese. Un tracciato di circa 15 km con 515 metri di dislivello positivo, pi&ugrave; scorrevole, che promette una gara dall&#39;esito tutt&#39;altro che scontato<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCredit photo: Giacomo Meneghello</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'A  Tarvisio  sulla  pista  che  conduce  Monte  Lussari', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/tarvisio_skysnow_vertical(1).jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-15 18:04:39', '2026-03-15 18:04:39', NULL, 1),
(262, 'Anna Hofer e  Daniel  Antonioli si  aggiudicano  il  Circuito NORTEC SkySnow ', '<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Domenica 14 marzo si &egrave; concluso il circuito <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/NORTEC-SkySnow-Running-Cup-2026\">NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup 2026 </a>che con la Tarvisio Winter Trail ha incoronato Daniel Antonioli e Anna Hofer: vincitori della tappa finale e dell&#39;intera rassegna.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Il tracciato da 15 km con 515 metri di dislivello, con partenza dal Lago Superiore di Fusine, ha messo alla prova quasi 200 atleti in condizioni tutt&#39;altro che agevoli: la pioggia caduta fino a pochi minuti prima dello start ha reso il fondo scivoloso e imprevedibile, rendendo la gara ancora pi&ugrave; selettiva. Il percorso, disegnato alle pendici del Monte Mangart, con il suo continuo saliscendi e il punto pi&ugrave; alto al Rifugio Zacchi a 1380 metri, si &egrave; rivelato pi&ugrave; duro del previsto prima della discesa finale verso il traguardo.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Proprio in quella discesa conclusiva si &egrave; decisa la gara maschile. <b>Daniel Antonioli</b> (Team Pasturo) ha avuto la meglio sull&#39;austriaco <strong>Christian Hoffmann </strong>in un duello serrato, tagliando il traguardo a braccia alzate in 1h11&#39;40&quot;.&nbsp; Hoffmann gi&agrave; vincitore il giorno prima sulle pendenze del Monte Lussari, ha chiuso secondo in 1h13&#39;03&quot;, mentre il veterano<strong> Marco De Gasperi</strong> (Team Kima) ha completato il podio in 1h13&#39;23&quot;. Nei piazzamenti successivi <strong>Emanuele Manzi</strong> (Valtellina Wine Trail ) in 1h16&#39;09&quot; e il giovane <strong>Federico Mussi</strong> &ndash; classe 2005 &ndash; in 1h17&#39;30&quot; (G.S.A. Valsesia).<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/IMG_5837.jpeg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 413px;\" /></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">In campo femminile <b>Anna Hofer</b> (Valtellina Wine Trail) ha risposto al terzo posto nel Vertical del giorno precedente con una prestazione dominante. Sin dai primi chilometri ha imposto il proprio ritmo, chiudendo in 1h19&#39;51&quot; e confermando una supremazia mai messa in discussione lungo tutte e cinque le tappe del circuito, che ha vinto a punteggio pieno. Alle sue spalle <strong>Benedetta Broggi</strong> (Sport Project VCO) &ndash; vincitrice del circuito 2025 &ndash; in 1h22&#39;05&quot; e <strong>Corinna Ghirardi</strong> (Skyrunning Adventure), prima al Monte Lussari, a soli 16&quot; dal secondo posto. A seguire <strong>Andrea</strong> <strong>Schweigkofler</strong> (Valtellina Wine Trail) in 1h24&#39;38&quot; e la giovane <strong>Martina Pozzi</strong> (G.S Mario Corti 1959) in 1h32&#39;57&quot;.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/IMG_5851.jpeg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 383px;\" /></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Si chiude cos&igrave; un&#39;edizione itinerante che ha attraversato alcune delle location invernali pi&ugrave; suggestive del nord Italia: dai Pian dei Resinelli con la Snow Run Resinelli, alla notturna di Schia Tizzano con la SkySnow Schia Monte Caio,&nbsp; Val di&nbsp; Mello Winter Trail, passando per la Teglio Winter Run in Valtellina,&nbsp; alla Sauze SkySnow Race, fino al gran finale tarvisiano.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><strong>Classifica femminile circuito</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/NORTEC-SkySnow-Running-Cup-2026\">NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup</a></strong></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">1. <strong>Anna Hofer</strong> (Valtellina Wine Trail) &ndash; 400 pt</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">2. <strong>Benedetta Broggi</strong> (Sport Project&nbsp; VCO) - 352 pt</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">3. <strong>Corinna Ghirardi</strong> ( Skyrunning Adventure ) - 344 pt<br />\r\n4. <strong>Camilla Calosso </strong>( Piossasco Trail Runners ) - 300 pt</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">5. <strong>Andrea Schweigkofler</strong> ( Valtellina Wine Trail ) - 288 pt</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">6. <strong>Giorgia Fascendini</strong> ( Atletica Alto Lario) - 278 pt.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Classifica maschile circuito <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/NORTEC-SkySnow-Running-Cup-2026\">NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup</a></span></span></span></strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">1. <strong>Daniel Antonioli</strong> (Team Pasturo) &ndash; 360&nbsp; pt</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">2. <strong>Emanuele Manzi</strong> (Valtellina Wine Trail ) - 316 pt</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">3. <strong>Luca Boninsegna</strong> (Valtellina Wine Trail ) - 280 pt</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">4. <strong>Joseph Philippot</strong> ( APD Pont-Saint-Martin) - 272 pt</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">5. <strong>Michele Stoppele</strong> (Team KM Sport) - 242 pt</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">6. <strong>Massimiliano Durbano</strong> ( Boves Run ) - 234 pt.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'Tarvisio - Laghi  Fusine', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_tarvisio_skysnow_classic.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-15 18:54:31', '2026-03-15 18:54:31', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `description`, `image`, `author`, `header_image`, `keep_header`, `not_header`, `created`, `modified`, `subtitle`, `status`) VALUES
(263, 'La Sky del Canto 2026 incorona Magri e Bonzi e lancia i giovani verso i Mondiali di Makarska, Croazia', '<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Domenica 22 marzo, sulle montagne di Carvico in provincia di Bergamo, la Sky del Canto ha dato il via ufficiale sia alla CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup sia alla Coppa Italia YOUTH A e B supported by MICO, circuito che ha mosso i suoi primi passi proprio su queste montagne quattro anni fa contribuendo in modo significativo alla crescita del movimento giovanile italiano.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">La Sky del Canto ha richiamato atleti da diverse regioni per un totale di 460 concorrenti al via. Clima ideale e percorso in condizioni perfette hanno fatto da cornice a una competizione di altissimo livello, organizzata in modo impeccabile dalla Carvico Skyrunning sotto la guida del direttore di gara Alessandro Chiappa. A testimoniare il prestigio dell&#39;evento, la presenza dei vertici federali: il Vice Presidente e Commissario Tecnico della FISky Roberto Mattioli ha seguito da vicino le giovani promesse dello Skyrunning, anche in virt&ugrave; del fatto che la gara rappresenta una delle prove di qualificazione al Mondiale giovanile in programma a Makarska, in Croazia, dall&#39;8 al 10 maggio prossimi.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/IMG_5890.jpeg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-indent: 16.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\">Sul percorso lungo &mdash; 22 chilometri e 1.280 metri di dislivello positivo &mdash; &egrave; </span></span></span></span><span style=\"text-indent: 16.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">Luca Magri (ASD La Recastello)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"text-indent: 16.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"> a tagliare per primo il traguardo con il crono di 1h38&#39;52&quot;. Alle sue spalle il compagno di squadra Isacco Costa (1h43&#39;00&quot;), seguito da Giuseppe Pedretti (ASD Pegarun) in 1h44&#39;21&quot;. Completano la top 5 Stefano Roncareggi (Sportiva Valbronese) e Mattia Gianola (Lab4you SSD). Da segnalare la bella prestazione degli Under 23: oltre al gi&agrave; citato Roncareggi, si distingue nella top 10 anche Federico Mussi (G.S.A. Valsesia), segnale incoraggiante per il futuro dello Skyrunning italiano.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/20260322_-_0046_-_sky_del_canto_-_ph._cristian_riva.jpg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 427px;\" /></span></span></span></span>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Al femminile splendida vittoria per </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Vivien Bonzi (ASD La Recastello)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> in 1h56&#39;52&quot;, che precede di soli 29 secondi Elisa Desco (Team Kima). Terzo gradino del podio per Arianna Dentis (Atletica Saluzzo) in 1h58&#39;23&quot;, seguita da Alice Minetti (Boves Run) e Beatrice Bianchi (ASD La Recastello).</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio femminile Sky del Canto Classic</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Vivien Bonzi (ASD La Recastello) &ndash; 01:56:52</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Elisa Desco (Team Kima) &ndash; 01:57:21</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Arianna Dentis (Atletica Saluzzo) &ndash; 1:58:23</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile Sky del Canto Classic</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Luca Magri (ASD La Recastello) &ndash; 01:38:52&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Isacco Costa (ASD La Recastello) &ndash; 01:43:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Giuseppe Pedretti (ASD Pegarun) &ndash; 01:44:21</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Sul tracciato corto &mdash; 13 chilometri e 700 metri di dislivello, pensato per le categorie YOUTH &mdash; </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Marco Magistro (A.P.D. Pont-Saint-Martin)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> si impone con autorit&agrave; in 1h01&#39;36&quot;, davanti a Elias Sangalli (100% Anima Trail) in 1h04&#39;26&quot; e Cristian Gabriele Pivot (A.S.D. Atletica Sandro Calvesi, 1h08&#39;16&quot;). Quarta piazza per Fabio Agazzi (Runners Bergamo), quinto Pietro Fornelli (A.S.D. Baudenasca). Tra le giovani promesse si mettono in luce Daniel Guizzardi ed Enea Grazioli, entrambi portacolori del Valtellina Wine Trail, confermando la vivacit&agrave; e la qualit&agrave; del nostro vivaio giovanile.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/PHOTO-2026-03-22-10-13-59.jpg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Tra le donne trionfa </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Claudia Previtali (ASD La Recastello)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> in 1h13&#39;14&quot;, seguita da Chiara Di Ceglie (Vannoni Running Team, 1h15&#39;49&quot;) e Claudia Locatelli (Atletica Valle Brembana, 1h17&#39;10&quot;). Completano la top 5 Alessia Basso (Trisessanta A.S.D.) e Daiana Concilio (O.S.A. Valmadrera). Meritano una menzione speciale la figlia d&#39;arte Camilla Barnes (Barnes Trail and Road ASD), prima nella categoria YOUTH A, e Lisa Curti, che conquista il secondo posto nella stessa categoria nonostante una caduta in gara che ne ha condizionato il risultato finale.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio femminile Sky del Canto 13K</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Claudia Previtali (ASD La Recastello) &ndash; 01:13:14</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Chiara Di Ceglie (Vannoni Running Team) &ndash; 01:15:49</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Claudia Locatelli (Atletica Valle Brembana) &ndash; 01:17:10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile Sky del Canto 13K</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Marco Magistro (A.P.D. Pont-Saint-Martin) &ndash; 01:01:36&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Elias Sangalli (100% Anima Trail) &ndash; 01:04:26</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Cristian Gabriele Pivot (A.S.D. Atletica Sandro Calvesi) &ndash; 01:08:16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoratio