H AF</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Camilla Barnes (Barnes Trail and Road ASD)&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Lisa Curti (Team Marguareis)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Classifica YOUTH BM</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Marco Magistro (A.P.D. Pont-Saint-Martin)&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Elias Sangalli (100% Anima Trail)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Cristian Gabriele Pivot (A.S.D. Atletica Sandro Calvesi)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'La Sky del Canto ha dato il via ufficiale sia alla CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup sia alla Coppa Italia YOUTH A e B supported by MICO', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/SKY_DEL_CANTO.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-25 07:49:28', '2026-03-25 07:49:39', NULL, 1),
(264, 'Skyrunning e scienza: prosegue la collaborazione tra FISKY e CeRiSM', '<p>Entra nel suo terzo anno il progetto di ricerca e preparazione atletica dedicato agli skyrunner, sviluppato presso il <a href=\"https://www.univr.it/it/biblioteche/centro-di-ricerca-sport-montagna-salute-ce-ri-s-m-/\"><strong>Centro di Ricerca Sport Salute Montagna (CeRiSM)</strong></a> di Rovereto. Marted&igrave; 24 marzo 2026 ha preso il via una nuova sessione di test, alla quale ha partecipato una prima serie di atleti appartenenti alle <strong>Squadre Nazionali U23 e Senior</strong>.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_CERISM_2026_a.jpeg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Il protocollo scientifico, elaborato congiuntamente dai preparatori e dai tecnici della <strong>Federazione Italiana Skyrunning &ndash; FISKY</strong> e dai ricercatori e medici del <a href=\"https://www.univr.it/it/biblioteche/centro-di-ricerca-sport-montagna-salute-ce-ri-s-m-/\">CeRiSM,</a> nasce con un obiettivo ambizioso: costruire un corpus di dati e studi sugli atleti d&#39;&eacute;lite impegnati sui percorsi tecnici e in alta quota tipici dello skyrunning, per restituire loro indicazioni medico-scientifiche precise e dettagliate su cui fondare e pianificare la propria preparazione atletica.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_CERISM_2026_d.jpeg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>La collaborazione, avviata nel 2024, conferma anno dopo anno la propria solidit&agrave; e il proprio valore. Base logistica delle sessioni di test &egrave; il <a href=\"https://www.montedimezzocorona.it/\"><strong>Monte di Mezzocorona</strong></a>, dove gli atleti affrontano percorsi appositamente selezionati per raccogliere dati reali e significativi direttamente sul campo, in condizioni quanto pi&ugrave; vicine possibile a quelle della competizione.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_CERISM_2026_b.jpeg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /></p>\r\n', 'MartedÃ¬ 24 Marzo iniziata una  nuova  sessione  di  test', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_CERISM_g.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-25 09:57:49', '2026-03-25 09:58:37', NULL, 1),
(265, 'Lo Skyrunning  diventa tesi  di  laurea', '<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Ieri, presso il <b>CeRiSM &ndash; Centro di Ricerca &quot;Sport, Montagna e Salute&quot;</b>, istituito dall&#39;Universit&agrave; di Verona il 1&deg; dicembre 2010, si &egrave; tenuta una significativa discussione di tesi di laurea magistrale dedicata al mondo dello skyrunning.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Il CeRiSM rappresenta un polo di eccellenza nella ricerca scientifica applicata allo sport e alla montagna. Le sue principali aree di ricerca e formazione comprendono:</span></span></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Attivit&agrave; sportiva in Montagna</b></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Attivit&agrave; fisica e Salute</b></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Adattamento e Risposte funzionali agli Ambienti straordinari</b></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Il Centro svolge attivit&agrave; di ricerca di base e applicata nell&#39;ambito dell&#39;attivit&agrave; fisica e sportiva, con particolare attenzione alle risposte dell&#39;organismo all&#39;ambiente naturale e a condizioni straordinarie, quali ipossia e ipo/ipertermia.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">In questo prestigioso contesto, <b>Sabo Sebastian Carol</b> ha discusso la sua tesi di laurea magistrale dal titolo:</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><i>&quot;Training volume e training intensity distribution nello skyrunning: analisi dell&#39;andamento in atleti di interesse nazionale e ricadute sulla performance&quot;<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/IMG_5936.jpeg\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 640px;\" /></i></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">All&#39;esposizione hanno presenziato il <b>CT della Nazionale di Skyrunning, Roberto Mattioli</b>, e <b>cinque atleti della Nazionale</b>, i quali hanno potuto riesaminare i risultati dei propri test raccolti nel corso degli anni precedenti. Al termine della discussione, tutti si sono congratulati con il <b>neo Dottore Sabo Sebastian Carol</b> per l&#39;eccellenza del lavoro svolto.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Un esempio virtuoso di come la ricerca scientifica e lo studio accademico possano tradursi in strumenti concreti a disposizione degli atleti, contribuendo al <b>miglioramento continuo delle loro performance</b>.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'UniveritÃ  di Verona - CeRiSM â€“ Centro di Ricerca \"Sport, Montagna e Salute\", ', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_CERISM_h.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-27 13:39:34', '2026-03-27 13:43:45', NULL, 1),
(266, 'Nazionale Italiana Skyrunning: una settimana intensa al Monte di Mezzocorona', '<p>Domenica 29 marzo si &egrave; calato il sipario su una settimana ricca di emozioni, fatica e determinazione per gli atleti della Nazionale Italiana Skyrunning. Dal <a href=\"https://www.univr.it/it/biblioteche/centro-di-ricerca-sport-montagna-salute-ce-ri-s-m-/\">CeRisSM</a> di Rovereto &mdash; dove nei primi giorni si sono svolti i test con un gruppo selezionato di atleti &mdash; fino alle pendici del<a href=\"https://www.montedimezzocorona.it/\"> Monte di Mezzocorona,</a> il programma ha vissuto il suo momento pi&ugrave; significativo con quindici giovani azzurri e azzurre protagonisti assoluti.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_CERISM_2026_d.jpeg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\nVenerd&igrave;, sabato e domenica, i ragazzi e le ragazze della Nazionale Giovani hanno affrontato con grinta e concentrazione una serie di test completi: sulla carrabile che sale verso <a href=\"https://visitdolomiti.info/sentiero-malga-kraun/\">Malga Kraun</a>, in pista, in palestra e lungo lo storico sentiero che da Mezzocorona risale il Monte su uno sviluppo di 2.500 metri e 640 metri di dislivello positivo. Un percorso esigente, che ha messo alla prova ogni fibra e ogni centimetro di preparazione atletica.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Non &egrave; un caso che il Monte di Mezzocorona venga considerato il <strong>&quot;Centro Federale&quot;</strong> della Federazione Italiana Skyrunning: una palestra naturale straordinaria, capace di offrire tutte le condizioni ideali per testare i veri skyrunner. Un luogo che attira sempre pi&ugrave; atleti e appassionati di outdoor, facilmente raggiungibile anche grazie alla<a href=\"https://www.montedimezzocorona.it/funivia/prezzi-e-orari/\"> funivia</a>, con la suggestione unica del <strong>ponte tibetano</strong> &mdash; 120 metri di lunghezza, sospeso a 200 metri di quota &mdash; e della <strong>Sky Walk</strong> a 650 metri, da cui si apre una panoramica mozzafiato sulla Piana Rotaliana.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_MEZZOCORONA__f.jpeg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Questi test non sono semplici allenamenti: sono una bussola preziosa, un punto di riferimento fondamentale in vista di un appuntamento che tutta la squadra aspetta con ambizione e voglia di stupire. I <strong>Campionati Mondiali Youth e U23</strong>, in programma in Croazia dall&#39;<strong>8 al 10 maggio</strong>, sono l&#39;obiettivo. E la Nazionale si sta preparando per arrivarci al massimo della forma.</p>\r\n', 'In  preparazione  per  i  Mondiali Youth - U23  in  Croazia  a  Maggio', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/SKY_WALK_FISKY.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-04-02 18:59:20', '2026-04-03 18:20:56', NULL, 1),
(267, 'Si  Ã¨  concluso il  primo  corso  2026  del  S.I.T. - Settore Istruzione Tecnica', '<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Sabato 4 aprile si &egrave; concluso con grande successo a Vezzano sul Crostolo (RE) il 21&deg; Corso del S.I.T. &ndash; Settore Istruzione Tecnica, dedicato alla formazione dei quadri istruttori e allenatori di Skyrunning.</b></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Al Corso per Istruttori di 1&deg; Livello hanno preso parte ben 25 partecipanti provenienti da numerose regioni d&#39;Italia: Piemonte, Lombardia, Emilia-Romagna, Veneto, Toscana, Lazio e Abruzzo, a testimonianza del crescente interesse e della diffusione capillare di questa disciplina su tutto il territorio nazionale.</span></span></span><br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/IMG_6033.jpeg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 450px;\" /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Sotto la guida esperta del Responsabile del S.I.T., Giuliano Gherardi, i partecipanti hanno affrontato con impegno e ottimi risultati le esercitazioni pratiche previste dal programma: tecniche di orientamento, gestione delle salite e delle discese, corretto utilizzo dei bastoncini e principi fondamentali della preparazione atletica specifica.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_Istruttori_1_livello_2026_a_(5).jpeg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 450px;\" /></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Tutti i corsisti hanno superato brillantemente sia le prove pratiche sia la prova finale scritta, articolata in un questionario che abbracciava l&#39;intero programma didattico affrontato durante il corso. Le materie oggetto di valutazione hanno coperto un ventaglio completo di competenze: i regolamenti della Federazione Italiana Skyrunning, cartografia e orientamento, aspetti legali, meteorologia, gestione del gruppo, primo soccorso e principi di base della preparazione atletica. Un risultato che testimonia la seriet&agrave; e la qualit&agrave; della formazione offerta dal S.I.T., nonch&eacute; la dedizione e la preparazione di tutti i partecipanti.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_Istruttori_1_livello_2026_a_(4).jpeg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 450px;\" /></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">Per chi desidera continuare il proprio percorso formativo, &egrave; disponibile sul sito <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/notizia/260/Calendario_dei_Corsi_per_Istruttori_e_Allenatori_Skyrunning_2026\" style=\"color:#467886; text-decoration:underline\">www.skyrunningitalia.it</a> il calendario completo dei corsi di 2&deg; e 3&deg; Livello in programma per il 2026.</span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'Con  la  presenza  di 25 partecipanti provenienti da varie regioni d\'Italia', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/CORSO_1_LIVELLO_2026.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-04-05 17:51:00', '2026-04-06 18:03:27', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `description`, `image`, `author`, `header_image`, `keep_header`, `not_header`, `created`, `modified`, `subtitle`, `status`) VALUES
(268, 'Campionati Mondiali  Skyrunning  Youth e U23', '<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Si chiude con un ottimo bilancio l&#39;avventura degli Azzurrini ai Campionati Mondiali Giovanili di Skyrunning 2026 disputati a Makarska, Croazia l&rsquo;8-10 maggio. Otto medaglie individuali, terzo posto nella classifica per Nazioni e prestazioni di altissimo livello in tutte le categorie: la spedizione tricolore guidata dal CT Roberto Mattioli ha confermato di essere al vertice dello skyrunning internazionale anche nel movimento giovanile.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_medaglie_Mondiali_Youth.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 400px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">La decima edizione dei Campionati Mondiali Giovanili di Skyrunning ha visto 208 atleti provenienti da 32 Paesi e cinque continenti confrontarsi in due discipline &ndash; VERTICAL e SKY &ndash; sulle spettacolari pendici del Biokovo, con il Mar Adriatico a fare da cornice a ogni passo di gara.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Magistro.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 400px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Nel Vertical Kilometer disputato venerd&igrave; l&#39;Italia si &egrave; subito fatta sentire. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Martina Pozzi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (G.S. Mario Corti 1959 ASD) ha conquistato un fantastico </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">argento tra le Under 23</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, dimostrando fin da subito di essere tra le protagoniste assolute della rassegna. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Marco Magistro</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (APD Pont-Saint-Martin ASD) ha risposto con una gara di testa nella Youth B, chiusa con il </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">bronzo</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> al collo.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Pozzi.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 400px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Tra le giovani promesse sono da segnalare anche le prestazioni di </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Alessia Pozzi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Valtellina Wine Trail SSD) che ha sfiorato il podio nella Youth C con un quarto posto di grande spessore, mentre nella Youth A si sono messi in luce </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Mattia Consol</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (APD Pont-Saint-Martin ASD), </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Lisa Curti</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Team Marguareis ASD) &mdash; il cui crono avrebbe valso la top five nelle categorie superiori &mdash; e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Daniel Guizzardi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Valtellina Wine Trail SSD), tutti nella top ten. Nella Youth B hanno tenuto alta la bandiera azzurra anche </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Giulia Framarin</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (APD Pont-Saint-Martin ASD) e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Cristian Gabriele Pivot</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (ASD Atletica Sandro Calvesi).&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Se il Vertical aveva gi&agrave; regalato emozioni, la prova SKY ha consegnato all&#39;Italia i suoi momenti pi&ugrave; belli. Le categorie Youth C e U23 si sono sfidate sui 20,5 km con 1.450m di dislivello positivo; Youth A e B sui 12,5 km con 1.150m+.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Marco Magistro</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> ha confermato il suo stato di forma con un </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">argento nella Youth B</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, aggiungendo il </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">bronzo nella combinata</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Martina Pozzi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> ha replicato la prestazione del Vertical con un nuovo </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">argento nella U23 e nella combinata</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> nella sua categoria. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Alessia Pozzi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> ha completato il percorso con un meritato </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">bronzo nella Youth C</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, mentre </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Elia Bongiovanni</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Team Marguareis ASD) ha conquistato il </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">bronzo nella U23</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, regalando all&#39;Italia un finale di gara da applausi.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Bongiovanni_Elia.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 400px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Dietro ai podi, l&#39;Italia ha continuato a esprimersi su livelli altissimi. Nella Youth A maschile </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Thierry Cretier</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (APD Pont-Saint-Martin ASD) e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Daniel Guizzardi</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> hanno chiuso rispettivamente ottavo e nono; </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Lisa Curti</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> ha sfiorato la top five femminile, mentre </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Camilla Barnes</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (Barnes Trail and Road ASD) ha centrato un ottimo ottavo posto all&#39;esordio assoluto in maglia azzurra. Nella Youth B si sono messi in evidenza anche </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Elias Sangalli</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> (100% Anima Trail ASD) e </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Cristian Gabriele Pivot</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">, sesto e decimo; </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Giulia Framarin</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"> ha chiuso settima tra le donne.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Roberto Mattioli commenta cos&igrave; il risultato mondiale: &laquo;Siamo tornati a casa con nove medaglie complessive e un ottimo terzo posto nella Classifica per Nazioni. Ma quello che ci rende pi&ugrave; orgogliosi &egrave; il livello complessivo della squadra: abbiamo avuto atleti competitivi in tutte le categorie, in entrambe le discipline. Questo &egrave; il segnale pi&ugrave; importante &mdash; lo skyrunning giovanile italiano &egrave; vivo, radicato e sta crescendo.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Questi risultati non arrivano per caso. Dietro a ogni atleta c&#39;&egrave; una Societ&agrave; che lavora ogni giorno sul territorio, che investe tempo ed energie nella formazione dei giovani, spesso lontano dai riflettori. A loro va il nostro ringraziamento pi&ugrave; sentito: senza il lavoro quotidiano di tecnici e dirigenti insieme a tutto lo Staff tecnico federale, questo palcoscenico non sarebbe raggiungibile.&raquo;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'L\'Italia si  conferma  ai  vertici  Internazionali  anche  con  i  Giovani', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_MAKARSKA.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-05-13 21:55:45', '2026-05-13 22:22:10', NULL, 1),
(269, 'Campionato  Italiano SkyRunning a coppie', '<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Domenica 7 giugno si &egrave; disputata la 50&ordf; edizione della storica Maratona Valle Intrasca, con partenza e arrivo a Intra di Verbania (VB). La gara, designata anche quest&#39;anno dalla FISky &ndash; Federazione Italiana Skyrunning come Campionato Italiano SkyRun a coppie, ha confermato il ruolo della classica verbanese come appuntamento cardine del calendario skyrunning nazionale.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Cinquant&#39;anni di storia e un&#39;edizione che non ha tradito le attese, la Maratona Valle Intrasca ha celebrato il proprio mezzo secolo di vita con una prova all&#39;altezza: 310 coppie al via sulla distanza principale di 33,75 km e 1.625 metri di dislivello positivo, dal Lago Maggiore fino al Rifugio Pian Cavallone, per un totale record di quasi 900 atleti in gara tra la distanza principale e la Mezza Valle Intrasca.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_M_VALLE_INTRASCA.jpg\" style=\"width: 620px; height: 465px;\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Alla prima uscita insieme, Roberto Giacomotti e Matteo Borgnolo (Sport Project VCO) hanno scritto una delle pagine pi&ugrave; belle dell&#39;edizione del cinquantenario. La coppia ha condotto una gara di altissimo profilo, mantenendo a lungo i ritmi del record della corsa e tagliando il traguardo in 2h52&#39;04&quot;: un risultato che vale la vittoria assoluta e il titolo di Campioni Italiani SkyRun a coppie 2026. Per Giacomotti &egrave; la seconda affermazione alla Valle Intrasca dopo il successo del 2023.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Luca Arrigoni e Giuseppe Pedretti (ASD Pegarun Pegacross) hanno chiuso secondi in 2h58&#39;59&quot;, mentre il terzo gradino del podio &egrave; andato a Gianluca Pinton (ASD Run Fast) e Carlo Bonnet (Sport Project VCO) in 2h59&#39;57&quot;. Particolarmente significativa la prestazione di Bonnet, che ha portato a termine l&#39;intera gara nonostante una frattura al polso: un gesto di determinazione che non &egrave; passato inosservato.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_W_VALLE_INTRASCA.jpg\" style=\"width: 620px; height: 465px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">In campo femminile non ci sono stati margini di sorpresa: Aurora Bosia e Aurora Invernizzi (ASD Falchi Lecco) hanno rispettato il pronostico della vigilia imponendosi in 3h49&#39;53&quot; e conquistando anche loro il titolo tricolore. Un successo netto, costruito con continuit&agrave; e gestione impeccabile del percorso.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Il podio del Campionato Italiano si &egrave; completato con Monica Moia e Simona Lo Cane in 4h25&#39;10&quot; e Stefania Rossi e Giulia Zani (Sport Project VCO) in 4h26&#39;26&quot;. Nella classifica assoluta di gara si sono inserite Chiara Cerlini e Claudia Cartini &mdash; seconde in 4h12&#39;06&quot; &mdash; e Marta Ferrari ed Elena Peretti, terze in 4h19&#39;17&quot; ma non in gara per il tricolore in quanto atlete non affiliate FISky.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Nella categoria mista la coppia Sara Locatelli ed Ermes Biselli ha dominato con pieno convincimento, chiudendo in 3h29&#39;34&quot; con quasi tredici minuti di vantaggio su Luca Sogni e Silvia Longo. Terzo posto per i biellesi Margherita De Giuli e Stefano Comerro in 3h50&#39;49&quot;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n', 'Giacomotti - Borgnolo e Bosia - Invernizzi  sono  i  Campioni 2026', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Valle_Intrasca_2026.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-06-10 08:30:17', '2026-06-10 08:30:17', NULL, 1),
(270, 'Concluso  il  Corso Istruttori  2Â° livello  ', 'Sabato 27&nbsp; e&nbsp; domenica&nbsp; 28&nbsp; Giugno&nbsp; si&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; concluso&nbsp; a&nbsp; Vezzano sul&nbsp; Crostolo (RE)&nbsp; il&nbsp; Corso di&nbsp; 2&deg; livello&nbsp; per&nbsp; Istruttori Skyrunning .&nbsp; Alla&nbsp; verifica&nbsp; finale ,&nbsp; strutturata&nbsp; su&nbsp; due&nbsp; giorni,&nbsp; fra&nbsp; prove&nbsp; pratiche e scritte,&nbsp; &nbsp;hanno&nbsp; preso&nbsp; parte&nbsp; 19&nbsp; partecipanti&nbsp; provenienti&nbsp; da&nbsp; diverse&nbsp; Regioni&nbsp; d&#39;Italia,&nbsp; a testimonianza del&nbsp; crescente&nbsp; interesse e&nbsp; della diffusione&nbsp; di&nbsp; questo&nbsp; sport&nbsp; con&nbsp; le&nbsp; relative&nbsp; discipline.&nbsp; &nbsp;Numeri&nbsp; che&nbsp; attestano&nbsp; la&nbsp; qualit&agrave;&nbsp; del&nbsp; lavoro&nbsp; del&nbsp; S.I.T. - Settore&nbsp; Istruzione&nbsp; Tecnica&nbsp; della&nbsp; FISKY- Federazione&nbsp; Italiana Skyrunning ;&nbsp; lavoro&nbsp; iniziato 12&nbsp; anni&nbsp; orsono&nbsp; che&nbsp; prosegue&nbsp; con&nbsp; grande&nbsp; interesse.<br />\r\nNel&nbsp; corso&nbsp; del&nbsp; corrente&nbsp; anno&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; in&nbsp; programma&nbsp; un&nbsp; corso&nbsp; per&nbsp; Allenatori&nbsp; di&nbsp; 3&deg; livello&nbsp; dal&nbsp; 26&nbsp; Ottobre&nbsp; al&nbsp; 29&nbsp; Novembre.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_2_LIVELLO_2026.jpeg\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 480px;\" />', 'Sabato e  domenica 27 e 28 Giugno a  Vezzano sul Crostolo (RE)', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_2026_2_livello.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-06-30 16:30:28', '2026-06-30 16:30:28', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `description`, `image`, `author`, `header_image`, `keep_header`, `not_header`, `created`, `modified`, `subtitle`, `status`) VALUES
(271, 'Ghiano e Jacquin si laureano Campioni Italiani SkyMarathon 2026', '<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Sabato 11 luglio l&#39;Alta Valle Spluga ha fatto da cornice all&#39;11&ordf; edizione della Pizzostella Skyrunning, che ha assegnato per la prima volta i titoli di Campione Italiano SkyMarathon FISky 2026, assoluti e di categoria, sulla distanza di 42 km e 3.600 m D+: un traguardo che ha fregiato con il tricolore il progetto sportivo dell&#39;ASD Amici di Fraciscio, impeccabile organizzatrice della manifestazione.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Quasi 300 gli atleti al via da Fraciscio-Campodolcino (SO) tra le due competitive in programma, a testimonianza del crescente interesse suscitato dall&#39;evento. Vista l&#39;allerta per il peggioramento meteo previsto nel pomeriggio sulle quote alte del percorso, gli organizzatori, d&#39;intesa con la direzione di gara, hanno deciso di anticipare di trenta minuti la partenza di entrambe le prove: una scelta che ha permesso a SkyMarathon e SkyRace di scattare in una finestra di maggiore stabilit&agrave; atmosferica, tutelando al meglio la sicurezza degli atleti impegnati sulle vette del Pizzo Groppera e del Pizzo Sommavalle.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Grande attesa per la gara regina, che ha regalato un confronto di altissimo livello grazie alla presenza dei detentori dei record del percorso, William Boffelli (ASD Fast Run) e Roberta Jacquin (ASD Pegarun Pegacross), tornati al via per difendere i primati fissati nell&#39;edizione 2024, rispettivamente in 4h43&#39;10&quot; e 6h15&#39;02&quot;.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Tra gli uomini &egrave; Boffelli a dettare il ritmo fin dalle prime battute: il bergamasco transita per primo alla Forcella d&#39;Avero e al Pizzo Sommavalle, dove migliora di circa due minuti il proprio intertempo del 2024 passando in 1h29&#39;, per poi tagliare il traguardo in 4h45&#39;38&#39;&#39; e conquistare la vittoria assoluta. Boffelli, tuttavia, non rientra nella classifica del Campionato Italiano in quanto sprovvisto della maglia della societ&agrave; di appartenenza, come previsto dai regolamenti FISky: il titolo tricolore va cos&igrave; a Gianluca Ghiano (ASD Baudenasca), che chiude la propria prestazione in 5h21&#39;48&#39;&#39;. Completano il podio Giuseppe Pedretti (ASD Pegarun Pegacross), all&#39;arrivo in 5h25&#39;36&#39;&#39;, e Filiberto Vaira (Altitude Skyrunning Team), quarto in 5h31&#39;10&#39;&#39;. Quinta piazza per Luca Arrigoni (ASD Pegarun Pegacross) che ferma il cronometro in 5h31&#39;40&#39;&#39;.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong style=\"text-indent: 16.5pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; position: static !important;\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">In campo femminile &egrave; invece Roberta Jacquin a prendere subito il comando, confermando le sensazioni espresse alla vigilia su un percorso che l&#39;aveva gi&agrave; vista trionfare due anni fa: la valdostana bissa cos&igrave; la vittoria e conquista il titolo di Campionessa Italiana SkyMarathon con il tempo di 6h17&#39;01&#39;&#39;. Alle sue spalle un&#39;ottima Aurora Bosia (ASD Falchi Lecco), seconda in 6h42&#39;12&#39;&#39;, davanti alla compagna di squadra Marianna Colombo, terza in 7h13&#39;55&#39;&#39;. Chiudono la top 5 Rachael Skye Sturm (Team Valtellina ASD, 7h32&#39;26&#39;&#39;) e Tanya Fabbris (ATF NO FLAT, 8h03&#39;25&#39;&#39;).</span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong><br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px; position: static !important;\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Podio femminile Campionato Italiano SkyMarathon</span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Roberta Jacquin (ASD Pegarun Pegacross)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Aurora Bosia (ASD Falchi Lecco)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Marianna Colombo (ASD Falchi Lecco)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/CAMP_ITAL_SKYMAR_Jacquin.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 400px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile Campionato Italiano SkyMarathon</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Gianluca Ghiano (ASD Baudenasca)&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Giuseppe Pedretti (ASD Pegarun Pegacross)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Filiberto Vaira (Altitude Skyrunning Team)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/CAMP_ITAL_SKYMAR_ghiano.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 400px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Accanto alla SkyMarathon si &egrave; disputata anche la Pizzostella SkyRace, 27 km e 2.430 m D+ con arrivo massimo al Pizzo Sommavalle (2.760 m): le due gare sono partite insieme da Fraciscio, per poi dividersi all&#39;Alpe Angeloga, dove gli atleti della SkyRace hanno imboccato la via del rientro mentre quelli della SkyMarathon hanno proseguito verso il tratto pi&ugrave; tecnico del tracciato.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Sulla distanza corta si &egrave; imposto Daniel Antonioli (Team Pasturo), protagonista nel 2024 del duello con Boffelli sulla marathon e quest&#39;anno alla SkyRace per preservare un ginocchio che gli sta dando qualche fastidio e gestire al meglio il prosieguo della stagione. Il lecchese ha preso subito il comando della gara, tagliando il traguardo in 3h12&#39;42&#39;&#39;. Alle sue spalle Paolo Bonanomi (ASD Falchi Lecco), secondo in 3h22&#39;22&#39;&#39;, ed Eddj Nani (Skyrunning Adventure), terzo in 3h29&#39;22&#39;&#39;. Completano la top 5 Andrea Ricchi (Val Brevettola), quarto in 3h37&#39;50&#39;&#39;, e Dario Rigonelli (OSA Valmadrera), quinto in 3h41&#39;01&#39;&#39;.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Al femminile Margherita De Giuli (Climb Runners) ha confermato fin dai primi chilometri il ruolo di favorita, conquistando la vittoria in 4h13&#39;24&#39;&#39;. Seconda Enrica Falcinella (G.P. Valchiavenna) in 4h38&#39;09&#39;&#39;, davanti a Giorgia Fascendini (Sky Lario Runners ASD), terza in 4h42&#39;55&#39;&#39;. Chiudono la top 5 Irene Lubrini (Lab4You SSD), quarta in 4h46&#39;13&#39;&#39;, e Daniela Busnelli (ASD Pegarun Pegacross), quinta in 4h51&#39;06&#39;&#39;.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Oltre ai titoli assoluti la Pizzostella SkyMarathon ha assegnato anche i titoli di Campione Italiano di categoria, premiando la profondit&agrave; e la partecipazione trasversale che continuano a caratterizzare lo skyrunning italiano.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Campioni Italiani U23:&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">(M) Lorenzo Caccia (Sky Lario Runners ASD)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Campioni Italiani Master 40:&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">(M) Andrea Begnis (ATF NO FLAT)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Campioni Italiani Master 45:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">(F) Giulia Tonini (Mugello O