ngero (Team Marguareis, 42&rsquo;11&rsquo;&rsquo;), quarto Paolo Daniele (Boves Run) in 43&rsquo;19&rsquo;&rsquo;, quinto Massimiliano Durbano (Boves Run, 44&rsquo;49&rsquo;&rsquo;); doppietta quindi per il portacolori dello Sport Project VCO, capace di imporsi sia in Vertical sia in Skyrace nello stesso weekend. Al femminile prima Charlotte Roy in 50&rsquo;28&rsquo;&rsquo;, davanti a Martina Pozzi (G.S. Mario Corti 1959, 51&rsquo;25&rsquo;&rsquo;) e Camilla Calosso (Piossasco Trail Runners ASD, 53&rsquo;48&rsquo;&rsquo;). Chiudono la top 5 Francesca Blengino (Team Marguareis, 56&rsquo;19&rsquo;&rsquo;) e Chiara Musso con il tempo di 56&rsquo;28&rsquo;&rsquo;.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio femminile Vertical</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wr