ion-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Luca Lafranconi (ASD Falchi Lecco) &ndash; 41:25.58</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Matteo Blangero (Team Marguareis) &ndash; 42:11.17</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Domenica, in contemporanea con la Skyrace, si &egrave; disputata anche la SkyRun da 20 km e 1.400 m D+, pensata per chi si affaccia alla corsa in montagna senza affrontare i tratti pi&ugrave; tecnici del percorso maggiore. Al maschile vittoria di Mattia Bertoli in 2:26:13.68, davanti a Stefano Giordano (2:26:13.82, staccato di soli 14 centesimi) e Remi Rudino (2:32:14), quarto e quinto Aimone Mussinatto 2h33&rsquo;15&rsquo;&rsquo; e Matteo Maria Rittano 2h35&rsquo;54&rsquo;&rsquo;. Al femminile primato per Francesca Blengino (Team Marguareis) in 2:58:04, seguita da Irene Brignolo (Mentecorpo S.S.D., 2:58:42) e Cecilia Vergano (3:15:59), completano il podio Franca Cagnotti (Boves Run, 3h18&rsquo;48&rsquo;&rsquo;) e Veronica Bottero in 3h20&rsquo;03&rsquo;&rsquo;.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio femminile SkyRun 20 km</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Francesca Blengino (Team Marguareis) &ndash; 02:58:04</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Irene Brignolo (Mentecorpo S.S.D.) &ndash; 02:58:42</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Cecilia Vergano &ndash; 03:15:59</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile SkyRun 20 km</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Mattia Bertoli &ndash; 02:26:13.68&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Stefano Giordano &ndash; 02:26:13.82&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Remi Rudino &ndash; 02:32:14</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Verso il gran finale di Coppa Italia</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">. Dopo la tappa di Bersezio, la CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup 2026 si sposter&agrave; il 20 settembre a Pasturo (LC) per la Zacup Skyrace del Grignone (27 km, 2.650 m D+), penultimo atto prima del gran finale del 4 ottobre alla Tartufo Running di Calestano (PR), sul percorso SkyUltra di 50 km e oltre 3.070 m D+, che incoroner&agrave; i campioni della Coppa Italia 2026.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<h6 style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">28 luglio 2026</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></h6>\r\n', 'Valle  Stura Skyrace -  Beserzio (CN)', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/CAMP_ITAL_FISKY_VALLE_STURA(1).jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-07-31 15:33:32', '2026-07-31 15:33:32', NULL, 1),
(273, 'Test al  CERISM di  Rovereto e sessione di  recupero al Monte di Mezzocorona', 'In&nbsp; prossimit&agrave; degli&nbsp; imminenti&nbsp; Campionati&nbsp; Mondiali&nbsp; Skyrunning&nbsp; che&nbsp; si&nbsp; disputeranno a&nbsp; La Gomera - Isole Canarie (Spagna)&nbsp; dal&nbsp; 18 al&nbsp; 20&nbsp; Settembre, si&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; concluso&nbsp; nei&nbsp; giorni&nbsp; scorsi&nbsp; il&nbsp; secondo&nbsp; blocco&nbsp; di&nbsp; test&nbsp; &nbsp; presso&nbsp; il&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.cerism.it/\">CERISM&nbsp;</a>&nbsp; a Rovereto.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/IMG_7279.jpeg\" style=\"width: 550px; height: 413px;\" /><br />\r\nIl&nbsp; protocollo&nbsp; prevedeva&nbsp; test&nbsp; incrementali&nbsp; specifici&nbsp; per&nbsp; lo&nbsp; skyrunning,&nbsp; eseguiti&nbsp; in&nbsp; ambiente&nbsp; normossico&nbsp; e&nbsp; in&nbsp; ambiente&nbsp; ipossico&nbsp; con&nbsp; ulteriori&nbsp; approfondimenti&nbsp; e&nbsp; valutazioni&nbsp; dopo&nbsp; attivit&agrave;&nbsp; prolungata.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/IMG_7294.jpeg\" style=\"width: 550px; height: 413px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\nI&nbsp; test&nbsp; eseguiti&nbsp; su&nbsp; pi&ugrave;&nbsp; giorni,&nbsp; hanno&nbsp; visto&nbsp; il&nbsp; selezionato&nbsp; gruppo&nbsp; di&nbsp; atleti&nbsp; della&nbsp; Nazionale&nbsp; Italiana&nbsp; eseguire&nbsp; il&nbsp; recupero&nbsp; sui sentieri&nbsp; del&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.montedimezzocorona.it/\">Monte&nbsp; di&nbsp; Mezzocorona</a> ,&nbsp; da&nbsp; anni&nbsp; &nbsp;base&nbsp; e&nbsp; &quot;palestra&nbsp; naturale&quot;&nbsp; dello&nbsp; Skyrunning&nbsp; &nbsp;italiano , grazie&nbsp; alla&nbsp; fattiva&nbsp; collaborazione&nbsp; del <a href=\"https://www.comune.mezzocorona.tn.it/\">Comune&nbsp; di&nbsp; Mezzocorona</a>', 'Terminato il  secondo  blocco di  test  incrementali', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/FISKY_mezzocorona_agosto_2026.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-08-29 17:40:49', '2026-08-29 17:44:46', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `description`, `image`, `author`, `header_image`, `keep_header`, `not_header`, `created`, `modified`, `subtitle`, `status`) VALUES
(274, 'Barnes, Guizzardi, Brizio e Sangalli campioni italiani Youth ', '<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Domenica 6 settembre a Rasura (SO) assegnati i quattro titoli del Campionato Italiano FISky YOUTH A e B, tappa anche della <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/COPPA-ITALIA-Giovani-2026-supported-by-MICO\">Coppa Italia Giovani supported by MICO.</a> Nello stesso scenario il Valgerola Vertical ha messo in palio la terza prova della <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Vertical-Italy-Cup-2026\">CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup,</a> con due nuovi record di percorso.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">La Bitto Youth Skyrunning, organizzata dallo Sport Race Valtellina a Rasura (SO), ha assegnato domenica i quattro tricolori del Campionato Italiano riservato alle categorie YOUTH A e B, su un percorso di 10,3 chilometri e 790 metri di dislivello positivo tra sentieri e alpeggi. La prova &egrave; stata valevole anche come tappa della <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/COPPA-ITALIA-Giovani-2026-supported-by-MICO\">Coppa Italia Giovani supported by MICO</a>.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Il verdetto pi&ugrave; combattuto porta la firma di Elias Sangalli (100% Anima Trail), primo assoluto della giornata in 58&#39;47&quot; e nuovo Campione Italiano YOUTH B al termine di una volata decisa da appena due secondi su Davide Songini (Sport Race Valtellina, 58&#39;49&quot;). Chiude il podio Filippo Bertazzini (Valtellina Wine Trail) in 59&#39;53&quot;.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/Martina_Redaelli_Youth_Rosetta_Sky_Race_2026-24.jpg\" style=\"width: 550px; height: 367px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile Youth B &ndash; Bitto Youth Skyrunning</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Elias Sangalli (100% Anima Trail) &ndash; 00:58:47</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Davide Songini (Sport Race Valtellina) &ndash; 00:58:49</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Filippo Bertazzini (Valtellina Wine Trail) &ndash; 00:59:53</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Nella YOUTH A il titolo va a Daniel Guizzardi (Valtellina Wine Trail), che completa il percorso in 1h01&#39;44&quot; davanti a Thierry Cretier (A.P.D. Pont-Saint-Martin, 1h02&#39;44&quot;) e Leonardo Rovedatti (Team Valtellina ASD, 1h03&#39;57&quot;).</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/Martina_Redaelli_Youth_Rosetta_Sky_Race_2026-26.jpg\" style=\"width: 550px; height: 367px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile Youth A &ndash; Bitto Youth Skyrunning</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Daniel Guizzardi (Valtellina Wine Trail) &ndash; 01:01:44</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Thierry Cretier (A.P.D. Pont-Saint-Martin) &ndash; 01:02:44</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Leonardo Rovedatti (Team Valtellina ASD) &ndash; 01:03:57</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Al femminile la YOUTH B incorona Alyssa Brizio (A.S.D. Caddese) che ha preceduto l&#39;intero gruppo femminile in 1h16&#39;44&quot;. Nella YOUTH A si impone Camilla Barnes (Barnes Trail and Road ASD), seconda tra tutte le donne in 1h18&#39;53&quot;, davanti a Lisa Curti (Team Marguareis, 1h31&#39;05&quot;).</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/Martina_Redaelli_Youth_Rosetta_Sky_Race_2026-39.jpg\" style=\"width: 550px; height: 367px;\" />\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio femminile Youth B &ndash; Bitto Youth Skyrunning</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Alyssa Brizio (A.S.D. Caddese) &ndash; 01:16:44</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio femminile Youth A &ndash; Bitto Youth Skyrunning</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Camilla Barnes (Barnes Trail and Road ASD) &ndash; 01:18:53</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Lisa Curti (Team Marguareis) &ndash; 01:31:05</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Sulla stessa Valgerola, con partenza mezz&#39;ora prima, si &egrave; corso anche il Valgerola Vertical, terza tappa della CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup 2026. Una giornata da incorniciare anche su questo percorso: cadono entrambi i record del tracciato di sola salita, 5,5 chilometri e 1.280 metri di dislivello positivo verso i 2.150 metri di Cima Rosetta.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Al maschile Daniel Thedy (A.P.D. Pont-Saint-Martin) ha avuto la meglio sul campione uscente Marcello Ugazio (Sport Project VCO) soltanto nelle ultime rampe, chiudendo in 47&#39;35&quot; e migliorando di 31 secondi il primato che lo stesso Ugazio deteneva dal 2025. Terzo Luca Lafranconi (ASD Falchi Lecco) in 52&#39;17&quot;.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile Valgerola Vertical</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Daniel Thedy (A.P.D. Pont-Saint-Martin) &ndash; 00:47:35</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Marcello Ugazio (Sport Project VCO) &ndash; 00:48:06</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Luca Lafranconi (ASD Falchi Lecco) &ndash; 00:52:17</span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Copione diverso in campo femminile, dove Paola Stampanoni (Morissolo) ha condotto in solitaria dalla partenza fino a Cima Rosetta, abbassando a 56&#39;03&quot; il record che apparteneva a Benedetta Broggi. Alle sue spalle Corinna Ghirardi (Skyrunning Adventure), seconda in 59&#39;54&quot;, e Alice Minetti (Boves Run), terza in 1h00&#39;59&quot;.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio femminile Valgerola Vertical</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Paola Stampanoni (Morissolo) &ndash; 00:56:03</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Corinna Ghirardi (Skyrunning Adventure) &ndash; 00:59:54</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Alice Minetti (Boves Run) &ndash; 01:00:59</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">A organizzare la doppia giornata &egrave; stato lo Sport Race Valtellina del presidente Massimo Zugnoni, che a Rasura cura da anni la storica International Rosetta Skyrace e dal 2025 alterna la manifestazione al format Valgerola Vertical.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-left:19px; margin-right:16px; text-indent:16.5pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Il circuito CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup, dopo Carate Urio e il Rocciamelone, si sposta ora in Val Camonica: appuntamento il 13 settembre a Vione (BS) con l&#39;Adamello Vertical Kilometer, che assegner&agrave; anche i Campionati Italiani Vertical assoluti e di categoria.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'alla Bitto Youth Skyrunning', 'https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/news/VALGEROLA.jpg', '', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-09-08 11:32:21', '2026-09-08 11:40:00', NULL, 1),
(275, 'Ghirardi e Thedy si laureano Campioni Italiani Vertical 2026', '<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Domenica 13 settembre si &egrave; disputata la quarta edizione dell&rsquo;Adamello Vertical Kilometer e, con il sole ad accompagnare la giornata, sono stati Corinna Ghirardi e Daniel Thedy a dominare la distanza regina e conquistare il titolo di Campionessa e Campione Italiani Vertical 2026. Quasi un centinaio gli atleti che si sono dati appuntamento sotto l&#39;arco allestito nella piazzetta del Municipio di Vione (BS), pronti ad affrontare un percorso impegnativo nella cornice del comprensorio Pontedilegno-Tonale organizzato in maniera impeccabile dal comitato dell&rsquo;Adamello Ultra-Trail ASD.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">In gara uomini Thedy (A.P.D. Pont-Saint-Martin) ha chiuso una prestazione solida in 36&#39;10&quot;, davanti ad Alex Rigo (Maddalene Sky Marathon) secondo in 37&#39;07&quot; e Cesare Peter Bettoli (Sport Project VCO), terzo in 37&#39;20&quot;. Quarto Davide Magnini (Adamello Ultra-Trail) in 37&#39;32&quot;, quinto Luca Magri (ASD La Recastello) in 37&#39;49&quot;.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; text-indent:16.5pt; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Nel podio in rosa Ghirardi (Skyrunning Adventure) si &egrave; imposta in 44&#39;54&quot; precedendo Alice Minetti (Boves Run) all&rsquo;arrivo in 45&#39;24&quot; e Anna Lena Hofer (Valtellina Wine Trail) terza in 47&#39;30&quot;. Completano la top 5 Martina Pozzi (G.S. Mario Corti 1959) quarta in 48&#39;20&quot; e Cristina Filippini (Adamello Ultra-Trail) in 49&#39;13&quot;.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio femminile AVK - Adamello Vertical Kilometer</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">1. Corinna Ghirardi (Skyrunning Adventure) &ndash; 00:44:54,36</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">2. Alice Minetti (Boves Run) &ndash; 00:45:24,87</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">3. Anna Lena Hofer (Valtellina Wine Trail) &ndash; 00:47:30,57</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-right:16px; margin-left:19px\"><strong style=\"position:static !important; color:#222222; font-family:Arial; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">Podio maschile AVK - Adamello Vertical Kilometer</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"position:static !important; line-height:1.38; margin-