ning/crazy-skysnow-italy-cup-0\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.sportdimontagna.com/skyrunning/crazy-skysnow-italy-cup-0</a></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.tbpress.it/2023/02/schia-monte-caio-si-conferma-un-alto-livello-degli-atleti/\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.tbpress.it/2023/02/schia-monte-caio-si-conferma-un-alto-livello-degli-atleti/</a></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.podisti.net/index.php/cronache/item/9754-schia-monte-caio-si-conferma-l-alto-livello-degli-atleti-in-gara.html\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.podisti.net/index.php/cronache/item/9754-schia-monte-caio-si-conferma-l-alto-livello-degli-atleti-in-gara.html</a></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.biocorrendo.it/2023/01/riparte-la-coppa-italia-di-skyrunning.html\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.biocorrendo.it/2023/01/riparte-la-coppa-italia-di-skyrunning.html</a></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.sportmediaset.mediaset.it/running/minoggio-e-pallini-sempre-piu-leader-di-crazy-skysnow-italy-cup-by-fisky_61905086-202302k.shtml\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.sportmediaset.mediaset.it/running/minoggio-e-pallini-sempre-piu-leader-di-crazy-skysnow-italy-cup-by-fisky_61905086-202302k.shtml</a></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.sportmediaset.mediaset.it/running/nata-pronta-luse-skysnow-debutto-in-societa-con-scudetto-tricolore-vertical_60815427-202302k.shtml\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.sportmediaset.mediaset.it/running/nata-pronta-luse-skysnow-debutto-in-societa-con-scudetto-tricolore-vertical_60815427-202302k.shtml</a></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.sportmediaset.mediaset.it/running/ultra-skymarathon-mezza-e-short-rendez-vous-in-sardegna-con-villacidro-skyrace_60403897-202302k.shtml\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.sportmediaset.mediaset.it/running/ultra-skymarathon-mezza-e-short-rendez-vous-in-sardegna-con-villacidro-skyrace_60403897-202302k.shtml</a></span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'default', 0, '2023-03-14'),
(147, 'Minoggio (Dinamo Team) e Pallini (ASD Pegarun) si  aggiudicano la CRAZY SkySnow Italy Cup', '<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Crazy_SKY_SNOW_ITALY_CUP_2023.jpg\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 468px;\" /><br />\r\n<strong><em>A&nbsp; Domobianca&nbsp; la&nbsp; Luse SkySnow Vertical,&nbsp; tappa conclusiva del&nbsp; Circuito&nbsp; Crazy SkySnow Italy Cup ha assegnato anche i titoli Vertical della specialit&agrave;&nbsp; invernale.</em></strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Marcello Ugazio</strong> e <strong>Benedetta Broggi </strong>tricolori &quot;only up&quot;, <strong>Cristian Minoggio</strong> ed <strong>Elisa Pallini </strong>si aggiudicano la classifica finale di <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-SkySnow-Italy-Cup-2023\">Crazy SkySnow Italy Cup by FISky.</a><br />\r\nClassifiche&nbsp; complete&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-SkySnow-Italy-Cup-2023\"> QUI</a>&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNonostante l&rsquo;ottima prestazione di Marcello Ugazio e Bendetta Broggi (entrambi Sport Project VCO), il re e la regina del Crazy SkySnow Italy Cup sono stati Cristian Minoggio (Team Dinamo), che con un punteggio ben al di sopra degli avversari aveva gi&agrave; ipotecato da tempo il gradino pi&ugrave; alto del podio, e Elisa Pallini (ASD Pegarun), al femminile. Sul podio anche Gianluca Ghiano (ASD Santiano Dante) e Cristina Germozzi (ASD Pegarun) &ndash; secondo posto maschile e femminile &ndash; e Matteo Lora e Giulia Pol (terzo gradino del podio nelle categorie uomini e donne, entrambi tesserati Skyrunning Adventure).&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTerminata la parentesi invernale, la FISky si prepara all&rsquo;avvio dei tre circuiti estivi ,&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Skyrunning-Italy-Cup-2023\">Crazy Skyrunning Italy Cup </a>,&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Vertical-Italy-Cup-2023\">Crazy Vertical Italy Cup</a> e&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/COPPA-ITALIA-Giovani-2023\">Coppa Italia Giovani supported by Loacker</a> ,&nbsp; che si apre gi&agrave; il prossimo fine settimana con la Sky del Canto (Carvico &ndash; Bg). Tra gli appuntamenti imminenti&nbsp; da non perdere anche il Trail dei Corni (Valbrona &ndash; CO), giunto alla quinta edizione e che si svolge il prossimo 2 aprile (26km 1900 D+/-). Entrambe le gare sono un ottimo modo per aprire una stagione che&nbsp; promette di essere lunghissima.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLa situazione provvisoria della&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-e-Montepremi-per-Societa\">&nbsp;classifica&nbsp; per&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;, che&nbsp; prevede&nbsp; a&nbsp; fine&nbsp; 2023&nbsp; l&#39;assegnazione&nbsp; di&nbsp; un&nbsp; montepremi&nbsp; di&nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; 13.000,00 ,&nbsp; al&nbsp; &nbsp;termine&nbsp; del&nbsp; circuito&nbsp; invernale SkySnow&nbsp; &nbsp;&egrave;&nbsp; la&nbsp; seguente :<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/classifica_societa_FISKY.JPG\" style=\"width: 746px; height: 489px;\" />', 'default', 0, '2023-03-20'),
(148, 'Grande partecipazione al 15Â° Corso organizzato dalla \"Scuola Nazionale Settore Istruzione Tecnica \'Dario Busi\'\"', '<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_CORSO_1_LIVELLO_2023.jpg\" style=\"width: 720px; height: 441px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\nIl&nbsp; 15&deg; Corso&nbsp; organizzato&nbsp; dalla&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Formazione-Istruttori-e-Allenatori-Skyrunning\">Scuola&nbsp; Nazionale &quot;Dario Busi&quot;&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;per&nbsp; la&nbsp; formazione&nbsp; di&nbsp; tecnici della&nbsp; Federazione&nbsp; Italiana Skyrunning&nbsp; si &egrave;&nbsp; concluso&nbsp; il&nbsp; 18&nbsp; Marzo&nbsp; con&nbsp; le&nbsp; prove&nbsp; pratiche&nbsp; &nbsp; e&nbsp; la&nbsp; verifica&nbsp; finale&nbsp; presso&nbsp; la&nbsp; sede&nbsp; &nbsp;di&nbsp; Vezzano&nbsp; sul&nbsp; Crostolo (RE).<br />\r\n30&nbsp; i&nbsp; partecipanti&nbsp; che&nbsp; hanno&nbsp; conseguito&nbsp; l&#39;attestato&nbsp; di&nbsp; Istruttore&nbsp; di&nbsp; 1&deg; Livello&nbsp; dopo&nbsp; una&nbsp; formazione&nbsp; di&nbsp; 30&nbsp; ore.<br />\r\nLa soddisfazione espressa&nbsp; dai&nbsp; numerosi&nbsp; partecipanti&nbsp; &nbsp;rappresentano&nbsp; la&nbsp; conferma&nbsp; del&nbsp; buon&nbsp; lavoro&nbsp; condotto&nbsp; in&nbsp; prima&nbsp; persona dal&nbsp; 2015 dal responsabile&nbsp; del&nbsp; S.I.T.&nbsp; &nbsp; Giuliano&nbsp; Gherardi&nbsp; e&nbsp; dai&nbsp; docenti&nbsp; che&nbsp; mettono&nbsp; a&nbsp; disposizione&nbsp; le&nbsp; loro&nbsp; competenze&nbsp; per&nbsp; lo&nbsp; sviluppo&nbsp; della&nbsp; disciplina dello&nbsp; Skyrunning&nbsp; sul&nbsp; territorio&nbsp; nazionale.<br />\r\nProssimi&nbsp; appuntamenti:<br />\r\n-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Giudici-di-gara\">Corso per Giudici di gara dal 26 Aprile</a><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Formazione-Istruttori-e-Allenatori-Skyrunning\">- Corso per Istruttori 2&deg; Livello dall &#39; 8 Maggio<br />\r\n- Corso per Istruttori 3&deg; Livello dal&nbsp; 23 Ottobre&nbsp;</a>', 'default', 0, '2023-03-25'),
(149, 'Le gare  in calendario  nelle  prossime  settimane', '<strong>Queste&nbsp; le gare&nbsp; in&nbsp; programma nel&nbsp; mese&nbsp; di&nbsp; Aprile&nbsp; e&nbsp; Maggio 2023&nbsp; inserite&nbsp; nel&nbsp; calendario ufficiale&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp; I&nbsp; link&nbsp; ai&nbsp; singoli&nbsp; &nbsp;eventi&nbsp; sono&nbsp; &nbsp;raggiungibili&nbsp; dal&nbsp; sito :</strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-Gare-2023\"><strong> www.skyrunningitalia.it</strong></a><br />\r\n<strong>Buone gare&nbsp; a&nbsp; tutti.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Gare_Aprile_e_Maggio_2023.JPG\" style=\"width: 1319px; height: 467px;\" />', 'default', 0, '2023-03-31'),
(150, 'Raduno della Nazionale a Mezzocorona (TN)', '<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Raduno_Mezzocorona.jpg\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 467px;\" /><br />\r\nIl primo raduno collegiale della&nbsp; Nazionale&nbsp; Italiana&nbsp; Skyrunning&nbsp; del&nbsp; 2023, si&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; tenuto&nbsp; a&nbsp; Mezzocorona (TN) , Centro Federale FISky,&nbsp; &nbsp;dal&nbsp; 31&nbsp; Marzo al 2 Aprile.&nbsp; Coordinati dal&nbsp; CT&nbsp; Roberto Mattioli&nbsp; i&nbsp; prepartori atletici Davide Catti e Saverio Ottolini ed&nbsp; il&nbsp; fisioterapista Andrea Puccetti,&nbsp; hanno intensamente&nbsp; lavorato&nbsp; con&nbsp; &nbsp;atlete / i&nbsp; &nbsp;adottando&nbsp; un&nbsp; protocollo&nbsp; di&nbsp; test&nbsp; ritenuti&nbsp; ideali&nbsp; per la&nbsp; disciplina&nbsp; alpinistica dello&nbsp; skyrunning,&nbsp; tesi&nbsp; ad&nbsp; individuare punti&nbsp; forti&nbsp; e&nbsp; punti deboli&nbsp; sui&nbsp; quali&nbsp; &nbsp;le&nbsp; atlete / i&nbsp; potranno&nbsp; poi lavorare&nbsp; con l&#39;ausilio&nbsp; dei&nbsp; loro&nbsp; preparatori.<br />\r\nUn&nbsp; raduno&nbsp; ad&nbsp; inizio&nbsp; della&nbsp; stagione&nbsp; agonistica ,&nbsp; che&nbsp; vedr&agrave;&nbsp; la&nbsp; Nazionale&nbsp; Italiana Campione del&nbsp; Mondo in&nbsp; carica&nbsp; impegnata&nbsp; a&nbsp; difendere&nbsp; i titoli&nbsp; ai&nbsp; prossimi&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.gransassoskyrace.it/\">Campionati&nbsp; Mondiali&nbsp; Giovani</a>&nbsp; in&nbsp; Agosto&nbsp; al&nbsp; Gran Sasso (AQ)&nbsp; e&nbsp; ai&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunning-serbia.com/en/kalendar-2023/prokletije-vk-skyrace-skyultra-4-30-50km/\">&nbsp;Campionati&nbsp; Europei&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;in&nbsp; Luglio&nbsp; in&nbsp; Montenegro.&nbsp;', 'default', 0, '2023-04-14'),
(151, 'Promozione  e  comunicazione FISKY', 'Oltre 250&nbsp; articoli&nbsp; sulle&nbsp; testate&nbsp; dei&nbsp; siti&nbsp; outdoor&nbsp; nel 2022 per&nbsp; promuovere&nbsp; gli&nbsp; eventi&nbsp; skyrunning,&nbsp; ed&nbsp; anche&nbsp; nel&nbsp; 2023&nbsp; La FISKY promuove tutti gli eventi dei Circuiti :<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-SkySnow-Italy-Cup-2023\">CRAZY SkySnow Italy Cup</a><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Skyrunning-Italy-Cup-2023\">CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup</a><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Vertical-Italy-Cup-2023\">CRAZY Vertical Cup</a><br />\r\nsu <a href=\"http://www.sportdimontagna.com/?fbclid=IwAR1-GHikIZxA4wrT56DiGHPUj-lVczzk53uF2p5pk4TbZ6wF46O_WlA4Sh8\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\">www.sportdimontagna.com</a> il social pi&ugrave; seguito degli sport di montagna e occhio ai montepremi sui tre Circuiti (&euro; 9.000,00) e al super-montepremi&nbsp; di &euro; 13.000,00&nbsp; per&nbsp; le&nbsp; prime&nbsp; 10&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-e-Montepremi-per-Societa\">Societ&agrave; classificate&nbsp;&nbsp;</a>&nbsp; dove&nbsp; il&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/COPPA-ITALIA-Giovani-2023-Supported-by-LOACKER\">Circuito&nbsp; riservato&nbsp; ai&nbsp; Giovani</a>&nbsp; apporta&nbsp; un&nbsp; punteggio&nbsp; maggiorato&nbsp; del&nbsp; 50%.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/bunner_Sport_di_Montagna_2023(1).JPG\" style=\"width: 780px; height: 409px;\" />', 'default', 0, '2023-05-04'),
(152, 'Le gare  skyrunning  in calendario  nelle  prossime  settimane di  Marzo ed Aprile 2024', '<strong>Queste&nbsp; le gare&nbsp; skyrunning&nbsp; in&nbsp; programma nelle prossime settimane&nbsp; inserite&nbsp; nel&nbsp; calendario ufficiale&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nRipartono i&nbsp; Circuiti&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Skyrunning-Italy-Cup-2024\"> CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup&nbsp;</a> (con un&nbsp; montepremi&nbsp; finale&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp; di&nbsp; &euro; 4.000,00 )&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/COPPA-ITALIA-Giovani-2024-Supported-by-LOACKER\">Coppa Italia Giovani&nbsp;</a> &nbsp; che&nbsp; assegnano&nbsp; i&nbsp; punteggi<br />\r\nalle&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-e-Montepremi-per-Societa\"> Societ&agrave;&nbsp; &nbsp;alle&nbsp; quali&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; riservato,&nbsp; come&nbsp; nel 2023,&nbsp; un&nbsp; montepremi&nbsp; finale&nbsp; di&nbsp; &euro; 13.000,00</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\nI&nbsp; link&nbsp; ai&nbsp; singoli&nbsp; &nbsp;eventi&nbsp; sono&nbsp; &nbsp;raggiungibili&nbsp; dal&nbsp; sito :</strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-Gare-2023\"><strong> www.skyrunningitalia.it</strong></a><br />\r\n<strong>Buone gare&nbsp; a&nbsp; tutti.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/GARE_FISKY_APRILE_2024.JPG\" style=\"width: 1000px; height: 313px;\" />', 'default', 0, '2023-05-16'),
(153, 'FISKY -  Official Partener of Winter World Masters Games 2024', '<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Winter_World_Master_Games_2024_page-0001.jpg\" style=\"width: 750px; height: 1061px;\" /><br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Winter_World_Master_Games_2024_page-0002.jpg\" style=\"width: 750px; height: 1061px;\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Winter_World_Master_Games_2024_page-0003.jpg\" style=\"width: 750px; height: 1061px;\" /><br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'default', 0, '2023-06-25'),
(154, 'Le  gare  in  calendario  nel  mese  di  Agosto e  sino  al  10  Settembre', '<strong>Queste&nbsp; le gare&nbsp; skyrunning&nbsp; in&nbsp; programma nelle prossime settimane&nbsp; inserite&nbsp; nel&nbsp; calendario ufficiale&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nI&nbsp; link&nbsp; ai&nbsp; singoli&nbsp; &nbsp;eventi&nbsp; sono&nbsp; &nbsp;raggiungibili&nbsp; dal&nbsp; sito :</strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-Gare-2023\"><strong> www.skyrunningitalia.it</strong></a><br />\r\n<strong>Ricordiamo&nbsp; che&nbsp; solo&nbsp; le&nbsp; gare&nbsp; inserite&nbsp; nel&nbsp; calendario&nbsp; ufficiale&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp; sono&nbsp; coperte dalla&nbsp; specifica&nbsp; assicurazione&nbsp; per&nbsp; la&nbsp; disciplina&nbsp; alpinistica&nbsp; dello&nbsp; skyrunning<br />\r\nBuone gare&nbsp; a&nbsp; tutti.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Calendario_agosoto_10_settembre_23.JPG\" style=\"width: 1060px; height: 658px;\" /></strong>', 'default', 0, '2023-07-22'),
(155, 'Tutti i  dettagli che possono  fare la  differenza', 'Sulla&nbsp; rivista&nbsp; SKIALPER&nbsp; un&nbsp; interessante&nbsp; articolo&nbsp; che&nbsp; parla&nbsp; &nbsp;dell&#39;orginazzione di una gara&nbsp; di&nbsp; skyrunning&nbsp; vista&nbsp; da&nbsp; dietro&nbsp; le&nbsp; quinte:&nbsp; certificazione dei percorsi, soccorso,&nbsp; assicurazioni.&nbsp; Tutti&nbsp; dettagli che&nbsp; possono&nbsp; fare&nbsp; la&nbsp; differenza.<br />\r\nDettagli&nbsp; e servizi&nbsp; che&nbsp; la&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp; segue&nbsp; con&nbsp; particolare&nbsp; attenzione&nbsp; e&nbsp; mette&nbsp; a&nbsp; disposizione&nbsp; &nbsp;degli&nbsp; organizzatori&nbsp; e&nbsp; degli&nbsp; atleti per&nbsp; non&nbsp; lasciare&nbsp; nulla&nbsp; al&nbsp; caso&nbsp; e&nbsp; all&#39;improvvisazione.&nbsp; Un&nbsp; articolo&nbsp; da&nbsp; leggere&nbsp; con&nbsp; attenzione&nbsp; e&nbsp; come&nbsp; consiglia&nbsp; &nbsp;alla&nbsp; fine&nbsp; il&nbsp; giornalista.....meditate gente, meditate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/SKIALPER_page-0001.jpg\" style=\"width: 981px; height: 694px;\" />', 'default', 0, '2023-09-15'),
(157, 'Le gare   in calendario  nelle  prossime  settimane', '<strong>Queste&nbsp; le gare&nbsp; skyrunning&nbsp; in&nbsp; programma nelle prossime settimane, sino a&nbsp; fine&nbsp; anno,&nbsp; inserite&nbsp; nel&nbsp; calendario ufficiale&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nI&nbsp; link&nbsp; ai&nbsp; singoli&nbsp; &nbsp;eventi&nbsp; sono&nbsp; &nbsp;raggiungibili&nbsp; dal&nbsp; sito :</strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-Gare-2023\"><strong> www.skyrunningitalia.it</strong></a><br />\r\n<strong>Ricordiamo&nbsp; che&nbsp; solo&nbsp; le&nbsp; gare&nbsp; inserite&nbsp; nel&nbsp; calendario&nbsp; ufficiale&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp; sono&nbsp; coperte dalla&nbsp; specifica&nbsp; assicurazione&nbsp; per&nbsp; la&nbsp; disciplina&nbsp; alpinistica&nbsp; dello&nbsp; skyrunning<br />\r\nBuone gare&nbsp; a&nbsp; tutti.</strong><br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/CALENDARIO_OTTOBRE_NOVEMBRE_2023.JPG\" style=\"width: 1325px; height: 413px;\" /><br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'default', 0, '2023-09-15'),
(158, 'Inserimento gare  nel  Calendario FISKY  2024 e rinnovo affiliazioni e tesseramenti 2024', '<strong>A tutte le societ&agrave; affiliate:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLa presente per invitarvi a far richiesta per l&rsquo; inserimento della vostra gara, nel &ldquo;Calendario gare 2024&rdquo;, tramite la solita procedura online che trovate sul sito&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">www.skyrunningitalia.it</a>&nbsp;al link&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/richiesta-gare\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/richiesta-gare</a>&nbsp;entro il&nbsp;10 Novembre 2023&nbsp;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPer il&nbsp;2024&nbsp;sono confermati i&nbsp;4 Circuiti&nbsp;:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>CRAZY Skysnow Italy Cup</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup</strong></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Coppa Italia Giovani / Youth</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>nei quali la Federazione mette in palio un montepremi complessivo di&nbsp;&euro; 10.000,00&nbsp;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSu richiesta della&nbsp;ISF &ndash; International Skyrunning Federation&nbsp;viene inoltre riproposto il circuito&nbsp;SNS &ndash; Skyrunning National Series.&nbsp;<br />\r\nLe gare che fanno richiesta per essere inserite nelle SNS, devono essere in possesso (oppure richiedere alla ISF ) della CC Label (Certificazione percorso) e deve essere prevista la presenza di un &ldquo;Giudice di Gara Nazionale&rdquo;.<br />\r\nI primi tre uomini e donne della classifica SNS si qualificheranno per gli SkyMasters, l&#39;ultima gara sul calendario delle Skyrunner @ World Series.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nViene inoltre confermata per il 2024 la &ldquo;Classifica per Societ&agrave;&rdquo; (con montepremi da definire ) con il medesimo sistema di punteggio del corrente anno.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLe gare che richiedono l&rsquo;assegnazione dei Campionati Italiani (SkySnow, VK, Doppio VK, Skyrace, SkyMarathon, Ultra SkyMarathon, Skyrace a coppie, SkySpeed), devono prevedere la presenza di un &ldquo;Giudice di Gara Nazionale e di un assistente Giudice&rdquo; .&nbsp;<br />\r\nIl Giudice di Gara e l&rsquo;assistente Giudice vengono nominati dalla FISKY.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInvitiamo pertanto tutti gli organizzatori interessati, a candidare le loro gare per l&rsquo;assegnazione dei Campionati Italiani e per l&rsquo;inserimento nei Circuiti Italy Cup, Coppa Italia Giovani e SNS ad&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">inoltrare le richieste entro il 10 Novembre 2023</span>&nbsp;per dar modo alla &ldquo;Commissione gare&rdquo; di stilare il calendario 2024 entro la prima decade di Dicembre.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">Dal 1&deg; Novembre 2023 sar&agrave; inoltre possibile effettuare i rinnovi affiliazioni delle societ&agrave; (a quota agevolata entro il 31/12/2023) e i tesseramenti atleti per il 2024.</span><br />\r\n<br />\r\nSi confermano sino al 31/12/2023 i rinnovi alle attuali quote per i tesseramenti atleti tramite Societ&agrave; affiliate (&euro; 20,00), atleti liberi (&euro; 30,00) e assicurati giornalieri (&euro; 5,00).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn allegato la tabelle delle QUOTE FISKY 2024.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nCordiali saluti,<br />\r\n<b>Luca Terenzini</b><br />\r\nSegreteria FISky<br />\r\nwww.skyrunningitalia.it<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/img/logo.png\" title=\"FISky\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Tabella-Costi-2024.JPG\" style=\"width: 900px; height: 458px;\" />', 'default', 0, '2023-10-18'),
(159, 'Dal 1Â° Novembre  sono  aperte affiliazioni e  tesseramenti 2024', '<strong>Dal 1&deg; Novembre&nbsp; sono aperte le affiliazioni&nbsp; o il loro&nbsp; rinnovo delle Societ&agrave; e&nbsp; dei&nbsp; tesseramenti&nbsp; &nbsp;2024&nbsp; (atleti, tecnici, Direttori di&nbsp; percorso)<br />\r\nQuote ed info su:</strong><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Affiliazione-Societa?fbclid=IwAR3VO6K1TpbmtsYHZM7ud9mcYwcST5JqbgowTZuOxrw7uEJjtxvNC_NqrYs\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Affiliazione-Societa</a><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti?fbclid=IwAR3czOFFkeixxgeN4QsQVtkfAO7SC60TzRufs07xAURnuKZ6u2gTTVK3uBc\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti<br />\r\nhttps://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Tecnici<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Tabella-Costi-2024.JPG\" style=\"width: 688px; height: 350px;\" /></a>', 'default', 0, '2023-11-03');
INSERT INTO `newsletters` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `layout`, `sent`, `created`) VALUES
(160, 'CLASSIFICA SKYRUNNING 2023 PER SOCIETA\'', 'Con l&#39;ultima gara dei Circuiti CRAZY Italy Cup si &egrave; definita la <strong>CLASSIFICA SKYRUNNING 2023 PER SOCIETA</strong>&#39; dove la <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/skyrunning2023?__cft__[0]=AZXue4CztoSd5z0T0rRhGYGimR91kzm_W3UqBU64BL-wP_bj9l4QVxu0n6p_b4ytFEfLJcncdlNISlkyZmTly7h5lkqKctXjJ6GNA8ZpzcFgPoJzbwr6LrI7tRoztSwjuIXLyTBnHkWnc_CarF1hhhEogyrZfVz4urOVTEL5GcUv8mNOrZ_oC10OVKw25sUpjb8&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">FISky - Federazione Italiana Skyrunning</a> ha messo in palio un montepremi di &euro; 13.000,00 come da regolamento pubblicato sul sito <a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.skyrunningitalia.it%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR0FQTE_ASPKPWhQ4NJL665mt0qvnKHc_tb4JTL2dw1lNgAX9Qqcrxmj72k&amp;h=AT1UeIDwMh9817W7LH7Vbu4HViypmbIHAyREmzYF6YbWFGima3wI2Yle3fG10ULnuV3Wa1hhObW1CeWy6HpeZIRQlzYURqGWHEFVE22SNHVJEYC2N9mnOBf7Yq2TCVmorwLk&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT3vPo4w6mKrzdSRNubO586mRUJPSCTrhBAMmeT5pihcNCkcmtDng3R-wyenLd6u7aJFvGgh_MbZGr387ve_v2I4ZeyBg1RNoi-xxz1dG4mtur1OLSFyIX2p6yzeC7ysQxXI_dU6q43s_j8foYzbzVz0dan6AKVBr1wilZYupYW62Tu-ky0DvPghx6mDI5aHfHfoBvfs2Ajz\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\">www.skyrunningitalia.it</a> . Le premiazioni si terranno a <strong>Bergamo sabato 2 Dicembre 2023 , alle ore 10,00</strong> presso la <strong>&quot;Sala Conferenze Palamonti &quot; del <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/caibergamo?__cft__[0]=AZXue4CztoSd5z0T0rRhGYGimR91kzm_W3UqBU64BL-wP_bj9l4QVxu0n6p_b4ytFEfLJcncdlNISlkyZmTly7h5lkqKctXjJ6GNA8ZpzcFgPoJzbwr6LrI7tRoztSwjuIXLyTBnHkWnc_CarF1hhhEogyrZfVz4urOVTEL5GcUv8mNOrZ_oC10OVKw25sUpjb8&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">CAI Bergamo</a> <a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.caibergamo.it%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR2T56OeeWrJZIc-E-Wa86c0Ia3ZE7wp881VPVyYr-4FHrZXzJVjboT0eXY&amp;h=AT1rlgW5yUO0hGI1BbILqY8A7TtDzEWnRwh3YYb-zTzXgW8aVmZoEeJIk_LzsjsmEOTZTr7dS0TEiEZWpIECWl3QckHxP0p95p3fs-iNCGDpq49ldrJY6T4L774KO_udr0sN&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT3vPo4w6mKrzdSRNubO586mRUJPSCTrhBAMmeT5pihcNCkcmtDng3R-wyenLd6u7aJFvGgh_MbZGr387ve_v2I4ZeyBg1RNoi-xxz1dG4mtur1OLSFyIX2p6yzeC7ysQxXI_dU6q43s_j8foYzbzVz0dan6AKVBr1wilZYupYW62Tu-ky0DvPghx6mDI5aHfHfoBvfs2Ajz\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\">www.caibergamo.it</a></strong>&nbsp;- Via Pizzo della Presolana, 15 - che ringraziamo per l&#39;ospitalit&agrave; e collaborazione. L&#39;incontro sar&agrave; l&#39;occasione per comunicare i calendari gare 2024 e la formazione della Squadra Nazionale Skyrunning che difender&agrave; il titolo Mondiale il prossimo anno.<br />\r\n<strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/CLASSIFICA_FINALE_SOCIETA\'_FISKY_2023_00001.jpg\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 990px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/CLASSIFICA_FINALE_SOCIETA\'_FISKY_2023_00002.jpg\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 990px;\" /></strong><br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'default', 0, '2023-11-06'),
(161, 'Invito alla premiazione  delle SocietÃ  2023 - Bergamo 2 Dicembre 2023 - Palamonti', '<p><strong>A tutti&nbsp; i&nbsp; Presidenti&nbsp; delle&nbsp; Societ&agrave; Affiliate</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nCon l&#39;ultima gara dei Circuiti CRAZY Italy Cup si &egrave; definita la <strong>CLASSIFICA SKYRUNNING 2023 PER SOCIETA</strong>&#39; dove la <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/skyrunning2023?__cft__[0]=AZXue4CztoSd5z0T0rRhGYGimR91kzm_W3UqBU64BL-wP_bj9l4QVxu0n6p_b4ytFEfLJcncdlNISlkyZmTly7h5lkqKctXjJ6GNA8ZpzcFgPoJzbwr6LrI7tRoztSwjuIXLyTBnHkWnc_CarF1hhhEogyrZfVz4urOVTEL5GcUv8mNOrZ_oC10OVKw25sUpjb8&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">FISky - Federazione Italiana Skyrunning</a> ha messo in palio un montepremi di &euro; 13.000,00 come da regolamento pubblicato sul sito <a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.skyrunningitalia.it%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR0FQTE_ASPKPWhQ4NJL665mt0qvnKHc_tb4JTL2dw1lNgAX9Qqcrxmj72k&amp;h=AT1UeIDwMh9817W7LH7Vbu4HViypmbIHAyREmzYF6YbWFGima3wI2Yle3fG10ULnuV3Wa1hhObW1CeWy6HpeZIRQlzYURqGWHEFVE22SNHVJEYC2N9mnOBf7Yq2TCVmorwLk&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT3vPo4w6mKrzdSRNubO586mRUJPSCTrhBAMmeT5pihcNCkcmtDng3R-wyenLd6u7aJFvGgh_MbZGr387ve_v2I4ZeyBg1RNoi-xxz1dG4mtur1OLSFyIX2p6yzeC7ysQxXI_dU6q43s_j8foYzbzVz0dan6AKVBr1wilZYupYW62Tu-ky0DvPghx6mDI5aHfHfoBvfs2Ajz\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\">www.skyrunningitalia.it</a> .-&nbsp; <a _djrealurl=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-e-Montepremi-per-Societa\" href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-e-Montepremi-per-Societa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff\" target=\"_blank\">(https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-e-Montepremi-per-Societa)</a>&nbsp; <font color=\"#050505\"><font face=\"Segoe UI Historic, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve\">Questa classifica &egrave; stata ideata per premiare le Societ&agrave; che maggiormente operano sul territorio, con particolare attenzione al mondo giovanile e che contribuiscono col loro lavoro al raggiungimento di importanti risultati a livello agonistico nazionale ed internazionale.</span></span></font></font></font><br />\r\nLe premiazioni si terranno a <strong>Bergamo sabato 2 Dicembre 2023 , alle ore 10,00</strong> presso la <strong>&quot;Sala Conferenze Palamonti &quot; del <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/caibergamo?__cft__[0]=AZXue4CztoSd5z0T0rRhGYGimR91kzm_W3UqBU64BL-wP_bj9l4QVxu0n6p_b4ytFEfLJcncdlNISlkyZmTly7h5lkqKctXjJ6GNA8ZpzcFgPoJzbwr6LrI7tRoztSwjuIXLyTBnHkWnc_CarF1hhhEogyrZfVz4urOVTEL5GcUv8mNOrZ_oC10OVKw25sUpjb8&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">CAI Bergamo</a> <a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.caibergamo.it%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR2T56OeeWrJZIc-E-Wa86c0Ia3ZE7wp881VPVyYr-4FHrZXzJVjboT0eXY&amp;h=AT1rlgW5yUO0hGI1BbILqY8A7TtDzEWnRwh3YYb-zTzXgW8aVmZoEeJIk_LzsjsmEOTZTr7dS0TEiEZWpIECWl3QckHxP0p95p3fs-iNCGDpq49ldrJY6T4L774KO_udr0sN&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT3vPo4w6mKrzdSRNubO586mRUJPSCTrhBAMmeT5pihcNCkcmtDng3R-wyenLd6u7aJFvGgh_MbZGr387ve_v2I4ZeyBg1RNoi-xxz1dG4mtur1OLSFyIX2p6yzeC7ysQxXI_dU6q43s_j8foYzbzVz0dan6AKVBr1wilZYupYW62Tu-ky0DvPghx6mDI5aHfHfoBvfs2Ajz\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\">www.caibergamo.it</a></strong>&nbsp;- <strong>Via Pizzo della Presolana, 15 </strong>- che ringraziamo per l&#39;ospitalit&agrave; e collaborazione.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15px; text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">L&#39;incontro sar&agrave; l&#39;occasione per comunicare i calendari gare 2024 e la formazione di partenza della Squadra Nazionale Skyrunning che difender&agrave; il titolo Mondiale nel prossimo anno in Spagna</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"3\"><font style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">Oltre&nbsp; alle&nbsp; prime&nbsp; 10&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp; classificate&nbsp; ,&nbsp; un&nbsp; premio&nbsp; speciale&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; previsto&nbsp; per la&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp; col&nbsp; maggior&nbsp; numero&nbsp; di&nbsp; tesserati,&nbsp; per&nbsp; l&#39;impegno&nbsp; profuso&nbsp; nella&nbsp; diffusione&nbsp; della disciplina&nbsp; agonistica dello&nbsp; Skyrunning.</font></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"3\"><font style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><b>Per&nbsp; la&nbsp; consegna&nbsp; dei&nbsp; &nbsp;premi&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; obbligatoria&nbsp; la&nbsp; presenza&nbsp; di&nbsp; un&nbsp; Dirigente&nbsp; o&nbsp; rappresentante&nbsp; della&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp; premiata;&nbsp; non&nbsp; verranno&nbsp; spediti&nbsp; premi&nbsp; in&nbsp; caso&nbsp; di&nbsp; assenza.</b><br />\r\nAl termine seguir&agrave;&nbsp; un&nbsp; rinfresco ,&nbsp; offerto&nbsp; dalla&nbsp; FISky,&nbsp; mentre&nbsp; chi&nbsp; vorr&agrave;&nbsp; fermarsi&nbsp; a&nbsp; pranzo,&nbsp; dovr&agrave;&nbsp; provvedere&nbsp; in&nbsp; modo&nbsp; autonomo&nbsp; alla&nbsp; &nbsp; prenotazione&nbsp; presso&nbsp; il&nbsp; Ristorante del&nbsp; Palamonti.<br />\r\n<b>Al&nbsp; fine&nbsp; di&nbsp; organizzare&nbsp; al&nbsp; meglio&nbsp; l&#39;evento &egrave;&nbsp; gradita&nbsp; la&nbsp; vostra&nbsp; conferma e&nbsp; di&nbsp; eventuali&nbsp; accompagnatori.</b></font></font><br />\r\n<strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/CLASSIFICA_FINALE_SOCIETA\'_FISKY_2023_00001.jpg\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 990px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/CLASSIFICA_FINALE_SOCIETA\'_FISKY_2023_00002.jpg\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 990px;\" /></strong></p>\r\n', 'default', 0, '2023-11-15'),
(162, 'Rassegna stampa FISky 2023', 'FISKy&nbsp; -&nbsp; Fedrazione&nbsp; Italiana&nbsp; Skyrunning&nbsp; non&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; solo&nbsp; Formazione, Assistenza,&nbsp; Consulenza ,&nbsp; Copertura&nbsp; Assicurativa&nbsp; per&nbsp; i&nbsp; propri&nbsp; affiliati&nbsp; ma&nbsp; anche&nbsp; comunicazione e&nbsp; valorizzazione&nbsp; degli&nbsp; eventi&nbsp; patrocinati.<br />\r\nAl&nbsp; link :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/notizia/196/Rassegna_stampa_FISky_2023\">&nbsp;https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/notizia/196/Rassegna_stampa_FISky_2023</a><br />\r\noltre&nbsp; 200&nbsp; articoli&nbsp; &nbsp;che&nbsp; parlano&nbsp; delle&nbsp; gare&nbsp; dei&nbsp; circuiti&nbsp; &quot;CRAZY Skysnow Italy Cup&quot; , &quot;Crazy&nbsp; Vertical&nbsp; Italy Cup&quot;,&nbsp; &quot;CRAZY Skyrunning&nbsp; Italy Cup&quot; e &quot;COPPA&nbsp; ITALIA&nbsp; GIOVANI&nbsp; Supported&nbsp; by&nbsp; Loacker&quot;..............<strong>and&nbsp; wait,&nbsp; be careful :&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\nsabato&nbsp; 2&nbsp; Dicembre&nbsp; -&nbsp; Ore&nbsp; 10,00 -&nbsp; presso&nbsp; Palamonti - CAI&nbsp; Bergamo - Via Pizzo&nbsp; della Presolana, 15 - Bergamo<br />\r\npresentazione&nbsp; dei&nbsp; calendari&nbsp; 2024,&nbsp; delle&nbsp; Squadre&nbsp; Nazionali&nbsp; Skyrunning&nbsp; e&nbsp; Premiazione&nbsp; della&nbsp; Classifica&nbsp; per&nbsp; Societ&agrave;.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/RASSEGNA_STAMPA_2022(1).jpg\" style=\"width: 620px; height: 380px;\" /><br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/bunner_Sport_di_Montagna_2023(1).JPG\" style=\"width: 580px; height: 304px;\" />', 'default', 0, '2023-11-29'),
(163, 'CERIMONIA DI PREMIAZIONE DELLE SOCIETÃ€ FISKY AL PALAMONTI E PRESENTAZIONE DELLE NOVITÃ€ PER LA STAGIONE 2024', '<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Palamonti_CAI_Bergamo.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 424px;\" />\r\n<h2 itemprop=\"name\">LA FISKY CHIUDE LA STAGIONE 2023, GI&Agrave; PROGRAMMATA LA PROSSIMA</h2>\r\nPalamonti - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/caibergamo?__cft__[0]=AZVWPhdvSA-FI6juGByXvDw4DfYMcbmm3_1rRv_DaYjkYEzam2VONccn8uoc-60Culnem1VfJCCDat3OFsY8vPcyqLg5I57m5xDEhAcJWaoXcjTmC4fcwN6JlyFMoKT9UORqW0GPUQhC8_c44j1XpwtE_TgtlJLvNSeINfxQ5eN6X43UK17OBoSzBxmz-ztSEMo&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">CAI Bergamo</a> - 2 Dicembre 2023 - Grande partecipazione in occasione della premiazione 2023 delle Societ&agrave; <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/skyrunning2023?__cft__[0]=AZVWPhdvSA-FI6juGByXvDw4DfYMcbmm3_1rRv_DaYjkYEzam2VONccn8uoc-60Culnem1VfJCCDat3OFsY8vPcyqLg5I57m5xDEhAcJWaoXcjTmC4fcwN6JlyFMoKT9UORqW0GPUQhC8_c44j1XpwtE_TgtlJLvNSeINfxQ5eN6X43UK17OBoSzBxmz-ztSEMo&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">FISky - Federazione Italiana Skyrunning</a>&nbsp; dove la Federazione&nbsp; ha&nbsp; messo&nbsp; in&nbsp; palio un&nbsp; montepremi&nbsp; di&nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; 13.000,00&nbsp; per&nbsp; le&nbsp; prime&nbsp; 10&nbsp; Societ&agrave; classficate. Il regolamento&nbsp; e&nbsp; la&nbsp; classifica&nbsp; finale&nbsp; ottenuta&nbsp; dalla&nbsp; somma&nbsp; dei&nbsp; punti&nbsp; che&nbsp; gli&nbsp; atleti&nbsp; delle&nbsp; varie&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp; hanno&nbsp; accumulato&nbsp; nelle&nbsp; gare&nbsp; dei&nbsp; Circuiti&nbsp; di&nbsp; Coppa&nbsp; Italia&nbsp; sono&nbsp; riportati&nbsp; al&nbsp; link :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-e-Montepremi-per-Societa\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Classifica-e-Montepremi-per-Societa</a><br />\r\nLa&nbsp; convention&nbsp; &nbsp;&egrave;&nbsp; stata&nbsp; aperta&nbsp; dal&nbsp; Presidente&nbsp; della&nbsp; FISky&nbsp; ,&nbsp; Fabio&nbsp; Meraldi&nbsp; &nbsp;che&nbsp; dopo&nbsp; i&nbsp; saluti&nbsp; di&nbsp; rito&nbsp; ha&nbsp; presentato&nbsp; &nbsp;i&nbsp; Dirigenti della Federazione&nbsp; e&nbsp; relazionato&nbsp; sull&#39;attuale&nbsp; posizione&nbsp; del&nbsp; movimento.&nbsp; A&nbsp; seguire&nbsp; Paolo&nbsp; Valoti&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/caibergamo?__cft__[0]=AZVWPhdvSA-FI6juGByXvDw4DfYMcbmm3_1rRv_DaYjkYEzam2VONccn8uoc-60Culnem1VfJCCDat3OFsY8vPcyqLg5I57m5xDEhAcJWaoXcjTmC4fcwN6JlyFMoKT9UORqW0GPUQhC8_c44j1XpwtE_TgtlJLvNSeINfxQ5eN6X43UK17OBoSzBxmz-ztSEMo&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">CAI Bergamo</a>&nbsp; gi&agrave;&nbsp; Presidente&nbsp; del&nbsp; sodalizio bergamasco e&nbsp; amico&nbsp; storico&nbsp; &nbsp;del&nbsp; movimento&nbsp; skyrunning&nbsp; italiano,&nbsp; ha&nbsp; fatto&nbsp; &quot;gli&nbsp; onori&nbsp; di casa&quot; ai&nbsp; numerosi&nbsp; intervenuti&nbsp; prima&nbsp; di&nbsp; cedere&nbsp; la&nbsp; parola&nbsp; al&nbsp; Dr.&nbsp; Paolo Franco,&nbsp; Assessore&nbsp; della&nbsp; Regione&nbsp; Lombardia. Le&nbsp; sue&nbsp; parole &quot;Questa mattina &egrave; stato un&nbsp; vero&nbsp; onore poter&nbsp; rappresentare la&nbsp; Regione Lombardia nella&nbsp; premiazione degli&nbsp; atleti che hanno&nbsp; partecipato ai&nbsp; Circuiti&nbsp; di&nbsp; Coppa&nbsp; Italia&nbsp; della FISky-Federazione Italiana Skyrunning . Risultati&nbsp; importanti riconosciuti&nbsp; dal&nbsp; CONI. Gli&nbsp; atleti che&nbsp; corrono&nbsp; in&nbsp; montagna rappresentano valori sani, quali&nbsp; la&nbsp; fatica&nbsp; e&nbsp; l&#39;umilt&agrave;. Essere&nbsp; qua, questa mattina,&nbsp; ribadisce l&#39;importanza dello&nbsp; sport e del sostegno alle&nbsp; discipline sportive&nbsp; che per&nbsp; la&nbsp; Regione&nbsp; Lombardia,&nbsp; rappresentano,&nbsp; da&nbsp; sempre, un&#39;autentica&nbsp; priorit&agrave;. Sostenere&nbsp; lo&nbsp; sport in&nbsp; ogni&nbsp; sua&nbsp; forma, significa sostenere pratiche di&nbsp; vita sane&nbsp; e&nbsp; salutari &quot;.&nbsp;<br />\r\nA&nbsp; seguire&nbsp; il&nbsp; Dr.&nbsp; Giulio&nbsp; Sergio Roi,&nbsp; Past President&nbsp; FISKy&nbsp; &nbsp;ha&nbsp; illustrato&nbsp; un&nbsp; importante&nbsp; report&nbsp; statistico&nbsp; sull&#39;attivata&nbsp; della&nbsp; FISKY ,&nbsp; illustrando&nbsp; nei&nbsp; minimi&nbsp; dettagli&nbsp; la&nbsp; ricerca&nbsp; condotta&nbsp; nel&nbsp; settore&nbsp; dello&nbsp; skyrunning&nbsp; in&nbsp; italia&nbsp; negli&nbsp; anni&nbsp; 2022&nbsp; e&nbsp; 2023.&nbsp; Una&nbsp; serie&nbsp; di&nbsp; dati,&nbsp; decisamente&nbsp; unici&nbsp; &nbsp;nel&nbsp; panorama&nbsp; dell&#39;outdoor&nbsp; a&nbsp; livello&nbsp; nazionale.<br />\r\nIl&nbsp; Vicepresidente&nbsp; e&nbsp; CT&nbsp; della&nbsp; Nazionale,&nbsp; Roberto&nbsp; Mattioli,&nbsp; ha&nbsp; poi&nbsp; presentato&nbsp; gli&nbsp; atleti&nbsp; delle&nbsp; Squadre&nbsp; Nazionali&nbsp; U23,&nbsp; Vicecampioni&nbsp; del&nbsp; Mondo Youth&nbsp; U23&nbsp; e della&nbsp; Squadra&nbsp; Senior,&nbsp; Campione&nbsp; del&nbsp; Monde&nbsp; in&nbsp; carica Skysnow,&nbsp; Campione&nbsp; del&nbsp; Mondo&nbsp; in&nbsp; Carica Skyrunning e&nbsp; Vicecampioni&nbsp; D&#39;Europa&nbsp; 2023,&nbsp; che&nbsp; il&nbsp; prossimo&nbsp; anno&nbsp; difenderanno&nbsp; &nbsp;i&nbsp; titoli&nbsp; conquistati&nbsp; in&nbsp; Montenegro con&nbsp; gli&nbsp; U23&nbsp; e&nbsp; in&nbsp; Spagna&nbsp; con&nbsp; la&nbsp; Squadra&nbsp; Senior.&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\r\nIl Vicepresidente&nbsp; ha&nbsp; poi&nbsp; presentato&nbsp; il&nbsp; calendario&nbsp; agonistico&nbsp; 2024 , dove&nbsp; sono&nbsp; gi&agrave;&nbsp; presenti&nbsp; oltre&nbsp; 75&nbsp; gare&nbsp; e&nbsp; alcune&nbsp; altre&nbsp; si&nbsp; aggiungeranno&nbsp; a&nbsp; breve.&nbsp; Fra&nbsp; queste&nbsp; le&nbsp; gare&nbsp; che&nbsp; assegneranno&nbsp; i&nbsp; titoli&nbsp; Italiani&nbsp; nelle&nbsp; varie&nbsp; specialit&agrave;&nbsp; skyrunning,&nbsp; i&nbsp; Circuti&nbsp; di&nbsp; Coppa&nbsp; Italia dove&nbsp; la&nbsp; Federazione&nbsp; ha&nbsp; confermato&nbsp; di&nbsp; investire&nbsp; 10.000,00&nbsp; euro&nbsp; in&nbsp; montepremi,&nbsp; il&nbsp; Circutio&nbsp; di&nbsp; Coppa&nbsp; Italia&nbsp; Giovani&nbsp; dove&nbsp; FISky&nbsp; in&nbsp; collaborazione&nbsp; con&nbsp; i&nbsp; vari&nbsp; organizzatori&nbsp; st&agrave;&nbsp; lavorando con&nbsp; particolare&nbsp; dedizione&nbsp; per&nbsp; la&nbsp; crescita&nbsp; del&nbsp; movimento&nbsp; giovanile ed&nbsp; il&nbsp; ritorno&nbsp; del circuito&nbsp; &nbsp;SNS- Skyrunner&nbsp; Nationale Series.&nbsp;<br />\r\nOltre&nbsp; alle&nbsp; prime&nbsp; 10&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp; classificate,&nbsp; menzione&nbsp; e&nbsp; premio&nbsp; speciale&nbsp; per&nbsp; la&nbsp; A.S.D.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Gaaren.Beahero/?locale=it_IT\"> Team GAAREN#BEaHERO&nbsp;</a> di&nbsp; Bergamo,&nbsp; che&nbsp; con&nbsp; i&nbsp; suoi&nbsp; 209&nbsp; tesserati&nbsp; &nbsp;svolge&nbsp; un&#39;importante&nbsp; funzione&nbsp; culturale e&nbsp; di&nbsp; promozione&nbsp; per&nbsp; la&nbsp; disciplina&nbsp; alpinista&nbsp; dello&nbsp; skyrunning.<br />\r\nLa&nbsp; convention&nbsp; si&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; conclusa&nbsp; con&nbsp; l&#39;aperitivo&nbsp; al&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.caibergamo.it/sezione-bergamo-antonio-locatelli/ristorante-rifugio-citta\"> &quot;Rifugio&nbsp; in&nbsp; Citt&agrave;&quot;&nbsp;</a>&nbsp; ,&nbsp; il&nbsp; ristorante&nbsp; interno&nbsp; alla&nbsp; sede&nbsp; del&nbsp; CAI&nbsp; Bergamo.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Bergamo_FISKY_2023.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 450px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'default', 0, '2023-12-05'),
(164, 'Calendario  SKYSNOW   2024  ', '<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Calendario_FISKY_sino_al__10_Marzo_2024.JPG\" style=\"width: 649px; height: 156px;\" /><br />\r\nDopo&nbsp; la&nbsp; sosta&nbsp; del&nbsp; mese&nbsp; di&nbsp; Dicembre&nbsp; l&#39;attivit&agrave;&nbsp; agonistica&nbsp; riprende&nbsp; il&nbsp; 13-15 Gennaio&nbsp; con&nbsp; i&nbsp;&nbsp;<a _djrealurl=\"https://wwmglombardia2024.it/it/sport/snow-run/\" href=\"https://wwmglombardia2024.it/it/sport/snow-run/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">WWWMG Lombardia&nbsp; 2024,</a>&nbsp; il&nbsp; pi&ugrave;&nbsp; grande&nbsp; evento mondiale&nbsp; riservato<br />\r\nai&nbsp; Master&nbsp; Over&nbsp; 30&nbsp; degli&nbsp; sport&nbsp; invernali.&nbsp; L<a _djrealurl=\"https://wwmglombardia2024.it/it/wwmg2024/partners-and-supporters/\" href=\"https://wwmglombardia2024.it/it/wwmg2024/partners-and-supporters/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">a&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; OFFICIAL&nbsp; PARTNER&nbsp;</a>&nbsp; per&nbsp; la&nbsp; disciplina&nbsp;&nbsp;<a _djrealurl=\"https://wwmglombardia2024.it/it/sport/snow-run/\" href=\"https://wwmglombardia2024.it/it/sport/snow-run/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sky run / Skysnow</a>.<br />\r\nIl&nbsp; costo&nbsp; di&nbsp; iscrizione&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; di&nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; 100,00&nbsp; e&nbsp; comprende&nbsp; la&nbsp; partecipazione&nbsp; alle&nbsp; varie&nbsp; discipline&nbsp; nelle&nbsp; quali&nbsp; volete&nbsp; cimentarvi.&nbsp; Sul&nbsp; sito&nbsp; FISky&nbsp; trovate&nbsp; il&nbsp; link con tutte<br />\r\nle&nbsp; informazioni&nbsp; e&nbsp; le&nbsp; modalit&agrave;&nbsp; per&nbsp; iscriversi.&nbsp; Non&nbsp; abbiamo&nbsp; possibilit&agrave;&nbsp; di&nbsp; offrire&nbsp; pettorali&nbsp; gratuiti .<br />\r\nAlcuni&nbsp; di&nbsp; voi,&nbsp; Over&nbsp; 30 ,&nbsp; si&nbsp; sono&nbsp; gi&agrave;&nbsp; iscritti ,&nbsp; chi&nbsp; interessato&nbsp; deve&nbsp; iscriversi&nbsp; entro&nbsp; il&nbsp; 31&nbsp; Dicembre,&nbsp; termine&nbsp; ultimo per&nbsp; le&nbsp; iscrizioni.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b>A seguire&nbsp; le&nbsp; 3&nbsp; gare&nbsp; della&nbsp; CRAZY&nbsp; Skysnow&nbsp; Italy&nbsp; Cup,&nbsp; tutte&nbsp; e&nbsp; tre&nbsp; contribuiscono&nbsp; alla&nbsp; classifica&nbsp; finale&nbsp; di&nbsp; Coppa,&nbsp; tutte&nbsp; e&nbsp; tre&nbsp; sono&nbsp; qualificative e&nbsp; di&nbsp; selezione<br />\r\nper&nbsp; i&nbsp; Mondiali&nbsp; Skysnow&nbsp; che&nbsp; si&nbsp; disputeranno&nbsp; a&nbsp; Tarvisio&nbsp; l&#39; 8-9 Marzo 2024.</b><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<b>Ricordo&nbsp; che&nbsp; il&nbsp; montepremi&nbsp; per&nbsp; la&nbsp; classifica&nbsp; finale&nbsp; delle&nbsp; 3&nbsp; gare&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; &nbsp;di&nbsp; &nbsp;&euro;&nbsp; 700,00&nbsp; per&nbsp; il&nbsp; 1&deg;&nbsp; M/F ,&nbsp; &nbsp;&euro;&nbsp; 500,00&nbsp; per&nbsp; il&nbsp; 2&deg;&nbsp; M/F&nbsp; e&nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; 300,00&nbsp; &nbsp;per&nbsp; il&nbsp; &nbsp;3&deg;&nbsp; M/F&nbsp;<br />\r\noltre&nbsp; ai&nbsp; montepremi&nbsp; eventualmente&nbsp; previsti&nbsp; dagli&nbsp;organizzatori&nbsp; dei&nbsp; singoli&nbsp; eventi.&nbsp;</b><br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/WWMG_LOMBARDIA_2024.jpg\" style=\"width: 681px; height: 963px;\" /><br />\r\n&nbsp;', 'default', 0, '2023-12-08'),
(165, 'Un altro  importante   traguardo  per    #skyrunningitalia  #fisky', '<p>14 DICEMBRE 2023</p>\r\nQuesto fine&nbsp; d&#39;anno&nbsp; &egrave; foriero&nbsp; di&nbsp; grandi&nbsp; soddisfazioni&nbsp; per&nbsp; la&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/\">@fisky</a><br />\r\nDopo il&nbsp; successo&nbsp; della&nbsp; convention&nbsp; al&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.caibergamo.it/\">Palamonti - CAI&nbsp; Bergamo</a>&nbsp; del&nbsp; 2&nbsp; Dicembre,&nbsp; un&#39;altra&nbsp; importante&nbsp; notizia:&nbsp; Daniele Cappelletti ,&nbsp; gi&agrave; atleta&nbsp; Mondial - medagliato&nbsp; della&nbsp; Nazionale&nbsp; Italiana&nbsp; Skyrunning ,&nbsp; detentore&nbsp; del&nbsp; &nbsp;Record D+ 24H ,&nbsp; Consigliere&nbsp; Nazionale FISKY in&nbsp; Rappresentanza&nbsp; degli Atleti,&nbsp; oggi&nbsp; ha&nbsp; conseguito&nbsp; la&nbsp; qualifica&nbsp; di&nbsp; Allenatore&nbsp; di&nbsp; IV&nbsp; Livello&nbsp; Europeo&nbsp; &nbsp;presso&nbsp; la&nbsp; Scuola&nbsp; dello&nbsp; Sport&nbsp; - SPORT E SALUTE - Centro&nbsp; di&nbsp; Preparazione&nbsp; Olimpica&nbsp; &quot;Giulio Onesti&quot;&nbsp; &nbsp;a&nbsp; Roma .<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/CAPPELELTTI_DANIELE_Allenatore_IV_livello.jpg\" style=\"width: 620px; height: 380px;\" /><br />\r\nUna grande soddisfazione,&nbsp; per&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/skyrunningitalia?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZUgNWtjwE2kCqJlyK4UStZ_sxzG29mcmFIw8z71fZtAjp9VySRicWL-lxi1JOstwGgiaDFnx7JH4x-t6s3IAx6VIkyXuQs_DsOa_pbl0jBWVn0WlcapJoQJvo2H7uz8tsDHbm_95jKCP3f4qp_kuXGYcNaHH6WT4sTQqDfN-42tYIVGTClidKHc4rG9RT8HZ2JwedgYcJreOnlBw6h_yGkF&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">#skyrunningitalia</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/fisky?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZUgNWtjwE2kCqJlyK4UStZ_sxzG29mcmFIw8z71fZtAjp9VySRicWL-lxi1JOstwGgiaDFnx7JH4x-t6s3IAx6VIkyXuQs_DsOa_pbl0jBWVn0WlcapJoQJvo2H7uz8tsDHbm_95jKCP3f4qp_kuXGYcNaHH6WT4sTQqDfN-42tYIVGTClidKHc4rG9RT8HZ2JwedgYcJreOnlBw6h_yGkF&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">#fisky</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/skyrunning2023?__cft__[0]=AZUgNWtjwE2kCqJlyK4UStZ_sxzG29mcmFIw8z71fZtAjp9VySRicWL-lxi1JOstwGgiaDFnx7JH4x-t6s3IAx6VIkyXuQs_DsOa_pbl0jBWVn0WlcapJoQJvo2H7uz8tsDHbm_95jKCP3f4qp_kuXGYcNaHH6WT4sTQqDfN-42tYIVGTClidKHc4rG9RT8HZ2JwedgYcJreOnlBw6h_yGkF&amp;__tn__=-]K-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">FISky - Federazione Italiana Skyrunning</a>&nbsp; che&nbsp; desideriamo&nbsp; condividere&nbsp; con&nbsp; tutti&nbsp; voi, per questo traguardo di Daniele Cappelletti primo tecnico in Italia di IV LIVELLO nella disciplina alpinistica Skyrunning e primo tecnico in Italia nello Sci Alpinismo. Il lavoro, la seriet&agrave;, la costanza e l&#39;onest&agrave; intellettuale alla fine emergono sempre.<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/diploma_Daniele_Cappelletti.JPG\" style=\"width: 497px; height: 706px;\" /><br />\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2><strong>but.... stay tuned&nbsp;<br />\r\nother great news coming soon</strong></h2>\r\n', 'default', 0, '2023-12-15'),
(166, 'Ultimi 12 giorniÂ  perÂ  iscriversiÂ  aiÂ  Â Â wwmglombardia2024.', '<h2><strong>Ultimi 12 giorni&nbsp; per&nbsp; iscriversi&nbsp; ai&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://wwmglombardia2024.it/it/\">wwmglombardia2024.it/it/</a></strong></h2>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/WWMG_Lombardia.JPG\" style=\"width: 710px; height: 305px;\" /><br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/410922452_333556272873942_2506911195430497051_n.jpg\" style=\"width: 750px; height: 600px;\" />', 'default', 0, '2023-12-17'),
(167, 'AUGURI di Buone Feste e  Buon Anno 2024', '<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/AUGURI_FISKY_2024.png\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 520px;\" />', 'default', 0, '2023-12-19');
INSERT INTO `newsletters` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `layout`, `sent`, `created`) VALUES
(168, 'Avviso importante per iscrizione CONI e RAS Sport e Salute', '<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><font size=\"4\">A tutti i Presidenti, Vicepresidenti e Segretari delle&nbsp; Societ&agrave; Affiliate</font></b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n&nbsp;<br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">Ricordiamo a&nbsp; tutte&nbsp; le&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp; che&nbsp; non&nbsp; hanno&nbsp; ancora&nbsp; rinnovato&nbsp; l&#39;affiliamento&nbsp; per&nbsp; la&nbsp; stagione&nbsp; 2024,&nbsp; di&nbsp; effettuare&nbsp; il&nbsp; rinnovo</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">entro&nbsp; il&nbsp; 31 Dicembre 2023 al&nbsp; fine&nbsp; di&nbsp; usufruire&nbsp; della&nbsp; quota&nbsp; ridotta&nbsp; a&nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; 100,00.&nbsp;</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">Dal&nbsp; 1&nbsp; Gennaio&nbsp; la&nbsp; quota&nbsp; affiliazione&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp; &nbsp;passa&nbsp; ad&nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; 150,00.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b><a _djrealurl=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Affiliazione-Societa\" href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Affiliazione-Societa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration:underline; color:#0000ff; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Affiliazione-Societa</a><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">Come&nbsp; preannunciato dal&nbsp; 2024&nbsp; tutte&nbsp; le&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp; affiliate&nbsp; saranno&nbsp; iscritte&nbsp; direttamente&nbsp; da&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp; al&nbsp; CONI&nbsp; e&nbsp; al&nbsp; RAS&nbsp; di</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">SPORT e SALUTE ,&nbsp; non&nbsp; sar&agrave;&nbsp; pi&ugrave;&nbsp; necessario&nbsp; passare&nbsp; tramite&nbsp; altra&nbsp; FSN o&nbsp; EPS.</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">Nulla&nbsp; vieta&nbsp; che&nbsp; una&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp; &nbsp;possa&nbsp; essere&nbsp; affiliata&nbsp; a&nbsp; pi&ugrave;&nbsp; Federazioni FSN o&nbsp; a&nbsp; pi&ugrave;&nbsp; Enti di&nbsp; Promozione&nbsp; Sportiva&nbsp; EPS.</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">Al&nbsp; fine&nbsp; poter&nbsp; effettuare&nbsp; l&#39;iscrizione&nbsp; della&nbsp; vostra&nbsp; ASD&nbsp; o&nbsp; SSD&nbsp; al&nbsp; CONI&nbsp; e&nbsp; al&nbsp; RAS&nbsp; occorre:</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">- 1) affiliazione&nbsp; &nbsp;alla&nbsp; FISKY&nbsp; per&nbsp; l&#39;anno&nbsp; 2024&nbsp; ( &euro; 100,00&nbsp; sino&nbsp; &nbsp;al&nbsp; 31/122023&nbsp; &nbsp;ed&nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; &nbsp;150,00&nbsp; &nbsp;dal&nbsp; &nbsp;1/1/2024 )<br />\r\n&nbsp;</b><a _djrealurl=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Affiliazione-Societa\" href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Affiliazione-Societa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration:underline; color:#0000ff; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Affiliazione-Societa</a><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">-2) tesseramento&nbsp; di&nbsp; almeno&nbsp; 5&nbsp; atleti&nbsp; (come&nbsp; da&nbsp; regolamento&nbsp; FISky&nbsp; e&nbsp; come&nbsp; richiesto&nbsp; dalla&nbsp; nuova&nbsp; normativa&nbsp; di&nbsp; legge&nbsp; che</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">prevede&nbsp; un&#39;Associazione&nbsp; Sportiva&nbsp; Dilettantistica&nbsp; o&nbsp; Societ&agrave; Sportiva Dilettantistica&nbsp; svolga&nbsp; attivit&agrave;&nbsp; sportiva&nbsp; agonistica e&nbsp; non</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">solo&nbsp; organizzativa&nbsp; di&nbsp; gare,&nbsp; per&nbsp; continuare&nbsp; ad&nbsp; essere&nbsp; iscritta&nbsp; al&nbsp; RAS&nbsp; ed&nbsp; usufruire&nbsp; di&nbsp; conseguenza&nbsp; delle&nbsp; agevolazioni</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">fiscali&nbsp; previste&nbsp; per&nbsp; le&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp; Sportiva.&nbsp; In&nbsp; caso&nbsp; non&nbsp; venga&nbsp; svolta&nbsp; attivit&agrave;&nbsp; sportiva,&nbsp; la&nbsp; ASD&nbsp; o&nbsp; SSD&nbsp; viene&nbsp; cancellata&nbsp; dal&nbsp; RAS</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">e&nbsp; l&#39;attivit&agrave;&nbsp; svolta&nbsp; diventa&nbsp; di&nbsp; &quot;tipo&nbsp; commerciale&quot;&nbsp; con&nbsp; l&#39;assoggettamento&nbsp; ad&nbsp; altra&nbsp; disciplina&nbsp; fiscale)&nbsp;</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<a _djrealurl=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti\" href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration:underline; color:#0000ff; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti</a><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:small; text-align:start\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">- 3) Atto Costitutivo con&nbsp; eventuali&nbsp; verbali&nbsp; di&nbsp; variazioni&nbsp; intervenute</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:small; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:small; text-align:start\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">- 4) Statuto&nbsp; Sociale uniformato al Dlgs.36/2021&nbsp; con Verbale Assemblea Straordinaria registrato<br />\r\nL&#39;aggiornamento&nbsp; dello&nbsp; Statuto&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; stato&nbsp; &nbsp;prorogato al&nbsp; 30&nbsp; Giugno&nbsp; 2024 e&nbsp; per&nbsp; &nbsp;coloro&nbsp; che&nbsp; non&nbsp; l&#39;hanno&nbsp; ancora&nbsp; rinnovato<br />\r\ninviare&nbsp; quello&nbsp; attualmente&nbsp; in&nbsp; vigore&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:small; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:small; text-align:start\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">- 5) Codice Fiscale&nbsp; della&nbsp; ASD / SSD rilasciato dall&#39;Agenzia delle Entrate&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:small; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:small; text-align:start\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">- 6) Tutti&nbsp; i dati anagrafici dei&nbsp; componenti il Consiglio compreso&nbsp; residenza e&nbsp; codice fiscale</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:small; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:small; text-align:start\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">- 7) Fotocopia fronte/retro&nbsp; della&nbsp; carta identit&agrave;&nbsp; Presidente</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:small; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:small; text-align:start\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><b>- 8) mail&nbsp; della&nbsp; ASD /SSD<br />\r\n&nbsp;</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:13px; text-align:start\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffff00\"><b>Vi&nbsp; invitiamo a&nbsp; prendere&nbsp; nota&nbsp; di&nbsp; quanto&nbsp; sopra.&nbsp; &nbsp;La&nbsp; procedura&nbsp; di&nbsp; iscrizione&nbsp; al<br />\r\nCONI&nbsp; e al&nbsp; RAS&nbsp; di&nbsp; SPORT e SALUTE,&nbsp; potr&agrave;&nbsp; &nbsp;iniziare&nbsp; solo&nbsp; &nbsp; in&nbsp; presenza&nbsp; dell&#39;osservanza&nbsp; di&nbsp; tutti&nbsp; i&nbsp; punti&nbsp; sopra descritti,&nbsp;</b><br />\r\n<font color=\"#ff0000\"><b>non&nbsp; seguiranno&nbsp; ulteriori&nbsp; solleciti&nbsp;&nbsp;</b><b>&nbsp;</b></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><u><font color=\"#ff0000\">I&nbsp; documenti&nbsp; specificati&nbsp; ai&nbsp; punti&nbsp; 3) - 4) - 5) - 6) - 7) e&nbsp; 8)&nbsp; devono&nbsp; essere&nbsp; inviati&nbsp; alla mail:&nbsp; federazione@skyrunningitalia.it</font></u><br />\r\n<br />\r\nCordiali&nbsp; saluti&nbsp; e&nbsp; Auguri&nbsp; di&nbsp; Buone&nbsp; Feste&nbsp;</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div data-signature-id=\"1\" style=\"padding:0px; text-align:start\">\r\n<div class=\"xam_msg_class\" style=\"padding:0px\">\r\n<div class=\"xam_msg_class\" style=\"padding:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Luca Terenzini</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\">Segreteria FISky</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span sty