(169, 'Incontro su  piattaforma  Zoom - lunedÃ¬  8 Gennaio - ore 21,00 - NovitÃ  2024  FISKY', '<b><font size=\"3\">A tutte&nbsp; le&nbsp; Societ&agrave;&nbsp; affiliate<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSiete invitati&nbsp; all&#39;incontro&nbsp; su&nbsp; piattaforma&nbsp; Zoom,&nbsp; luned&igrave;&nbsp; 8 Gennaio&nbsp; alle&nbsp; ore&nbsp; 21,00<br />\r\ndove&nbsp; presenteremo&nbsp; le&nbsp; novit&agrave;&nbsp; della&nbsp; Federazione Italiana&nbsp; Skyrunning&nbsp; &nbsp;deliberate<br />\r\ndal&nbsp; Consiglio&nbsp; Nazionale&nbsp; il&nbsp; 20&nbsp; Dicembre&nbsp; &nbsp;u.s.,&nbsp; unitamente&nbsp; alle&nbsp; indicazioni&nbsp; per<br />\r\ngli&nbsp; organizzatori&nbsp; &nbsp;degli&nbsp; eventi&nbsp; in&nbsp; calendario&nbsp; 2024.<br />\r\nSotto&nbsp; il&nbsp; link&nbsp; per&nbsp; il&nbsp; collegamento.<br />\r\nVista&nbsp; l&#39;importanza&nbsp; degli&nbsp; eventi&nbsp; siete&nbsp; invitati&nbsp; a&nbsp; &nbsp;non&nbsp; mancare.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCordialmente&nbsp;</font></b><br />\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div data-signature-id=\"1\" style=\"padding:0px\">\r\n<div class=\"xam_msg_class\" style=\"padding:0px\">\r\n<div class=\"xam_msg_class\" style=\"padding:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Luca Terenzini</b></span></span></span></span>\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\">Segreteria FISky</span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\">www.skyrunningitalia.it</span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\" xam-editor-container=\"true\"><img _djrealurl=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/img/logo.png\" style=\"border:0px none; max-width:100%\" /></span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">FISKY - Federazione Italiana Skyrunning ti sta invitando a una riunione pianificata in Zoom.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">Argomento: NOVITA&#39; FISKY 2024 e ORGANIZZAZIONE GARE</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">Ora: 8 gen 2024 09:00 PM Roma</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">Entra Zoom Riunione</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/86713710942</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">ID riunione: 867 1371 0942</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">---</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">Un tocco su dispositivo mobile</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">+12532050468,,86713710942# Stati Uniti</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">+12532158782,,86713710942# Stati Uniti (Tacoma)</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">---</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">Componi in base alla tua posizione</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&bull; +1 253 205 0468 Stati Uniti</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&bull; +1 253 215 8782 Stati Uniti (Tacoma)</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&bull; +1 301 715 8592 Stati Uniti (Washington DC)</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&bull; +1 305 224 1968 Stati Uniti</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&bull; +1 309 205 3325 Stati Uniti</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&bull; +1 312 626 6799 Stati Uniti (Chicago)</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&bull; +1 346 248 7799 Stati Uniti (Houston)</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"padding:0px\">&bull; +1 3