(170, 'Conferme e novitÃ  per  la  stagione  agonistica  2024 dello  skyrunning', '<span style=\"font-size:13px; text-align:start\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"display:inline !important\"><span style=\"float:none\">L&#39;imminente apertura&nbsp; della&nbsp; stagione&nbsp; agonistica 2024&nbsp; dello&nbsp; skyrunning, si&nbsp; preannuncia&nbsp; ancora&nbsp; pi&ugrave; ricca&nbsp; ed&nbsp; entusiasmante.<br />\r\nIn&nbsp; linea&nbsp; con&nbsp; la&nbsp; crescita&nbsp; &nbsp;del&nbsp; movimento ,&nbsp; il&nbsp; Consiglio&nbsp; Nazionale&nbsp; &nbsp;tenutosi&nbsp; in&nbsp; data&nbsp; 20&nbsp; Dicembre&nbsp; u.s.&nbsp; ha&nbsp; deliberato:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:13px; text-align:start\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"display:inline !important\"><span style=\"float:none\">- <strong>riconfermato&nbsp; il&nbsp; montepremi&nbsp; per&nbsp; il&nbsp; Circuito&nbsp; &quot;CRAZY Skysnow Italy Cup&quot;&nbsp; di&nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; 3.000,00&nbsp; cos&igrave;&nbsp; suddiviso</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&euro;&nbsp; 700,00&nbsp; per&nbsp; il&nbsp; 1&deg;&nbsp; M/F ,&nbsp; &nbsp;&euro;&nbsp; 500,00&nbsp; per&nbsp; il&nbsp; 2&deg;&nbsp; M/F&nbsp; e&nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; 300,00&nbsp; &nbsp;per&nbsp; il&nbsp; &nbsp;3&deg;&nbsp; M/F&nbsp; &nbsp;oltre&nbsp; ai&nbsp; montepremi&nbsp; eventualmente&nbsp; previsti&nbsp; dagli&nbsp;organizzatori&nbsp; dei&nbsp; singoli&nbsp; eventi.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nTutte e&nbsp; &nbsp;</font>3&nbsp; le&nbsp; gare&nbsp; della&nbsp; CRAZY&nbsp; Skysnow&nbsp; Italy&nbsp; Cup,&nbsp; &nbsp;concorrono&nbsp; &nbsp;alla&nbsp; classifica&nbsp; finale&nbsp; di&nbsp; Coppa e&nbsp; &nbsp;tutte&nbsp; e&nbsp; tre&nbsp; sono&nbsp; qualificative e&nbsp; di&nbsp; &nbsp;selezione&nbsp; &nbsp;</b><b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">per&nbsp; i&nbsp; Mondiali&nbsp; Skysnow&nbsp; che&nbsp; si&nbsp; disputeranno&nbsp; a&nbsp; Tarvisio&nbsp; l&#39; 8-9 Marzo 2024.</b><br style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:13px; text-align:start\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"display:inline !important\"><span style=\"float:none\">Date, regolamento&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp; link alle&nbsp; gare:&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><b style=\"color:#000000; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\">&nbsp;</b><a _djrealurl=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-SkySnow-Italy-Cup-2024\" href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-SkySnow-Italy-Cup-2024\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration:underline; color:#0000ff; font-family:Arial; font-size:13px; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; text-align:start; white-space:normal; background-color:#ffffff\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-SkySnow-Italy-Cup-2024</a><br style=\"color:#000000