-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">15/02/2026 &ndash; </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.tegliowinterrun.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"position:static !important; text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Teglio Sunset Winter Run</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><br style=\"position:static !important\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">(11 KM / 520 M D+) Prato Valentino - Teglio (SO)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Un percorso up &amp; down immerso nei boschi di Prato Valentino, rincorrendo gli ultimi raggi di sole che infuocheranno le cime delle montagne circostanti&hellip; uno spettacolo della natura! Ci sar&agrave; da divertirsi anche per i pi&ugrave; piccoli con la kids run (2008-2017) ed anche per i partecipanti alla Family Run di 4 km!</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><s