400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">13/03/2026 &ndash; </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.tarvisiotrailrunning.com/tarvisio-winter-trail-2026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"position:static !important; text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Vertical Monte Lussari</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><br style=\"position:static !important\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">(FULL 3.6 Km / 974 mD+ e SHORT 1.2 Km / 503 mD+) Tarvisio - Monte Lussari (UD)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color