family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Campionati Italiani SkySnow Assoluti, Youth e Master nella specialit&agrave; Vertical</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">14/03/2026 &ndash; </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.tarvisiotrailrunning.com/tarvisio-winter-trail-2026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"position:static !important; text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Tarvisio Winter Trail</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><br style=\"position:static !important\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">(15 Km / 515 mD+) Tarvisio - Laghi di Fusine (UD)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">15 km di percorsi immersi nella natura incontaminata, nella conca dei Laghi di Fusine al cospetto del maestoso Monte Mangart. Gara valida quale finale del Circuito 2026. Non competitiva di 10 km tra le malghe ed i laghi di Fusine. Young winter trail per bambini e ragazzi fino a 15 anni.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#221e1f\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">15 gennaio 2026</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br style=\"position:static !important\" />\r\n<br style=\"position:static !important\" />\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div style=\"margin-left:21px\">\r\n<table style=\"position:static !important; max-width:100%; border:none; border-collapse:collapse\" width=\"567\">\r\n	<colgroup style=\"position:static !important\">\r\n		<col style=\"position:static !important\" width=\"567\" />\r\n	</colgroup>\r\n	<tbody style=\"position:static !important\">\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"vertical-align:top; background-color:#f3f2f3; padding:7px; width:567px\">&nbsp;\r\n			<ul>\r\n				<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type:d