ansition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Valmadrera&nbsp;(LC)</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Crazy Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</small></strong></span><br />\r\n			<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Campionati Italiani Vertical</small></strong></span></span></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Km&nbsp; &nbsp; 3,3</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">D +&nbsp; &nbsp;1.010</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-b