nsition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Km&nbsp; &nbsp;4,7</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">D +&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 897</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">16/10/2022</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/morissolovk\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Morissolo Vertical</small></strong></a></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Vertical Kilometer</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Cannero&nbsp; Riviera (VB)</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Crazy Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</small></strong></span></span></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Km&nbsp; &nbsp; 3,9</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">D +&nbsp; &nbsp;1.070</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#d35400;\"><strong>Montepremi&nbsp; per i primi 3 classificati&nbsp; M/F&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;CRAZY&nbsp; Vertical Italy Cup&quot;&nbsp; &nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; 2.000,00</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Le&nbsp; classifiche&nbsp; del&nbsp; Circuito&nbsp; sono&nbsp; gestite&nbsp; &nbsp;da :</strong></h3>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/WEDOSPORT_LOGO.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 65px;\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_circuito.cfm?circuito=645\">Clicca qui&nbsp; per&nbsp; vedere&nbsp; le&nbsp; classifiche&nbsp;</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=645\">Clicca qui per&nbsp; vedere la&nbsp; classifica del Circuito</a></strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><font style=\"\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\">La&nbsp; &quot;CRAZY Vertical&nbsp; Italy Cup 2022 &quot; &egrave; un circuito di&nbsp; 5&nbsp; gare selezionate, con l&#39;obiettivo di&nbsp;<br />\r\npromuovere&nbsp; la&nbsp; disciplina&nbsp;&nbsp; sull&#39;intero territorio nazionale&nbsp; e&nbsp; selezionare&nbsp; gli&nbsp; atleti/e&nbsp; delle&nbsp;<br />\r\nSquadre Nazionali Skyrunning.<br />\r\nSi tratta di un circuito che laureer&agrave; i vincitori individuali delle categorie femminile e maschile,<br />\r\nassegnando i punteggi con il consueto sistema ISF (100-88-78-72-68-66-64-62-60-58-56-54-52-50<br />\r\nfino a 2 punti&nbsp; e&nbsp; fino&nbsp; alla 40&deg; posizione)&nbsp;&nbsp; e considerando per il computo finale i migliori <font color=\"#ff0000\">3</font></font></font><font color=\"#212529\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"> punteggi.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nA parit&agrave; di punteggio finale far&agrave; testo il&nbsp; punteggio&nbsp; oltre&nbsp; il&nbsp; 3&deg;.&nbsp;<br />\r\nI primi tre classificati/e&nbsp; sono tenuti/e&nbsp; a&nbsp; presenziare alla cerimonia finale di&nbsp; premiazione, pena<br />\r\nla&nbsp; non&nbsp; attribuzione&nbsp;&nbsp; dei&nbsp; premi gara. &nbsp;</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">NOTE: </strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: justify;\">Le gare del presente calendario dovranno essere organizzate nel pieno rispetto dell&#39;ordinanza del Ministro della Salute del 28 Aprile 2022 (GU Serie Generale n. 100 del 30/04/2022) <span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.125px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"overflow: auto;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"display: block;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Tutte le gare in calendario applicano il </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Regolamento-FISky-2022\">regolamento FISky,</a></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> pertanto per partecipare &egrave; necessario </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 13.125px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">essere iscritti alla FISky con <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti\">affiliazione annuale </a>o <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\">tesseramento giornaliero </a> Il <strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\">tesseramento giornaliero</a></strong> , per chi non &egrave; ancora affiliato alla FISky, &egrave; effettuabile al momento dell&#39;iscrizione alla gara. Si ricorda che non sono attive convenzioni FISky con Federazioni Sportive Nazionali o con Enti di Promozione Sportiva. </font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#d35400;\"><strong>Selezione squadre nazionali</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nNella stagione agonistica 2022, cos&igrave; come iniziato nel 2016, saranno selezionati gli Skyrunner che saranno chiamati a far parte delle Rappresentative Nazionali che parteciperanno ai&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://snowrunning.es/en/skysnow-world-championships/\">Campionati Mondiali SkySnow</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>in Spagna -<strong>&nbsp;(Sierra Nevada&nbsp;) - il 4 e 5 Febbraio 2022 ,</strong>&nbsp;ai<strong>&nbsp; Campionati Mondiali Giovanili&nbsp;</strong>nel Principato<strong>&nbsp;</strong>di Andorra&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;Luglio 2022</strong>&nbsp;e<strong>&nbsp;</strong>ai&nbsp;<strong>Campionati Mondiali Assoluti&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;in Italia&nbsp;<strong>(Val d&#39;Ossola)&nbsp; - il&nbsp; 9 -10 - 11&nbsp; Settembre 2022&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\nAl fine di selezionare nella maniera pi&ugrave; oggettiva possibile gli Skyrunner che saranno convocati ai&nbsp; suddetti Campionati, il Consiglio Federale FISky terr&agrave; conto:<br />\r\na) dei risultati ottenuti&nbsp; nei<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Campionati-Italiani\">&nbsp;Campionati&nbsp; Italiani</a>&nbsp; e&nbsp; nelle gare&nbsp; della&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-SkySnow-Italy-Cup-2022\">CRAZY SkySnow Italy Cup</a>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Vertical-Italy-Cup-2022\">CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Skyrunning-Italy-Cup-2022\">CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup&nbsp;</a><br />\r\nb) della&nbsp; partecipazione&nbsp;&nbsp;alle&nbsp; attivit&agrave;&nbsp; programmate dal&nbsp;&nbsp;Direttore&nbsp; Sportivo, ivi compresi raduni, allenamenti&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp; test.<br />\r\nc) dei risultati ottenuti nelle&nbsp;&nbsp;gare dei calendari &nbsp;FISky&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-2022\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-2022</a><br />\r\nc) della carriera sportiva nell&rsquo;ambito della FISky.</p>\r\n', 0),
