; trail 23 km - 2018&nbsp;- Badia Moscheta (FI)<br />\r\n1&deg;&nbsp; -&nbsp; MONTEROSA&nbsp;&nbsp; Skyrace&nbsp; - 2018<br />\r\n1&deg; -&nbsp; CERVINO&nbsp;&nbsp;Skyrace&nbsp; -&nbsp; 2018<br />\r\n3&deg; -&nbsp; TROMSO&nbsp;&nbsp;Skyrace - 2018 - Norvegia&nbsp;<br />\r\n1&deg; -&nbsp; CORTINA Skyrace - 2017 - Cortina (BL)<br />\r\n2&deg; - GRANSASSO&nbsp;&nbsp;Skyrace - 2017 Fonte Cerreto (AQ)<br />\r\n1&deg; -&nbsp; MUGELLO&nbsp; trail 23 km - 2017 - Badia Moscheta (FI)<br />\r\n1&deg; -&nbsp; TARTUFO Skyrun 28 km - 2017 - Calestano (PR)<br />\r\n3&deg; - World Champion. Youth - U23 skyrace - 2016 - Gransasso (AQ)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Ugazio_Marcello\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Marcello UGAZIO</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-21\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-21\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Da_Col_Manuel\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Manuel DA COL</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-37\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-37\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FINE RIGA --><!-- INIZIO RIGA -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Beltrami_Lorenzo\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Lorenzo Beltrami</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-25\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a><br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-25\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Gaggero_Gabriele\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Gabriele GAGGERO</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-26\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-26\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Lora_Matteo\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Matteo LORA</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-27\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-27\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FINE RIGA --><!-- INIZIO RIGA -->', 0);
INSERT INTO `webpages` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `status`) VALUES
(72, 'CIRCUITO YOUTH  2022', '<p><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/_A1P4342.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\nLe atlete e gli atleti di et&agrave;&nbsp; compresa&nbsp; fra&nbsp; i&nbsp; 16&nbsp; ed&nbsp; i 20&nbsp; anni&nbsp; che&nbsp; parteciperanno&nbsp; ad&nbsp; almeno&nbsp; quattro&nbsp; gare&nbsp; inserite&nbsp;&nbsp; nel&nbsp; &ldquo;CIRCUITO&nbsp; YOUTH &rdquo;&nbsp; a&nbsp; fine&nbsp; stagione 2022, riceveranno un special gift&nbsp; e saranno&nbsp; ospiti, per un weekend di tre giorni, presso il Centro Federale di&nbsp; Mezzocorona (TN)&nbsp; con&nbsp; i Campioni ed i&nbsp; preparatori atletici della Nazionale Italiana Skyrunning.</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>&ldquo;Come Federazione vogliamo incentivare le giovani ed i giovani atleti&nbsp; a cimentarsi&nbsp; nella&nbsp; nostra&nbsp; splendida&nbsp; disciplina&nbsp; e dare loro la possibilit&agrave; di &nbsp;iniziare&nbsp; in&nbsp; contesti&nbsp;&nbsp; ambientali&nbsp; straordinari ed&nbsp; eventualmente&nbsp; proseguire&nbsp; per&nbsp;&nbsp; ottenere&nbsp; grandi&nbsp; soddisfazioni da &nbsp;questo sport. D&rsquo;altra parte siamo consci che lo skyrunning &egrave; una disciplina alpinistica con elevati contenuti tecnici e di grande intensit&agrave;, per questa ragione il cammino di avvicinamento alla disciplina deve avere sempre in primo piano la salute e la crescita psicofisica dei giovani atleti. Fra gli obiettivi primari della FISKY vi &egrave; la tutela della salute dei propri ragazzi oltre allo sviluppo della disciplina. Per questo optiamo ad accompagnare i giovani a percorrere un graduale cammino di avvicinamento in funzione della loro et&agrave;&rdquo;</em>, racconta il presidente Fabio Meraldi.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Con questi presupposti la Fisky ha individuato all&rsquo;interno del proprio calendario 2022&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-2022\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-2022</a>,&nbsp; sedici gare che per distanze, dislivelli&nbsp; e&nbsp; tecnicit&agrave; rappresentano un punto di partenza per l&rsquo;avviamento delle giovani leve alla disciplina</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"Table\" style=\"width:94.2%\" width=\"94%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"padding:.8px .8px .8px .8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">14/05/2022</span></span></b></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"padding:.8px .8px .8px .8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:blue\">Monte Zerbion </span></span></span></u></b></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"padding:.8px .8px .8px .8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Sky Run</span></span></b></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"padding:.8px .8px .8px .8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Chatillon (AO)</span></span></b></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"padding:.8px .8px .8px .8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5,5</span></span></b></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td style=\"width:15%; padding:.8px .8px .8px .8p