=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;21</small></strong></span></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">D +&nbsp; &nbsp;1.920</small></strong></span></span></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">28/05/2023</small></strong></span></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.skyracedelmammut.eu/\"><strong><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">SkyRace del Mammut</small></strong></span></span></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Sky Race</small></strong></span></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight