sp; 29</small></strong></span></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">D +&nbsp; &nbsp;1.850</small></strong></span></span></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br />\r\n<strong><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">Montepremi per i primi 3 classificati&nbsp; M/F&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;CRAZY&nbsp; Skyrunning&nbsp; Italy&nbsp; Cup&nbsp; 2023&quot;&nbsp; -&nbsp;&nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; 4.000,00</span>&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><strong>Le&nbsp; classifiche del&nbsp; Circuito&nbsp; sono&nbsp; gestite&nbsp; da :</strong></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/WEDOSPORT_LOGO.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 65px;\" /></a>\r\n<strong><a href=\"https://wedosport.net/vedi_circuito.cfm?circuito=681\">\r\n Clicca qui per vedere le   classifiche 2023</a>  </strong>        <a href=\"https://wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=681\"><strong>Clicca qui per vedere  la classifica  del Circuito  2023</strong></a>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_circuito.cfm?circuito=644\"><strong>Clicca qui per  vedere  le  classifiche 2022 </strong></a>        <a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=644\"> <strong>Clicca  qui per vedere  la  classifica  del  Circuito 2022</strong> </a>\r\n\r\nLa  &quot;CRAZY <a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skyrunning\">Skyrunning</a>  Italy Cup 2023 &quot; &egrave; un circuito di  10 gare selezionate, con l&#39;obiettivo di   \r\npromuovere  la  disciplina   sull&#39;intero territorio nazionale  e  selezionare  gli  atleti/e  delle \r\nSquadre Nazionali Skyrunning.\r\nSi tratta di un circuito che laureer&agrave; i vincitori individuali delle categorie femminile e maschile, \r\nassegnando i punteggi con il consueto sistema  (100-88-78-72-68-66-64-62-60-58-56-54-52-50 \r\nfino a 1 punto  dalla 40&deg; posizione in poi)   e <strong>considerando per il computo finale i \r\nmigliori <font color=\"#ff0000\">5</font> punteggi.     A parit&agrave; di punteggio finale far&agrave; testo il  punteggio  oltre  il  5&deg;.</strong>  \r\n<strong>I primi tre classificati/e  sono tenuti/e  a  presenziare alla cerimonia finale di  premiazione, \r\npena  la  non  attribuzione   dei  premi  gara.</strong></span></span></pre>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><br />\r\n<strong>NOTE:&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\">Tutte le gare in calendario applicano il<strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Regolamento-FISky-2023\"> regolamento FISky</a></strong>, pertanto per partecipare &egrave; necessario essere iscritti alla FISky con <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti\">affiliazione annuale</a> o <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\">tesseramento giornaliero </a>. Il <strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\">tesseramento giornaliero</a></strong> , per chi non &egrave; ancora affiliato alla FISky, &egrave; effettuabile al momento dell&#39;iscrizione alla gara. Per tutte le gare ufficiali FISky &egrave; fatto obbligo agli atleti (pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica ) di iscriversi indicando: - Nome e cognome Atleta - Societ&agrave; affiliata FISky / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure: - Nome e cognome Atleta - FISky Libero / eventuale sponsor commerciale -&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; oppure:&nbsp; - Nome e cognome Atleta - Libero / eventuale sponsor </font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\">commerciale&nbsp;<br />\r\n<strong>La partecipazione ai CAMPIONATI ITALIANI delle varie specialit&agrave; &egrave; aperta a tutti, mentre l&#39;assegnazione dei titoli di Campione Italiano e dei relativi montepremi, &egrave; riservata agli atleti tesserati annuali tramite Societ&agrave; o Associazione affiliata alla FISky.</strong> <strong>Gli atleti che concorrono per i titoli devono indossare la divisa della Societ&agrave; di appartenenza, sia in gara che nella cerimonia di premiazione, pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica.</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\">Si ricorda che non sono attive convenzioni FISky con Federazioni Sportive Nazionali o con Enti di Promozione Sportiva.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#d35400;\"><strong>Selezione squadre nazionali</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Nella stagione agonistica 2023, cos&igrave; come iniziato nel 2016, saranno selezionati gli Skyrunner che saranno chiamati a far parte delle Rappresentative Nazionali che parteciperanno &nbsp;ai<strong>&nbsp; <a href=\"http://www.gransassoskyrace.it/\">Campionati Mondiali Giovanili</a> </strong>al Gran Sasso in Italia<strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;4/6 Agosto&nbsp;2023</strong>&nbsp;e<strong>&nbsp;</strong>ai&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunning-serbia.com/en/kalendar-2023/prokletije-vk-skyrace-skyultra-4-30-50km/\"><strong>Campionati Europei&nbsp;&nbsp;Assoluti&nbsp;</strong></a>&nbsp;in Montenegro&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>14/16 Luglio 2023&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\nAl fine di selezionare nella maniera pi&ugrave; oggettiva possibile gli Skyrunner che saranno convocati ai&nbsp; suddetti Campionati, il Consiglio Federale FISky terr&agrave; conto:<br />\r\na) dei risultati ottenuti&nbsp; nei&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Campionati-Italiani-2023\">&nbsp;<strong>Campionati&nbsp; Italiani&nbsp;</strong> </a>e&nbsp; nelle gare&nbsp; della&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-SkySnow-Italy-Cup-2023\"><strong>CRAZY SkySnow Italy Cup</strong></a>&nbsp;,<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Vertical-Italy-Cup-2023\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong> </a>,&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Skyrunning-Italy-Cup-2023\"><strong>CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup&nbsp;</strong></a>e&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/COPPA-ITALIA-Giovani-2023\"><strong>COPPA ITALIA&nbsp; Giovani&nbsp;</strong></a><br />\r\nb) della&nbsp; partecipazione&nbsp;&nbsp;alle&nbsp; attivit&agrave;&nbsp; programmate dal&nbsp;&nbsp;Direttore&nbsp; Sportivo (&nbsp;raduni, allenamenti&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp; test )<br />\r\nc) dei risultati ottenuti nelle&nbsp;&nbsp;gare dei <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-Gare-2023\"><strong>calendari &nbsp;FISky&nbsp;</strong><b>&nbsp;2023</b></a><br />\r\nd) della carriera sportiva nell&rsquo;ambito della FISky.</p>\r\n', 0);
INSERT INTO `webpages` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `status`) VALUES
(77, 'CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup 2023', '<h2><span style=\"color:#d35400;\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FISKY_Mezzocorona(1).jpg\" style=\"width: 820px; height: 503px;\" /><br />\r\n<br />\r\nCalendario &quot;CRAZY&nbsp; Vertical&nbsp;&nbsp;Italy&nbsp; Cup&nbsp; 2023&quot;</strong></span></h2>\r\n<br />\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Logo-Crazy-Vertical-Italy-Cup_(1).jpg\" style=\"width: 340px; height: 101px;\" /><br />\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<table border=\"2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; border-collapse: collapse; color: rgb(119, 129, 145); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 960px;\">\r\n	<tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">13/05/2023</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.montezerbionskyrace.com/\"><strong><small>Monte Zerbion Vertical&nbsp;</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Doppio Vertical Kilometer</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Chatillons (AO)</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Crazy Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</small></strong></span></span></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Km&nbsp; &nbsp; 9,5</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">D +&nbsp; 2.200</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">10/06/2023</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.chaligneskyrace.com/\"><strong><small>Chaligne Skyrace</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Vertical Kilometer</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Sarre (AO)</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Crazy Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</small></strong></span></span></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Km&nbsp; &nbsp; 5</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">D +&nbsp; 1.036</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">24/06/2023</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p><a href=\"https://www.k2valtellina.it/\"><strong><small>K2 Valtellina Extreme Vertical Race</small></strong></a></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Doppio Vertical Kilometer</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Talamona (SO)</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Crazy Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</small></strong></span><br />\r\n			<span style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\"><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">Campionati Italiani Doppio Vertical<br />\r\n			Assoluti e di Categoria</span></small></strong><span style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></sp