orissolovk\"><strong><small>Morissolo Vertical</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Vertical Kilometer</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Cannero&nbsp; Riviera (VB)</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Crazy Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</small></strong></span></span></span></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">Km&nbsp; &nbsp; 3,9</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><small style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-size:12px; font-weight:400\">D +&nbsp; 1.070</small></strong></span></span></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#d35400;\"><strong>Montepremi&nbsp; per i primi 3 classificati&nbsp; M/F&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &quot;CRAZY&nbsp; Vertical Italy Cup&quot;&nbsp; &nbsp; &euro;&nbsp; 2.000,00</strong></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Le&nbsp; classifiche&nbsp; del&nbsp; Circuito&nbsp; sono&nbsp; gestite&nbsp; &nbsp;da :</strong></h3>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/WEDOSPORT_LOGO.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 65px;\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><strong><a href=\"https://wedosport.net/vedi_circuito.cfm?circuito=682\">Clicca qui per vedere le classifiche 2023</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=682\">Clicca qui per vedere la classifica del Circuito 2023</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_circuito.cfm?circuito=645\">Clicca qui&nbsp; per&nbsp; vedere&nbsp; le&nbsp; classifiche 2022&nbsp;</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=645\">Clicca qui per&nbsp; vedere la&nbsp; classifica del Circuito&nbsp;2022</a></strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><font style=\"\"><font style=\"box-sizing: border-box; transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\">La&nbsp; &quot;CRAZY Vertical&nbsp; Italy Cup 2023&nbsp;&quot; &egrave; un circuito di&nbsp; 6&nbsp; gare selezionate, con l&#39;obiettivo di&nbsp;<br />\r\npromuovere&nbsp; la&nbsp; disciplina&nbsp;&nbsp; sull&#39;intero territorio nazionale&nbsp; e&nbsp; selezionare&nbsp; gli&nbsp; atleti/e&nbsp; delle&nbsp;<br />\r\nSquadre Nazionali Skyrunning.<br />\r\nSi tratta di un circuito che laureer&agrave; i vincitori individuali delle categorie femminile e maschile,<br />\r\nassegnando i punteggi con il consueto sistema &nbsp;(100-88-78-72-68-66-64-62-60-58-56-54-52-50<br />\r\nfino a 1&nbsp;punto&nbsp; dalla 40&deg; posizione in poi)&nbsp;&nbsp; e <strong>considerando per il computo finale i migliori <font color=\"#ff0000\">3</font></strong></font></font><strong><font color=\"#212529\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"> punteggi.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nA parit&agrave; di punteggio finale far&agrave; testo il&nbsp; punteggio&nbsp; oltre&nbsp; il&nbsp; 3&deg;.&nbsp;<br />\r\nI primi tre classificati/e&nbsp; sono tenuti/e&nbsp; a&nbsp; presenziare alla cerimonia finale di&nbsp; premiazione, pena<br />\r\nla&nbsp; non&nbsp; attribuzione&nbsp;&nbsp; dei&nbsp; premi gara. &nbsp;</font></font></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><br />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">NOTE: </strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\">Tutte le gare in calendario applicano il<strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Regolamento-FISky-2023\"> regolamento FISky</a></strong>, pertanto per partecipare &egrave; necessario essere iscritti alla FISky con <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti\">affiliazione annuale</a> o <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\">tesseramento giornaliero </a>. Il <strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\">tesseramento giornaliero</a></strong> , per chi non &egrave; ancora affiliato alla FISky, &egrave; effettuabile al momento dell&#39;iscrizione alla gara. Per tutte le gare ufficiali FISky &egrave; fatto obbligo agli atleti (pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica ) di iscriversi indicando:<br />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - Societ&agrave; affiliata FISky / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure :<br />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - FISky Libero / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure:<br />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - Libero / eventuale sponsor </font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\">commerciale<br />\r\n<strong>La partecipazione ai CAMPIONATI ITALIANI delle varie specialit&agrave; &egrave; aperta a tutti, mentre l&#39;assegnazione dei titoli di Campione Italiano e dei relativi montepremi, &egrave; riservata agli atleti tesserati annuali tramite Societ&agrave; o Associazione affiliata alla FISky.</strong> <strong>Gli atleti che concorrono per i titoli devono indossare la divisa della Societ&agrave; di appartenenza, sia in gara che nella cerimonia di premiazione, pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica.</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\">Si ricorda che non sono attive convenzioni FISky con Federazioni Sportive Nazionali o con Enti di Promozione Sportiva.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#d35400;\"><strong>Selezione squadre nazionali</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Nella stagione agonistica 2023, cos&igrave; come iniziato nel 2016, saranno selezionati gli Skyrunner che saranno chiamati a far parte delle Rappresentative Nazionali che parteciperanno &nbsp;ai<strong>&nbsp; <a href=\"http://www.gransassoskyrace.it/\">Campionati Mondiali Giovanili</a> </strong>al Gran Sasso in Italia<strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;4/6 Agosto&nbsp;2023</strong>&nbsp;e<strong>&nbsp;</strong>ai&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunning-serbia.com/en/kalendar-2023/prokletije-vk-skyrace-skyultra-4-30-50km/\">Campionati Europei&nbsp;&nbsp;Assoluti</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;in Montenegro&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>14/16 Luglio 2023&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\nAl fine di selezionare nella maniera pi&ugrave; oggettiva possibile gli Skyrunner che saranno convocati ai&nbsp; suddetti Campionati, il Consiglio Federale FISky terr&agrave; conto:<br />\r\na) dei risultati ottenuti&nbsp; nei&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Campionati-Italiani-2023\">&nbsp;<strong>Campionati&nbsp; Italiani</strong>&nbsp;</a> e&nbsp; nelle gare&nbsp; della&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-SkySnow-Italy-Cup-2023\"><strong>CRAZY SkySnow Italy Cup</strong></a>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Vertical-Italy-Cup-2023\"><strong>CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</strong></a>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Skyrunning-Italy-Cup-2023\"><strong>CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup&nbsp;</strong></a>e&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/COPPA-ITALIA-Giovani-2023\"><strong>COPPA ITALIA&nbsp; Giovani&nbsp;</strong></a><br />\r\nb) della&nbsp; partecipazione&nbsp;&nbsp;alle&nbsp; attivit&agrave;&nbsp; programmate dal&nbsp;&nbsp;Direttore&nbsp; Sportivo&nbsp; (&nbsp;raduni, allenamenti&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp; test )<br />\r\nc) dei risultati ottenuti nelle&nbsp;&nbsp;gare dei <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-Gare-2023\"><strong>calendari &nbsp;FISky 2023</strong></a><br />\r\nd) della carriera sportiva nell&rsquo;ambito della FISky.</p>\r\n', 0),
(78, 'COPPA ITALIA  Giovani   2023 Supported by  LOACKER', '<p><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/_A1P4342.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px;\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><strong>Calendario &quot;COPPA ITALIA&nbsp; Giovani&nbsp; YOUTH&nbsp; A&nbsp; e&nbsp; B&nbsp; 2023&quot; Supported by&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Logo_Loacker_Heritage_Shield_RGB_(1).png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 62px;\" /></strong></span></h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<table border=\"2\" style=\"width: 850px;\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>26/03/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"http://www.skydelcanto2.it/\"><strong><small>Sky del Canto K 13&nbsp;</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">Sky</span></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Carvico (BG)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>COPPA ITALIA Giovani&nbsp; YOUTH A e B</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>&nbsp; Km&nbsp; &nbsp;12,5</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>D +&nbsp; 600</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>13/05/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.montezerbionskyrace.com/\"><strong><small>Monte Zerbion Vertical&nbsp;</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Vertical&nbsp;</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Chatillons (AO)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>COPPA ITALIA Giovani&nbsp;&nbsp;YOUTH A e B</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp;5,5</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>D +&nbsp; 850</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>10/06/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.chaligneskyrace.com/\"><strong><small>Chaligne Skyrace</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Vertical&nbsp;</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Sarre (AO)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>COPPA ITALIA Giovani&nbsp;&nbsp;YOUTH A e B</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp;3</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>D +&nbsp; 590</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>02/09/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.rosettaskyrace.it/\"><strong><small>Valgerola Vertical</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Vertical&nbsp;</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Rasura (SO)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>COPPA ITALIA Giovani&nbsp;&nbsp;YOUTH A e B</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>&nbsp; Km&nbsp; &nbsp;2,5</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>D +&nbsp; 606</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>09/09/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.frasassiskyrace.com/\"><strong><small>Frasassi Sky</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">Sky</span></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Frasassi (AN)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>COPPA ITALIA Giovani&nbsp;&nbsp;YOUTH A e B</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; 11</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>D +&nbsp; 650</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>01/10/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"http://www.tartufotrail.it/index.php?lang=it\"><strong><small>Tartufo&nbsp; Running Sky&nbsp;</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">Sky</span></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Calestano (PR)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>COPPA ITALIA Giovani&nbsp; YOUTH A e B</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; 9</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>D +&nbsp; 460</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>22/10/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/morissolovk\"><strong><small>Morissolo Vertical</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Vertical&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Cannero&nbsp; Riviera (VB)&nbsp;&nbsp;</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>COPPA ITALIA Giovani&nbsp;&nbsp;YOUTH A e B&nbsp;</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; 2&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>D +&nbsp; 570&nbsp;&nbsp;</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Le&nbsp; classifiche&nbsp; del&nbsp; Circuito&nbsp; sono&nbsp; gestite&nbsp; &nbsp;da :</strong></h3>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/WEDOSPORT_LOGO.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 65px;\" /></a>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><strong><a href=\"https://wedosport.net/vedi_circuito.cfm?circuito=685\">Clicca&nbsp; qui per&nbsp; vedere&nbsp; le&nbsp; calssifiche&nbsp; 2023&nbsp; &nbsp;</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=685\">Clicca&nbsp; qui per&nbsp; vedere&nbsp; la&nbsp; calssifica del&nbsp; circuito&nbsp;&nbsp; 2023</a></strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom:10px; text-align:justify\"><br />\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">La&nbsp; &quot;<strong>COPPA ITALIA Giovani YOUTH A&nbsp; e&nbsp; B&nbsp;</strong>&quot; &egrave; un circuito di&nbsp;<strong> 7&nbsp; gare</strong> selezionate, con l&#39;obiettivo di&nbsp;<br />\r\npromuovere&nbsp; la&nbsp; disciplina&nbsp; fra&nbsp; i&nbsp; giovani,&nbsp;&nbsp;sull&#39;intero territorio nazionale&nbsp; e&nbsp; selezionare&nbsp; gli&nbsp;<br />\r\natleti/e&nbsp; della&nbsp; &nbsp;Squadra&nbsp;Nazionale&nbsp; Giovanile.<br />\r\nSi tratta di un circuito che laureer&agrave; i vincitori individuali delle categorie femminile e maschile,<br />\r\nassegnando i punteggi con il consueto sistema ma&nbsp;</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#212529\">maggiorato&nbsp;del&nbsp; 50 % : (150-132-117-108-102-<br />\r\n99-96-93-90-87-84-81-78-75 e a&nbsp; scalare fino a 2 punti&nbsp; dalla 40&deg; posizione in&nbsp; poi)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">&nbsp; &nbsp;e<br />\r\n<strong>considerando per il computo finale i migliori <font color=\"#ff0000\">4</font></strong></font></font><strong><font color=\"#212529\"><font style=\"color:#212529\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">&nbsp;punteggi.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nA parit&agrave; di punteggio finale far&agrave; testo il&nbsp; punteggio&nbsp; oltre&nbsp; il&nbsp; 4&deg;.&nbsp;<br />\r\nI primi tre classificati/e&nbsp; sono tenuti/e&nbsp; a&nbsp; presenziare alla cerimonia finale di&nbsp; premiazione,<br />\r\npena la&nbsp; non&nbsp; attribuzione&nbsp;&nbsp; dei&nbsp; premi gara.&nbsp; &nbsp; Per accedere&nbsp; alla&nbsp; premiazione occorrono&nbsp; almeno due risultati&nbsp; utili.</font></font></font></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n<strong>La premiazione&nbsp; prevede materiali&nbsp; tecnici&nbsp; e&nbsp; prodotti&nbsp; in&nbsp; natura.<br />\r\nLa partecipazione alle&nbsp; gare&nbsp; di&nbsp; questo&nbsp; Circuito&nbsp; &egrave;&nbsp; aperta&nbsp; ad&nbsp; atleti /e di&nbsp; tutte&nbsp; le&nbsp; et&agrave;,&nbsp; ma&nbsp; dovr&agrave; essere prevista&nbsp; una&nbsp; classifica&nbsp; specifica&nbsp; per&nbsp; la&nbsp; categoria&nbsp; YOUTH A&nbsp; (nati dal 1&deg; Gennaio 2007&nbsp; al&nbsp; 31 Dicembre 2008) e per&nbsp; la&nbsp; categoria&nbsp; YOUTH&nbsp; B&nbsp; (nati dal 1&deg; Gennaio 2005&nbsp; al&nbsp; 31 Dicembre 2006)<br />\r\nParametri&nbsp; al&nbsp; link:&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Categorie-Atleti-2023-e-Parametri-Gara\">Categorie-Atleti-2023-e-Parametri Gara</a></strong>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom:10px; text-align:justify\"><br />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">NOTE: </strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\">Tutte le gare in calendario applicano il<strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Regolamento-FISky-2023\"> regolamento FISky</a></strong>, pertanto per partecipare &egrave; necessario essere iscritti alla FISky con <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti\">affiliazione annuale</a> o <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\">tesseramento giornaliero </a>. Il <strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\">tesseramento giornaliero</a></strong> , per chi non &egrave; ancora affiliato alla FISky, &egrave; effettuabile al momento dell&#39;iscrizione alla gara. Per tutte le gare ufficiali FISky &egrave; fatto obbligo agli atleti (pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica ) di iscriversi indicando:<br />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - Societ&agrave; affiliata FISky / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure :<br />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - FISky Libero / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure:<br />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - Libero / eventuale sponsor </font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\">commerciale<br />\r\n<strong>La partecipazione ai CAMPIONATI ITALIANI delle varie specialit&agrave; &egrave; aperta a tutti, mentre l&#39;assegnazione dei titoli di Campione Italiano e dei relativi montepremi, &egrave; riservata agli atleti tesserati annuali tramite Societ&agrave; o Associazione affiliata alla FISky.</strong> <strong>Gli atleti che concorrono per i titoli devono indossare la divisa della Societ&agrave; di appartenenza, sia in gara che nella cerimonia di premiazione, pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica.</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\">Si ricorda che non sono attive convenzioni FISky con Federazioni Sportive Nazionali o con Enti di Promozione Sportiva.</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom:10px; text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#d35400\"><strong>Selezione squadre nazionali</strong></span></h2>\r\nNella stagione agonistica 2023, cos&igrave; come iniziato nel 2016, saranno selezionati gli Skyrunner che saranno chiamati a far parte delle Rappresentative Nazionali che parteciperanno &nbsp;ai<strong>&nbsp; <a href=\"http://www.gransassoskyrace.it/\">Campionati Mondiali Giovanili</a> </strong>al Gran Sasso in Italia<strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;4/6 Agosto&nbsp;2023</strong>&nbsp;e<strong>&nbsp;</strong>ai&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunning-serbia.com/en/kalendar-2023/prokletije-vk-skyrace-skyultra-4-30-50km/\">Campionati Europei&nbsp;&nbsp;Assoluti</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;in Montenegro&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>14/16 Luglio 2023&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\nAl fine di selezionare nella maniera pi&ugrave; oggettiva possibile gli Skyrunner che saranno convocati ai&nbsp; suddetti Campionati, il Consiglio Federale FISky terr&agrave; conto:<br />\r\na) dei risultati ottenuti&nbsp; nei&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Campionati-Italiani-2023\">&nbsp;<strong>Campionati&nbsp; Italiani</strong>&nbsp;</a> e&nbsp; nelle gare&nbsp; della&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-SkySnow-Italy-Cup-2023\"><strong>CRAZY SkySnow Italy Cup</strong></a>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Vertical-Italy-Cup-2023\"><strong>CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</strong></a>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Skyrunning-Italy-Cup-2023\"><strong>CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup&nbsp;</strong></a>e&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/COPPA-ITALIA-Giovani-2023\"><strong>COPPA ITALIA&nbsp; Giovani&nbsp;</strong></a><br />\r\nb) della&nbsp; partecipazione&nbsp;&nbsp;alle&nbsp; attivit&agrave;&nbsp; programmate dal&nbsp;&nbsp;Direttore&nbsp; Sportivo&nbsp; (&nbsp;raduni, allenamenti&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp; test )<br />\r\nc) dei risultati ottenuti nelle&nbsp;&nbsp;gare dei <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-Gare-2023\"><strong>calendari &nbsp;FISky 2023</strong></a><br />\r\nd) della carriera sportiva nell&rsquo;ambito della FISky.<br />\r\n&nbsp;', 0);
INSERT INTO `webpages` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `status`) VALUES
(79, 'Campionati Italiani 2023', '<p><span style=\"color:#c0392b\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/FRASASSI_Skyrace.jpg\" style=\"height: 400px; width: 600px;\" /></strong></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#c0392b\"><strong>Campionati Italiani Assoluti, U23 e Master 2023</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 1050px;\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>18/02/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.monterosaww.com/skysnow\"><strong><small>Gressoney Weissrunner</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>SkySnow Classic</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Gressoney (AO)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">Campionati Italiani SkySnow Classic<br />\r\n			Assoluti e di Categoria</span></small></strong><br />\r\n			<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><strong><small>Crazy SkySnow Italy Cup&nbsp;</small></strong></span></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;9</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 700</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>18/03/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Luse SkySnow&nbsp; Vertical</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>SkySnow Vertical</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Domobianca Domodossola (VB)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">Campionati Italiani SkySnow Vertical<br />\r\n			Assoluti e di Categoria</span></small></strong><br />\r\n			<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><strong><small>Crazy SkySnow Italy Cup&nbsp;</small></strong></span></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 650</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>13/05/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.montezerbionskyrace.com/\"><strong><small>Monte Zerbion Skyrace</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Sky Race</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Chatillon (AO)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">Campionati Italiani Skyrace<br />\r\n			Assoluti e di Categoria</span></small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;22</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp;2.200</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p><strong><small>18/06/2023</small></strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p><a href=\"https://www.valtartano.com/rally-estivo-della-valtartano/\"><strong><small>Rally estivo della Valtartano - gara a coppie</small></strong></a></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p><strong><small>Sky Race</small></strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p><strong><small>Tartano (SO)</small></strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><strong><small>Campionati Italiani Sky Race a coppie</small></strong></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;23</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp;1.550</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>22/07/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://orobieskyraid.it/\"><strong><small>International Orobie Skyraid</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Ultra&nbsp;Sky Marathon</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Valcanale / Valbodnione (BG)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">Campionati Italiani UltraSkyMarathon<br />\r\n			Assoluti e di categoria</span></small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;47</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp;3.200</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>24/06/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.k2valtellina.it/\"><strong><small>K2 Valtellina Extreme Vertical Race</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">&nbsp;<strong>Doppio&nbsp;</strong></span><strong><small>Vertical Kilometer</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Talamona (SO)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><strong><small>Campionati Italiani Doppio Vertical</small></strong></span></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 9&nbsp;</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp;2.000</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>02/09/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.rosettaskyrace.it/\"><strong><small>Valgerola Vertical</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Vertical Kilometer</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Rasura&nbsp;(SO)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">Campionati Italiani Vertical<br />\r\n			Assoluti e di Categoria</span><br />\r\n			<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">Crazy Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</span></small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; 3,3</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp;1.010</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>03/09/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"http://www.magaskymarathon.it/\"><strong><small>Maga Skymarathon</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Sky Marathon</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Serina (BG)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><strong><small>Campionati Italiani SkyMarathon<br />\r\n			Assoluti e di Categoria</small></strong></span></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;39</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp;3.000</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><small>10/11/2023</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"http://https://cutpuglia.it/\"><strong><small>Cut Vertical</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Skyspeed</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Castellaneta (TA)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><strong><small>Campionati Italiani Skyspeed</small></strong></span></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; 0,4</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 140</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>NOTE :</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify; margin-bottom:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:500\"><span style=\"line-height:28px\"><span style=\"color:#0a2759\"><span style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transiti