tps://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\">affiliazione annuale</a>&nbsp;o&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\">tesseramento giornaliero&nbsp;</a>. Il&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\">tesseramento giornaliero</a></strong>&nbsp;, per chi non &egrave; ancora affiliato alla FISky, &egrave; effettuabile al momento dell&#39;iscrizione alla gara. Per tutte le gare ufficiali FISky &egrave; fatto obbligo agli atleti (pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica ) di iscriversi indicando:<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - Societ&agrave; affiliata FISky / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure :<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - FISky Libero / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure:<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - Libero / eventuale sponsor&nbsp;</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\">commerciale<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">La partecipazione ai CAMPIONATI ITALIANI delle varie specialit&agrave; &egrave; aperta a tutti, mentre l&#39;assegnazione dei titoli di Campione Italiano e dei relativi montepremi, &egrave; riservata agli atleti tesserati annuali tramite Societ&agrave; o Associazione affiliata alla FISky.</strong>&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">Gli atleti che concorrono per i titoli devono indossare la divisa della Societ&agrave; di appartenenza, sia in gara che nella cerimonia di premiazione, pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica.</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">Si ricorda che non sono attive convenzioni FISky con Federazioni Sportive Nazionali o con Enti di Promozione Sportiva.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><strong>Selezione squadre nazionali</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Nella stagione agonistica 2023, cos&igrave; come iniziato nel 2016, saranno selezionati gli Skyrunner che saranno chiamati a far parte delle Rappresentative Nazionali che parteciperanno &nbsp;ai<strong>&nbsp; <a href=\"http://www.gransassoskyrace.it/\">Campionati Mondiali Giovanili&nbsp;</a></strong>al Gran Sasso in Italia<strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;4/6 Agosto&nbsp;2023</strong>&nbsp;e<strong>&nbsp;</strong>ai&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunning-serbia.com/en/kalendar-2023/prokletije-vk-skyrace-skyultra-4-30-50km/\">Campionati Europei&nbsp;&nbsp;Assoluti</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;in Montenegro&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>14/16 Luglio 2023&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\nAl fine di selezionare nella maniera pi&ugrave; oggettiva possibile gli Skyrunner che saranno convocati ai&nbsp; suddetti Campionati, il Consiglio Federale FISky terr&agrave; conto:<br />\r\na) dei risultati ottenuti&nbsp; nei&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Campionati-Italiani-2023\">&nbsp;<strong>Campionati&nbsp; Italiani</strong></a><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/admin/Webpages/edit/79\">&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;e&nbsp; nelle gare&nbsp; della&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-SkySnow-Italy-Cup-2023\"><strong>CRAZY SkySnow Italy Cup</strong></a>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Vertical-Italy-Cup-2023\"><strong>CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</strong></a>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/CRAZY-Skyrunning-Italy-Cup-2023\"><strong>CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup&nbsp;</strong></a>&nbsp;e&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/COPPA-ITALIA-Giovani-2023\"><strong>COPPA ITALIA&nbsp; Giovani&nbsp;</strong></a><br />\r\nb) della&nbsp; partecipazione&nbsp;&nbsp;alle&nbsp; attivit&agrave;&nbsp; programmate dal&nbsp;&nbsp;Direttore&nbsp; Sportivo&nbsp; (&nbsp;raduni, allenamenti&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp; test )<br />\r\nc) dei risultati ottenuti nelle&nbsp;&nbsp;gare dei <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Calendario-Gare-2023\"><strong>calendari &nbsp;FISky 2023</strong></a><br />\r\nd) della carriera sportiva nell&rsquo;ambito della FISky.</p>\r\n', 0);
