></strong></small></td>\r\n			<td><small><strong>Paralympic&nbsp; Vertical</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td><small><strong>Acquasanta - Mele (GE)</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small><strong>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; 4,7</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td><small><strong>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 897</strong></small></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<pre>\r\n\r\n\r\n<strong>NOTE :</strong>\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">Tutte le gare in calendario applicano il<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Regolamento-FISky-2023\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\"> regolamento FISky</a></strong>, pertanto per partecipare &egrave; necessario \r\nessere iscritti alla FISky con <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\">affiliazione annuale</a> o <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\">tesseramento giornaliero </a>. \r\nIl <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\">tesseramento giornaliero</a></strong> , per chi non &egrave; ancora affiliato alla FISky, &egrave; effettuabile al momento \r\ndell&#39;iscrizione alla gara. Per tutte le gare ufficiali FISky &egrave; fatto obbligo agli atleti \r\n(pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica ) di iscriversi indicando:\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - Societ&agrave; affiliata FISky / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure :\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - FISky Libero / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure:\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - Libero / eventuale sponsor </font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\">commerciale\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">La partecipazione ai CAMPIONATI ITALIANI delle varie specialit&agrave; &egrave; aperta a tutti, mentre \r\nl&#39;assegnazione dei titoli di Campione Italiano e dei relativi montepremi, &egrave; riservata agli atleti \r\ntesserati annuali tramite Societ&agrave; o Associazione affiliata alla FISky.</strong> \r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">Gli atleti che concorrono per i titoli devono indossare la divisa della Societ&agrave; di appartenenza, \r\nsia in gara che nella cerimonia di premiazione, pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica.</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\r\n\r\n\r\n</pre>\r\n\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n', 0);
