 href=\"https://cutpuglia.it/cut-vertical-campionato-italiano-sky-speed-race/\"><small><strong>Cut Vertical</strong></small></a></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span><strong><small>Sky Speed</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><small><strong>Castellaneta&nbsp; (TA)</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\"><strong><small>Campionati Italiani Skyspeed</small></strong></span></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; 0,3</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 100</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left; margin-bottom:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:500\"><span style=\"line-height:32px\"><span style=\"color:#0a2759\"><span style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">NOTE:</strong><span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">Tutte le gare in calendario applicano il<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Regolamento-FISky-2024\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\">regolamento FISky</a></strong>, pertanto per partecipare &egrave; necessario essere iscritti alla FISky con&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\">affiliazione annuale</a></strong>&nbsp;o&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">tesseramento giornaliero</strong></a>&nbsp;. Il&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\">tesseramento giornaliero</a></strong>&nbsp;, per chi non &egrave; ancora affiliato alla FISky, &egrave; effettuabile al momento dell&#39;iscrizione alla gara.&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">Per tutte le gare ufficiali FISky &egrave; fatto obbligo agli atleti (pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica ) di iscriversi indicando:</strong></font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\">- Nome e cognome Atleta - Societ&agrave; affiliata FISky / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure :<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - FISky Libero / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure:<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - Libero / eventuale sponsor&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\">commerciale</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">La partecipazione ai CAMPIONATI ITALIANI delle varie specialit&agrave; &egrave; aperta a tutti, mentre l&#39;assegnazione dei titoli di Campione Italiano e dei relativi montepremi, &egrave; riservata agli atleti tesserati annuali tramite Societ&agrave; o Associazione affiliata alla FISky.</strong>&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">Gli atleti che concorrono per i titoli devono indossare la divisa della Societ&agrave; di appartenenza, sia in gara che nella cerimonia di premiazione, pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica.</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">Si ricorda che non sono attive convenzioni FISky con Federazioni Sportive Nazionali o con Enti di Promozione Sportiva.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left; margin-bottom:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:500\"><span style=\"line-height:32px\"><span style=\"color:#0a2759\"><span style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">Selezione squadre nazionali</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align:justify; margin-bottom:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"color:#778191\"><span style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\">Nella stagione agonistica 2024, cos&igrave; come iniziato nel 2016, saranno selezionati gli Skyrunner che saranno chiamati a far parte delle Rappresentative Nazionali che parteciperanno &nbsp;ai<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">&nbsp;<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\nCampionati Mondiali Giovanili&nbsp;</strong>a Bar&nbsp;&nbsp;in Montenegro il&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">&nbsp;&nbsp;28-29-30 Giungo 2024&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;e<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">&nbsp;</strong>ai&nbsp;<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">Campionati Mondiali&nbsp; Assoluti&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;a Soria in Spagna&nbsp;&nbsp;il&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">6-7-8 Settembre &nbsp;2024&nbsp;</strong><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\nAl fine di selezionare nella maniera pi&ugrave; oggettiva possibile gli Skyrunner che saranno convocati ai&nbsp; suddetti Campionati, il Consiglio Federale FISky terr&agrave; conto:<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\na) dei risultati ottenuti&nbsp; nei&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">Campionati&nbsp; Italiani</strong>&nbsp; e&nbsp; nelle gare&nbsp; della&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">CRAZY SkySnow Italy Cup</strong>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">CRAZY Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup&nbsp;</strong>e&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">COPPA ITALIA&nbsp; Giovani e SNS</strong><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\nb) della&nbsp; partecipazione&nbsp;&nbsp;alle&nbsp; attivit&agrave;&nbsp; programmate dal&nbsp;&nbsp;Direttore&nbsp; Sportivo&nbsp; (&nbsp;raduni, allenamenti&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp; test )<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\nc) dei risultati ottenuti nelle&nbsp;&nbsp;gare dei&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">calendari &nbsp;FISky 2024</strong><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\nd) della carriera sportiva nell&rsquo;ambito della FISky.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;</h3>\r\n', 1),
(107, 'Ranking FISky Skyrunning 2024', '<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Monterosa_W_45_PH_Stefano_Jeantet-7.jpg\" style=\"width: 650px; height: 433px;\" />\r\n<h3><br />\r\n<strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/files/FISky_-_Categorie_maschili_2024.pdf\">CATEGORIE&nbsp; FISky&nbsp; -&nbsp; Maschili&nbsp; -&nbsp; aggiornato&nbsp; al&nbsp; 31 Dicembre 2024</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/files/FISky_-_Categorie_femminili_2024.pdf\">CATEGORIE&nbsp; FISky&nbsp; -&nbsp; Femminili -&nbsp; aggiornato&nbsp; al 31 Dicembre 2024</a></strong></h3>\r\nIl Ranking FISky Skyrunning 2024 &egrave;&nbsp; calcolato in&nbsp; base ai risultati ottenuti&nbsp; nelle&nbsp; gare&nbsp; del&nbsp; calendario ufficiale&nbsp; FISky.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Le Categorie sono assegnate&nbsp; in base alla differenza percentuale del tempo ottenuto rispetto al record della gara.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; E&#39; considerato record della gara il minor tempo assoluto ottenuto da atleta italiano/a&nbsp; /F e M)<br />\r\nPrima categoria FISky : entro il 112,5% del record della gara&nbsp; (F e M )<br />\r\nSeconda categoria FISky : entro il 125,0% del record della gara&nbsp; (F e M )<br />\r\nTerza categoria FISky ; entro il 137,5% del record della&nbsp; gara (F e M)<br />\r\nQuarta&nbsp; categoria&nbsp; FISky : entro il&nbsp; 150,0% del record della gara (F e M )<br />\r\nGli&nbsp; atleti / e con tempi&nbsp; oltre&nbsp; il 150% del record della gara&nbsp; sono&nbsp; considerati &quot;Non Classificati&quot;<br />\r\nNota: la partecipazione di atleti di alto livello, anche &quot;Non Classificati&quot; che&nbsp; miglioreranno i record delle gare selezionate per&nbsp; l&#39;anno in corso, innalzer&agrave; progressivamente il livello delle&nbsp; singole categorie.<br />\r\nNota: obiettivo dell&#39;assegnazione delle Categorie FISky &egrave; l&#39;innalzamento del livello tecnico dello Skyrunning in Italia.<br />\r\nNota: in caso di assegnazione di categorie diverse per&nbsp; una&nbsp; stessa tipologia di gara, vale il risultato migliore.<br />\r\nNota: eventuali errori o omissioni possono essere&nbsp; segnalati&nbsp; alla&nbsp; FISky alla&nbsp; mail :&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:federazione@skyrunningitalia.it\">federazione@skyrunningitalia.it</a>&nbsp;', 1),
(101, 'NORTEC  SkySnow  Running Cup  2025', '<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/MONTE_LUSSARI_SKYSNOW.JPG\" style=\"width: 730px; height: 482px;\" />\r\n<h2><br />\r\n<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><strong>Calendario &quot;NORTEC&nbsp; SkySnow&nbsp; Running&nbsp;Cup 2025&quot;</strong></span></h2>\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp;\r\n\r\n<h1>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Coppa_Italia_Fisky_Skysnow_Logo_color_pictogram.png\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px;\" />&nbsp;<em><strong> NORTEC&nbsp; SkySnow&nbsp; Running&nbsp; Cup&nbsp;</strong></em></h1>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<table border=\"2\" style=\"width: 900px;\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>18/01/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.snowmanresinelli.it/\"><strong><small>Snow Run Resinelli&nbsp;</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>SkySnow Classic</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>Piani di Resinelli (LC)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup&nbsp;</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;14</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; 650</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>01/02/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.gressoneymonterosa.it/esperienze/weissrunner-2025-28071\"><strong><small>Gressoney Weissrunner</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>SkySnow Classic</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Gressoney (AO)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><font color=\"#c0392b\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">&nbsp;</span></font></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;9</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; 700</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>01/02/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.gressoneymonterosa.it/esperienze/weissrunner-2025-28071\"><strong><small>Gressoney Weissrunner</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>SkySnow Vertical</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Gressoney (AO)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup&nbsp;</small><br />\r\n			<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><small>Campionato Italiano&nbsp; SkySnow Vertical</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; 700</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>15/02/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.tegliowinterrun.com/\"><strong><small>Teglio Sunset Winter Run</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>SkySnow Classic</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Prato Valentino - Teglio (SO)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup&nbsp;</small><br />\r\n			<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><small>Campionato Italiano&nbsp; SkySnow Classic</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>&nbsp; Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;10</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;520</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>01/03/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.schiamontecaio.it/skysnowschia.html\"><strong><small>SkySnow Schia Monte Caio&nbsp;</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>SkySnow Classic</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Schia Tizzano Val Parma (PR)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">&nbsp;</span><small>NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup&nbsp;</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp;10,8</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; 800</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>01/03/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.schiamontecaio.it/skysnowschia.html\"><strong><small>SkySnow Schia Monte Caio&nbsp;</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>SkySnow Classic</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Schia Tizzano Val Parma (PR)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;6,2</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; 390</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>14/03/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.tarvisiotrailrunning.com/it/tarvisio-winter-trail-2024/\"><strong><small>Tarvisio Winter Trail</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>SkySnow Vertical</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Tarvisio - Monte Lussari</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup&nbsp;</small><br />\r\n			<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><small>European SkySnow Championship</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3,6</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; 970</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>15/03/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.tarvisiotrailrunning.com/it/tarvisio-winter-trail-2024/\"><strong><small>Tarvisio Winter Trail</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>SkySnow Classic</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>Tarvisio - Fusine</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>NORTEC SkySnow Running Cup&nbsp;</small><br />\r\n			<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><small>European SkySnow Championship</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 15</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; 530</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><strong>Montepremi per i primi 3 classificati&nbsp; M/F&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\r\n&quot;NORTEC&nbsp;SkySnow&nbsp; Running&nbsp; Cup&quot;&nbsp; &nbsp;&euro;&nbsp; 3.000,00&nbsp;</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2><br />\r\n<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><strong>Gadget del circuito :</strong></span></h2>\r\n<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><strong>a&nbsp; tutti&nbsp; i&nbsp; concorrenti&nbsp; che avranno portato a termine almeno 4&nbsp; prove,&nbsp; con partecipazione obbligatoria alla finale, verr&agrave; assegnato quale&nbsp; riconoscimento &quot;Finisher NORTEC SKY SNOW RUNNING CUP 2025&quot;<br />\r\nuna&nbsp; felpa&nbsp; personalizzata con i loghi del circuito.&nbsp; Scelta&nbsp; della taglia salvo disponibilit&agrave;. Prenotazione taglia entro il 31.01.2025 inviando una&nbsp; mail a :&nbsp; info@nortecsport.com</strong></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><strong>Le classifiche del Circuito&nbsp; sono&nbsp; gestite&nbsp; da:&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/WEDOSPORT_LOGO.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 65px;\" /></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_circuito.cfm?circuito=770\"><strong>Clicca qui per vedere&nbsp; le classifiche 2025</strong>&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=770\"><strong>Clicca&nbsp; qui per&nbsp; la classifica del Circuito 2025</strong></a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://wedosport.net/vedi_circuito.cfm?circuito=734\"><strong>Clicca qui per vedere&nbsp; le classifiche 2024</strong>&nbsp; </a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=734\"><strong>Clicca&nbsp; qui per&nbsp; la classifica del Circuito 2024</strong></a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_circuito.cfm?circuito=680\"><strong>Clicca qui per vedere&nbsp; le classifiche 2023</strong></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=680\"><strong>Clicca&nbsp; qui per&nbsp; la classifica del Circuito 2023</strong></a><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong><a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_circuito.cfm?circuito=643\">Clicca&nbsp; qui&nbsp; per vedere le classifiche 2022</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.wedosport.net/vedi_classifica_circuito.cfm?circuito=643\">Clicca qui&nbsp; per la classifica del Circuito 2022</a>&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Regolamento&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Regolamento-SkySnow\">https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Regolamento-SkySnow</a></strong>\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px; text-align:justify\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#212529\">La  &quot;NORTEC  SkySnow  Running Cup 2025 &quot; &egrave; un circuito di  SEI   gare, con l&#39;obiettivo di  \r\npromuovere  la  disciplina   sull&#39;intero territorio nazionale  e  selezionare  gli  atleti/e  delle  \r\nSquadre Nazionali Skyrunning.\r\nSi tratta di un circuito che laurer&agrave; i vincitori individuali delle categorie femminile e maschile, \r\nassegnando i punteggi con il consueto sistema  (100-88-78-72-68-66-64-62-60-58-56-54-52-50 \r\nfino a 1 punto  dalla 40&deg; posizione in  poi )  <strong>considerando per il computo finale i migliori  </strong></font><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><strong>4</strong></span>\r\n<font color=\"#212529\"><strong>punteggi. A parit&agrave; di punteggio finale far&agrave; testo il punteggio olre  il  4&deg;</strong></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#212529\"><strong>I primi tre classificati/e  sono tenuti/e  a  presenziare alla cerimonia finale di  premiazione, \r\nche si terr&agrave; nell&#39;ultima gara del circuito, pena la  non  attribuzione   dei  premi gara.  \r\nTutte  le gare sono qualificative e  di selezione per i ampionati  Europei  Skysnow che si \r\ndisputeranno a  Tarvisio il 14 e 15 Marzo 2025.</strong>\r\n\r\n\r\n<strong>NOTE: </strong>\r\nTutte le gare in calendario applicano il  <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Regolamento-FISky-2025\"><strong>regolamento FISky</strong></a>, pertanto per partecipare &egrave; necessario \r\nessere iscritti alla FISky con <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti\">affiliazione annuale</a> o <a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\">tesseramento giornaliero </a>.\r\nIl <strong><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\">tesseramento giornaliero</a></strong> , per chi non &egrave; ancora affiliato alla FISky, &egrave; effettuabile al momento \r\ndell&#39;iscrizione alla gara.   Per tutte le gare ufficiali FISky &egrave; fatto obbligo agli atleti  (pena l&#39;esclusione\r\ndalla classifica ) di  iscriversi indicando:\r\n</font><strong><span style=\"color:#d35400;\">- Nome e cognome Atleta - Societ&agrave; affiliata FISky / eventuale sponsor commerciale    -  oppure :\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - FISky  Libero / eventuale sponsor commerciale   -  oppure:\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - Libero / eventuale sponsor </span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><strong><span style=\"color:#d35400;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">commerciale</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<strong>La partecipazione ai  CAMPIONATI  ITALIANI delle varie specialit&agrave; &egrave; aperta a tutti, mentre \r\nl&#39;assegnazione dei titoli di Campione Italiano e dei relativi montepremi, &egrave; riservata agli atleti \r\ntesserati  annuali tramite  Societ&agrave; o Associazione affiliata alla FISky.</strong> \r\n<strong>Gli atleti che concorrono per  i titoli devono indossare la  divisa della Societ&agrave; di appartenenza, \r\nsia in gara che nella cerimonia di  premiazione, pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica.</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif, Arial, Verdana, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 13px;\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#212529\">Si ricorda che  non sono attive convenzioni FISky con Federazioni Sportive \r\nNazionali o con Enti di Promozione Sportiva.\r\n</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\r\n</pre>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Selezione squadre nazionali</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Nella stagione agonistica 2025, cos&igrave; come in precedenza, saranno selezionati gli Skyrunner che saranno chiamati a far parte delle Rappresentative Nazionali che parteciperanno &nbsp;ai<strong>&nbsp;<br />\r\nCampionati Europei </strong>a Tarvisio il&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp; 14 e 15 Marzo&nbsp;2025<br />\r\nCampionati Europei </strong>a&nbsp;Corteno Golgi (BS)&nbsp; il&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>3-5&nbsp;Luglio 2025</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Campionati Mondiali Giovanili </strong>al Gran Sasso&nbsp;&nbsp;il&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp; 1-2 e 3 Agosto 2025&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\nAl fine di selezionare nella maniera pi&ugrave; oggettiva possibile gli Skyrunner che saranno convocati ai&nbsp; suddetti Campionati, il Consiglio Federale FISky terr&agrave; conto:<br />\r\na) dei risultati ottenuti&nbsp; nei&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Campionati&nbsp; Italiani</strong>&nbsp; e&nbsp; nelle gare&nbsp; della&nbsp; <strong>&nbsp;NORTEC SkySnow Running&nbsp;Cup</strong>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Skyrunning Italy Cup,&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>COPPA ITALIA&nbsp; Giovani e SNS-National Series</strong><br />\r\nb) della&nbsp; partecipazione&nbsp;&nbsp;alle&nbsp; attivit&agrave;&nbsp; programmate dal&nbsp;&nbsp;Direttore&nbsp; Sportivo&nbsp; (&nbsp;raduni, allenamenti&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp; test )<br />\r\nc) dei risultati ottenuti nelle&nbsp;&nbsp;gare dei <strong>calendari &nbsp;FISky 2025</strong><br />\r\nd) della carriera sportiva nell&rsquo;ambito della FISky.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#212529\">&nbsp;</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;', 1);
INSERT INTO `webpages` (`id`, `title`, `text`, `status`) VALUES
(109, 'Atlete/i Nazionale Senior 2026', '<!-- INIZIO RIGA -->\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Broggi_Benedetta(1).jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Benedetta BROGGI</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-49\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-49\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/De_Giuli_Margherita.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Margherita DE GIULI</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-21\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-21\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/ATLETA_DONNA1.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Laura BASILE</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-32\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-32\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FINE RIGA --><!-- INIZIO RIGA -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Ghirardi_Corinna(1).jpg\" /></