es</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-2\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Vitale_Chiara.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Chiara VITALE</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-52\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-52\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FINE RIGA --><!-- INIZIO RIGA -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Arrigoni_Luca.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Luca ARRIGONI</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-8\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-8\">5&deg; EUROPEAN CHAMP. MAGA Ultraskymarathon 2019<br />\r\n2&deg; Tofeo Monte Chaberton Skyrace 2019<br />\r\n1&deg; Trial Grigne Sud Skymarathon 2019<br />\r\n3&deg; Devil skyrace 2019</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Anselmi_Matteo(1).jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Matteo ANSELMI</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-53\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-53\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Ghiano_Gianluca(1).jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Gianluca GHIANO</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-54\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a><br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-54\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FINE RIGA --><!-- INIZIO RIGA -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Del_Pero_Luca(1).jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Luca DEL PERO</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-38\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-38\">9&deg; Resegup - 2019<br />\r\n1&deg; Valgandino Vertical - 2019<br />\r\n2&deg; CAMPIONATO ITALIANO Assoluti VK - Valgoglio - 2019</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Beltrami_Lorenzo.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Lorenzo Beltrami</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-25\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a><br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-25\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Brambilla_Danilo.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Danilo BRAMBILLA</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-7\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-7\">6&deg; - RESEGUP - 24 km &ndash; 2019<br />\r\n16&deg; - LIVIGNO SKYMARATHON - 31 km &ndash; 2019<br />\r\n9&deg; - OLYMPUS MARATHON - 44 km &ndash; Grecia - 2019<br />\r\n11&deg; - CAMP.EUROPEO ULTRA SKYMARATHON &ndash; Maga &ndash; 2019<br />\r\n7&deg; - ZACUP - 27 km &ndash; 2019<br />\r\n11&deg; - PIRIN ULTRASKYMARATHON &ndash; 66 km- Bulgaria &ndash; 2019<br />\r\n49&deg; - ZEGAMA AIZKORRI - 42 km &ndash; Spagna - 2018<br />\r\n1&deg; - TRAIL GRIGNE SUDT &ndash; 38 km - 2018<br />\r\n11&deg; - LIMONE EXTREME SKYRACE - 2018</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FINE RIGA --><!-- INIZIO RIGA -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/ATLETA_UOMO1.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Giuseppe PEDRETTI</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-55\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-55\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/ATLETA_UOMO1.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Luca COMPAGNONI</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-60\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-60\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Minoggio_Cristian.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Cristian MINOGGIO</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-10\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-10\">1&deg; -&nbsp;EUROPEAN CHAMPION- MAGA Ultraskymarathon 2019<br />\r\n1&deg; - TARTUFO SkyMarathon 52 Km - 2019 - Calestano (PR)<br />\r\n2&deg; - EUROPEAN CHAMPION - Pisao Extreme -Portogallo 2021</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FINE RIGA --><!-- INIZIO RIGA -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Ugazio_Marcello(1).jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Marcello UGAZIO</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-21\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-21\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/ATLETA_UOMO1.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Luca LAFRANCONI</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-63\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-63\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/ATLETA_UOMO1.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Daniel THEDY</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-56\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-56\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FINE RIGA --><!-- INIZIO RIGA !-->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-xl-4 col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"team-block mb30\">\r\n<div class=\"team-img mb30\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Foto_Atleti/Rigo_Alex.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"team-content text-center\">\r\n<h3>Alex RIGO</h3>\r\n<a class=\"open-popup-link\" href=\"#popup-69\"><small class=\"designation\">Palmares</small></a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white-popup mfp-hide\" id=\"popup-69\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- FINE RIGA --><!-- INIZIO RIGA -->', 1),
(102, 'CRAZY Skyrunning Italy Cup 2025', '<h3><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/SKY_CLIMB_MEZZALAMA.JPG\" style=\"width: 700px; height: 405px;\" /></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color:#d35400;\"><strong>&nbsp; Calendario &quot; CRAZY Skyrunning&nbsp; Italy&nbsp; Cup&nbsp; 2025&quot;</strong></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><img src=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/files/images/Logo-Crazy-Skyrunning-Italy-Cup_(2).jpg\" style=\"font-size: 13px; width: 400px; height: 118px;\" /></h2>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 1040px;\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small><strong>23/03/2025</strong></small></span></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"http://www.skydelcanto2.it/\"><small><strong>Sky del Canto&nbsp; CLASSIC</strong></small></a></td>\r\n			<td><small><strong>Sky Race</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td><small><strong>Carvico (BG)</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td><small><strong style=\"color: rgb(39, 174, 96);\">Skyrunning Italy Cup</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small><strong>Km&nbsp; &nbsp;21,4</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<small><strong>D +&nbsp; 1.280</strong></small></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\"><b>06/04/2025</b></span></span></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"http://www.traildeicorni.it/\"><small><strong>Trail dei Corni</strong></small></a></td>\r\n			<td><small><strong>SkyTrail</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td><small><strong>Valbrona&nbsp; (CO)</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td><small><strong style=\"color: rgb(39, 174, 96);\">Skyrunning Italy Cup</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small><strong>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26</strong></small></td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;<small><strong>D +&nbsp;&nbsp; 1.900</strong></small></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><s