td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;47</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp;3.600</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>06/09/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small><a href=\"https://www.frasassiskyrace.com/\">Frasassi Mini Sky</a></small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">&nbsp;</span><small>SkyTrail</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">&nbsp;</span><small>Frasassi (AN)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">Campionati Italiani Sky&nbsp; YOUTH A e B</span><br />\r\n			<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">Coppa Italia YOUTH A e B</span></small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;11</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 670</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>05/10/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><a href=\"http://www.tartufotrail.it/index.php?lang=it\"><small>Tartufo Running</small></a></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>&nbsp;SkyMarathon</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>&nbsp;Calestano&nbsp; (PR)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">Campionati Italiani SkyMarathon<br />\r\n			Assoluti e di categoria</span></small></strong><br />\r\n			<small><span style=\"color:#27ae60;\"><strong>Finale Skyrunning Italy Cup</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#27ae60;\">&nbsp;</span> </strong></small></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;43</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp;2.240</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>19/10/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><a href=\"https://www.morissolovertikal.com/\"><strong><small>Morissolo Vertical</small></strong></a></td>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">&nbsp;</span><small>Vertical</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small>&nbsp;Cannero Riviera (VB)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">Campionati Italiani Vertical<br />\r\n			Assoluti e di Categoria</span></small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp;3,7</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp;1.070</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><small>02/11/2025</small></span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/p/VTV-Vertical-Tube-Villeneuve-100076303270146/\"><small>VTV Vertical Tube Villeneuve</small></a></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">&nbsp;Vertical</span></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">&nbsp;</span><small>Villeneuve (AO)</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong><small><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\">Campionati Italiani Vertical YOUTH A e B&nbsp;</span><br />\r\n			<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">Coppa Italia YOUTH A e B</span></small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>Km&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1,9</small></strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>&nbsp;<small>D +&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;650</small></strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left; margin-bottom:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:500\"><span style=\"line-height:32px\"><span style=\"color:#0a2759\"><span style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">NOTE:</strong><span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">Tutte le gare in calendario applicano il<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Regolamento-FISky-2025\">regolamento FISky</a></strong>, pertanto per partecipare &egrave; necessario essere iscritti alla FISky con&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Atleti\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\">affiliazione annuale</a></strong>&nbsp;o&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">tesseramento giornaliero</strong></a>&nbsp;. Il&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><a href=\"https://www.skyrunningitalia.it/pages/Tesseramento-Giornaliero\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; color:#f51f8a; text-decoration:none\">tesseramento giornaliero</a></strong>&nbsp;, per chi non &egrave; ancora affiliato alla FISky, &egrave; effettuabile al momento dell&#39;iscrizione alla gara.&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">Per tutte le gare ufficiali FISky &egrave; fatto obbligo agli atleti (pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica ) di iscriversi indicando:</strong></font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\">- Nome e cognome Atleta - Societ&agrave; affiliata FISky / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure :<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - FISky Libero / eventuale sponsor commerciale - oppure:<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n- Nome e cognome Atleta - Libero / eventuale sponsor&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\">commerciale</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\" />\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">La partecipazione ai CAMPIONATI ITALIANI delle varie specialit&agrave; &egrave; aperta a tutti, mentre l&#39;assegnazione dei titoli di Campione Italiano e dei relativi montepremi, &egrave; riservata agli atleti tesserati annuali tramite Societ&agrave; o Associazione affiliata alla FISky.</strong>&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">Gli atleti che concorrono per i titoli devono indossare la divisa della Societ&agrave; di appartenenza, sia in gara che nella cerimonia di premiazione, pena l&#39;esclusione dalla classifica.</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:13.125px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"overflow:auto\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#212529\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\">Si ricorda che non sono attive convenzioni FISky con Federazioni Sportive Nazionali o con Enti di Promozione Sportiva.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left; margin-bottom:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s\"><span style=\"font-weight:500\"><span style=\"line-height:32px\"><span style=\"color:#0a2759\"><span style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; transition:all 0.3s ease-in-out 0s; font-weight:600\">Selezione squadre nazionali</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Nella stagione agonistica 2025, cos&igrave; come in precedenza, saranno selezionati gli Skyrunner che saranno chiamati a far parte delle Rappresentative Nazionali che parteciperanno &nbsp;ai<strong>&nbsp;<br />\r\nCampionati Europei </strong>a Tarvisio il&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp; 14 e 15 Marzo&nbsp;2025<br />\r\nCampionati Europei </strong>a Corteno Golgi (BS)&nbsp; il&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>3-5 Luglio 2025</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Campionati Mondiali Giovanili </strong>al Gran Sasso&nbsp;&nbsp;il&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp; 1-2 e 3 Agosto 2025&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\nAl fine di selezionare nella maniera pi&ugrave; oggettiva possibile gli Skyrunner che saranno convocati ai&nbsp; suddetti Campionati, il Consiglio Federale FISky terr&agrave; conto:<br />\r\na) dei risultati ottenuti&nbsp; nei&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Campionati&nbsp; Italiani</strong>&nbsp; e&nbsp; nelle gare&nbsp; della&nbsp; <strong>&nbsp;NORTEC SkySnow Running&nbsp;Cup</strong>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;Vertical Italy Cup&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;,&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Skyrunning Italy Cup,&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>COPPA ITALIA&nbsp; Giovani e SNS-National Series</strong><br />\r\nb) della&nbsp; partecipazione&nbsp;&nbsp;alle&nbsp; attivit&agrave;&nbsp; programmate dal&nbsp;&nbsp;Direttore&nbsp; Sportivo&nbsp; (&nbsp;raduni, allenamenti&nbsp; &nbsp;e&nbsp; test )<br />\r\nc) dei risultati ottenuti nelle&nbsp;&nbsp;gare dei <strong>calendari &nbsp;FISky 2025</strong><br />\r\nd) della carriera sportiva nell&rsquo;ambito della FISky.</p>\r\n', 1);
